package org.hermesmobile.app.ui

import androidx.compose.runtime.*
import org.hermesmobile.app.data.AppPreferences

/** Independent English, Simplified Chinese and accented Hanyu Pinyin entries. */
enum class Words(val en: String, val zh: String, val pin: String) {
    HelpDemo("Turn Demo mode off in Signal Grove’s Settings → Server before connecting to Hermes.","连接 Hermes 前，在 Signal Grove 设置 → 服务器中关闭演示模式。","Liánjiē Hermes qián, zài Signal Grove shèzhì → fúwùqì zhōng guānbì yǎnshì móshì."),
    HelpTailnet("On the phone, open the Android Tailscale app and connect to the same private tailnet as the Hermes host.","在手机上打开 Android Tailscale 应用，连接到与 Hermes 主机相同的私有尾网。","Zài shǒujī shàng dǎkāi Android Tailscale yìngyòng, liánjiē dào yǔ Hermes zhǔjī xiāngtóng de sīyǒu wěiwǎng."),
    HelpUrl("Enter the host’s HTTPS API base URL in phone Settings → Server. Omit /v1 and preserve the configured profile or proxy path prefix.","在手机设置 → 服务器中输入主机的 HTTPS API 基础网址。不要添加 /v1，并保留已配置的档案或代理路径前缀。","Zài shǒujī shèzhì → fúwùqì zhōng shūrù zhǔjī de HTTPS API jīchǔ wǎngzhǐ. Bú yào tiānjiā /v1, bìng bǎoliú yǐ pèizhì de dàng’àn huò dàilǐ lùjìng qiánzhuì."),
    HelpKey("Use API_SERVER_KEY in the phone’s API key field. Provider keys and dashboard passwords belong to separate services. Keep credentials out of chats.","在手机 API 密钥字段中使用 API_SERVER_KEY。提供商密钥和控制台密码属于不同服务。不要将凭据放入聊天。","Zài shǒujī API mìyào zìduàn zhōng shǐyòng API_SERVER_KEY. Tígōngshāng mìyào hé kòngzhìtái mìmǎ shǔyú bùtóng fúwù. Bú yào jiāng píngjù fàngrù liáotiān."),
    HelpConnect("Choose Save & test connection in Signal Grove. Allow Android local-network access if requested.","在 Signal Grove 中选择保存并测试连接。若 Android 请求本地网络访问权限，请予以允许。","Zài Signal Grove zhōng xuǎnzé bǎocún bìng cèshì liánjiē. Ruò Android qǐngqiú běndì wǎngluò fǎngwèn quánxiàn, qǐng yǔyǐ yǔnxǔ."),
    HelpHostStatus("On the Hermes host, run tailscale status to inspect its tailnet connection. The phone uses the Android Tailscale app.","在 Hermes 主机上运行 tailscale status 检查尾网连接。手机使用 Android Tailscale 应用。","Zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng yùnxíng tailscale status jiǎnchá wěiwǎng liánjiē. Shǒujī shǐyòng Android Tailscale yìngyòng."),
    HelpHostServe("On the Hermes host, inspect tailscale serve status and its loopback API listener before changing HTTPS forwarding.","在 Hermes 主机上检查 tailscale serve status 和回环 API 监听器，再考虑更改 HTTPS 转发。","Zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng jiǎnchá tailscale serve status hé huíhuán API jiāntīngqì, zài kǎolǜ gēnggǎi HTTPS zhuǎnfā."),
    HelpPrivate("On the host, use private Tailscale Serve HTTPS access and preserve existing mappings. Keep Funnel and router port forwarding disabled.","在主机上使用私有 Tailscale Serve HTTPS 访问，并保留现有映射。保持 Funnel 和路由器端口转发关闭。","Zài zhǔjī shàng shǐyòng sīyǒu Tailscale Serve HTTPS fǎngwèn, bìng bǎoliú xiànyǒu yìngshè. Bǎochí Funnel hé lùyóuqì duānkǒu zhuǎnfā guānbì."),
    HelpTls("On the phone, use the correct HTTPS hostname and certificate and keep TLS validation enabled. A saved URL alone does not prove connectivity.","在手机上使用正确的 HTTPS 主机名和证书，并保持 TLS 验证启用。仅有已保存网址不能证明连接正常。","Zài shǒujī shàng shǐyòng zhèngquè de HTTPS zhǔjīmíng hé zhèngshū, bìng bǎochí TLS yànzhèng qǐyòng. Jǐn yǒu yǐ bǎocún wǎngzhǐ bù néng zhèngmíng liánjiē zhèngcháng."),
    HelpHostApi("On the Hermes host, enable the API in the intended profile, bind it to loopback and keep an existing strong API_SERVER_KEY. Check active work before restarting the gateway.","在 Hermes 主机的目标档案中启用 API，绑定回环地址并保留现有强 API_SERVER_KEY。重启网关前检查正在进行的工作。","Zài Hermes zhǔjī de mùbiāo dàng’àn zhōng qǐyòng API, bǎngdìng huíhuán dìzhǐ bìng bǎoliú xiànyǒu qiáng API_SERVER_KEY. Chóngqǐ wǎngguān qián jiǎnchá zhèngzài jìnxíng de gōngzuò."),
    HelpAuthCheck("For HTTP 401, check that the API key belongs to the intended Hermes connection and profile. Dashboard sign-in uses separate credentials.","遇到 HTTP 401 时，检查 API 密钥是否属于目标 Hermes 连接和档案。控制台登录使用独立凭据。","Yùdào HTTP 401 shí, jiǎnchá API mìyào shìfǒu shǔyú mùbiāo Hermes liánjiē hé dàng’àn. Kòngzhìtái dēnglù shǐyòng dúlì píngjù."),
    HelpDashboard("Use the separate dashboard sign-in for Hermes management on the phone. Do not substitute its password for API_SERVER_KEY.","在手机上使用独立的控制台登录进行 Hermes 管理。不要用该密码替代 API_SERVER_KEY。","Zài shǒujī shàng shǐyòng dúlì de kòngzhìtái dēnglù jìnxíng Hermes guǎnlǐ. Bú yào yòng gāi mìmǎ tìdài API_SERVER_KEY."),
    HelpAutoModel("In the Hermes-connected Chat screen, choose sliders → Automatic · use serving model → Apply to new turns.","在连接 Hermes 的聊天屏幕中选择滑块 → 自动使用服务中的模型 → 应用于新请求。","Zài liánjiē Hermes de liáotiān píngmù zhōng xuǎnzé huákuài → zìdòng shǐyòng fúwù zhōng de móxíng → yìngyòng yú xīn qǐngqiú."),
    HelpModelStatus("In Hermes Chat → Models & connection, compare verified serving model, server default and requested model. Check the observation time.","在 Hermes 聊天 → 模型与连接中，对比已验证服务模型、服务器默认模型和请求模型，并检查观察时间。","Zài Hermes liáotiān → móxíng yǔ liánjiē zhōng, duìbǐ yǐ yànzhèng fúwù móxíng, fúwùqì mòrèn móxíng hé qǐngqiú móxíng, bìng jiǎnchá guānchá shíjiān."),
    HelpModelLock("Inspect a conflicting session model lock in Hermes. Selecting a model in Signal Grove does not clear a server lock.","在 Hermes 中检查冲突的会话模型锁。在 Signal Grove 中选择模型不会清除服务器锁。","Zài Hermes zhōng jiǎnchá chōngtū de huìhuà móxíng suǒ. Zài Signal Grove zhōng xuǎnzé móxíng bú huì qīngchú fúwùqì suǒ."),
    HelpModelLimits("A model menu does not load server weights. Automatic needs fresh host status when its observer is available; otherwise routing stays with Hermes.","模型菜单不会加载服务器权重。观察器可用时，自动模式需要最新主机状态；否则由 Hermes 管理路由。","Móxíng càidān bú huì jiāzài fúwùqì quánzhòng. Guāncháqì kěyòng shí, zìdòng móshì xūyào zuìxīn zhǔjī zhuàngtài; fǒuzé yóu Hermes guǎnlǐ lùyóu."),
    HelpChatProfile("Select the intended Hermes connection and profile before reading server history.","读取服务器历史前，请选择目标 Hermes 连接和档案。","Dúqǔ fúwùqì lìshǐ qián, qǐng xuǎnzé mùbiāo Hermes liánjiē hé dàng’àn."),
    HelpChatHistory("In Hermes Chat, open the history clock, refresh and load older pages. Search and source filters cover only loaded rows.","在 Hermes 聊天中打开历史时钟，刷新并加载更早页面。搜索和来源筛选只覆盖已加载的记录。","Zài Hermes liáotiān zhōng dǎkāi lìshǐ shízhōng, shuāxīn bìng jiāzài gèng zǎo yèmiàn. Sōusuǒ hé láiyuán shāixuǎn zhǐ fùgài yǐ jiāzài de jìlù."),
    HelpChatReadOnly("Desktop, Discord and other non-API conversations can be read-only. Their source does not grant phone write authority.","桌面、Discord 等非 API 对话可能为只读。其来源不会授予手机写入权限。","Zhuōmiàn, Discord děng fēi API duìhuà kěnéng wéi zhǐdú. Qí láiyuán bú huì shòuyǔ shǒujī xiěrù quánxiàn."),
    HelpChatReceipts("Inspect the exact receipt before retrying uncertain work. Reading history does not require replaying an old message or creating a replacement chat.","重试结果不确定的工作前，请检查确切回执。读取历史不需要重放旧消息或创建替代聊天。","Chóngshì jiéguǒ bù quèdìng de gōngzuò qián, qǐng jiǎnchá quèqiè huízhí. Dúqǔ lìshǐ bù xūyào chóngfàng jiù xiāoxī huò chuàngjiàn tìdài liáotiān."),
    HelpProjectOpen("On the phone, open Settings → Hermes management, select the profile, then Host projects → Read stored projects and confirm the read.","在手机上打开设置 → Hermes 管理，选择档案，然后选择主机项目 → 读取已存储项目，并确认读取。","Zài shǒujī shàng dǎkāi shèzhì → Hermes guǎnlǐ, xuǎnzé dàng’àn, ránhòu xuǎnzé zhǔjī xiàngmù → dúqǔ yǐ cúnchǔ xiàngmù, bìng quèrèn dúqǔ."),
    HelpProjectDetails("Choose an existing project and refresh its details. This reads stored project metadata.","选择已有项目并刷新详情。此操作读取已保存的项目元数据。","Xuǎnzé yǐyǒu xiàngmù bìng shuāxīn xiángqíng. Cǐ cāozuò dúqǔ yǐ bǎocún de xiàngmù yuán shùjù."),
    HelpProjectWorker("Project files and application tools stay on the verified execution worker. Reading metadata on the phone does not move those files.","项目文件和应用工具保留在已验证的执行工作机上。在手机上读取元数据不会移动这些文件。","Xiàngmù wénjiàn hé yìngyòng gōngjù bǎoliú zài yǐ yànzhèng de zhíxíng gōngzuòjī shàng. Zài shǒujī shàng dúqǔ yuán shùjù bú huì yídòng zhèxiē wénjiàn."),
    HelpProjectLimits("The project-details screen reads metadata. Binding a chat to a workspace, enrolling a worker and authorizing writes are separate operations.","项目详情屏幕读取元数据。绑定聊天到工作区、注册工作机和授权写入属于不同操作。","Xiàngmù xiángqíng píngmù dúqǔ yuán shùjù. Bǎngdìng liáotiān dào gōngzuòqū, zhùcè gōngzuòjī hé shòuquán xiěrù shǔyú bùtóng cāozuò."),
    PhoneHelperOnHost("On the Hermes host","在 Hermes 主机上","Zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng"),
    PhoneHelperOnPhone("On your Android phone","在 Android 手机上","Zài Android shǒujī shàng"),
    PhoneHelperOnWorker("On the verified worker","在已验证的工作机上","Zài yǐ yànzhèng de gōngzuòjī shàng"),
    PhoneMessage("Message the phone model…","向手机模型发送消息…","Xiàng shǒujī móxíng fāsòng xiāoxī…"),
    PhoneHelperHostScope("Host only: run commands or edit .env on the Hermes agent host. On the phone use the Android Tailscale app and settings.","仅限主机：在 Hermes 智能体主机上运行命令或编辑 .env。手机使用 Android Tailscale 应用和设置。","Jǐn xiàn zhǔjī: zài Hermes zhìnéngtǐ zhǔjī shàng yùnxíng mìnglìng huò biānjí .env. Shǒujī shǐyòng Android Tailscale yìngyòng hé shèzhì."),
    PhoneHelperPhoneScope("Phone app: use Signal Grove's controls on Android. Project files and tools stay on their verified worker.","手机应用：在 Android 上使用 Signal Grove 控件。项目文件和工具保留在已验证的工作机上。","Shǒujī yìngyòng: zài Android shàng shǐyòng Signal Grove kòngjiàn. Xiàngmù wénjiàn hé gōngjù bǎoliú zài yǐ yànzhèng de gōngzuòjī shàng."),
    PhoneIssue("Review phone operation","审阅手机操作","Shěnyuè shǒujī cāozuò"),
    PhoneHelperRejected("The helper could not select valid guide checks. Use the guide below. No action was performed.","助手无法选择有效的指南检查项。请使用下方指南。未执行任何操作。","Zhùshǒu wúfǎ xuǎnzé yǒuxiào de zhǐnán jiǎnchá xiàng. Qǐng shǐyòng xiàfāng zhǐnán. Wèi zhíxíng rènhé cāozuò."),
    PhoneHelper("Setup helper","设置助手","Shèzhì zhùshǒu"),
    PhoneHelperBoundary("Choose a topic. The phone model suggests reviewed guide checks; their exact text and execution location come from the bundled guide. Review their relevance to your setup. No tools or live server access are available here.","请选择主题。手机模型建议已审阅的指南检查项；其确切文本和执行位置来自内置指南。请检查是否适合您的设置。此处没有工具或实时服务器访问权限。","Qǐng xuǎnzé zhǔtí. Shǒujī móxíng jiànyì yǐ shěnyuè de zhǐnán jiǎnchá xiàng; qí quèqiè wénběn hé zhíxíng wèizhì láizì nèizhì zhǐnán. Qǐng jiǎnchá shìfǒu shìhé nín de shèzhì. Cǐchù méiyǒu gōngjù huò shíshí fúwùqì fǎngwèn quánxiàn."),
    PhoneHelperShare("Share only the redacted phone observations shown below for this request.","仅对此请求分享下面显示的已脱敏手机观察信息。","Jǐn duì cǐ qǐngqiú fēnxiǎng xiàmiàn xiǎnshì de yǐ tuōmǐn shǒujī guānchá xìnxī."),
    PhoneHelperObservation("Phone preferences observed at {time}: Demo: {demo}; address kind: {address}; 64-bit process: {abi}; local model loaded: {model}. No server readiness or sign-in was checked.","手机偏好观察时间 {time}：演示模式：{demo}；地址类型：{address}；64 位进程：{abi}；本地模型已加载：{model}。未检查服务器就绪状态或登录。","Shǒujī piānhào guānchá shíjiān {time}: yǎnshì móshì: {demo}; dìzhǐ lèixíng: {address}; liùshísì wèi jìnchéng: {abi}; běndì móxíng yǐ jiāzài: {model}. Wèi jiǎnchá fúwùqì jiùxù zhuàngtài huò dēnglù."),
    PhoneAddressMissing("not configured","未配置","Wèi pèizhì"),
    PhoneAddressHttps("HTTPS scheme (unverified)","HTTPS 协议（未验证）","HTTPS xiéyì (wèi yànzhèng)"),
    PhoneAddressOther("other or invalid scheme","其他或无效协议","Qítā huò wúxiào xiéyì"),
