    PhoneImporting("Importing and checking model…","正在导入并检查模型…","Zhèngzài dǎorù bìng jiǎnchá móxíng…"),
    PhoneLoading("Verifying and loading model…","正在验证并加载模型…","Zhèngzài yànzhèng bìng jiāzài móxíng…"),
    PhoneUnloading("Releasing model memory…","正在释放模型内存…","Zhèngzài shìfàng móxíng nèicún…"),
    PhoneGenerating("Generating on phone…","正在手机上生成…","Zhèngzài shǒujī shàng shēngchéng…"),
    PhoneMemoryError("Not enough available memory. Close other apps or choose a smaller model. No remote fallback was used.","可用内存不足。请关闭其他应用或选择较小模型。未使用远程回退。","Kěyòng nèicún bùzú. Qǐng guānbì qítā yìngyòng huò xuǎnzé jiào xiǎo móxíng. Wèi shǐyòng yuǎnchéng huítuì."),
    PhoneContextError("This conversation exceeds the loaded context. Start a new chat or load a larger supported context. Nothing was retried.","此对话超过已加载的上下文。请新建聊天或加载更大的受支持上下文。未自动重试。","Cǐ duìhuà chāoguò yǐ jiāzài de shàngxiàwén. Qǐng xīnjiàn liáotiān huò jiāzài gèng dà de shòu zhīchí shàngxiàwén. Wèi zìdòng chóngshì."),
    PhoneStorageError("Model storage or integrity check failed. Check free space and the file's source. Your other files were preserved.","模型存储或完整性检查失败。请检查可用空间与文件来源。其他文件已保留。","Móxíng cúnchǔ huò wánzhěngxìng jiǎnchá shībài. Qǐng jiǎnchá kěyòng kōngjiān yǔ wénjiàn láiyuán. Qítā wénjiàn yǐ bǎoliú."),
    PhoneError("The phone operation failed. Stop, review model compatibility or storage, then explicitly try again. No remote request was sent.","手机操作失败。请停止并检查模型兼容性或存储，再手动重试。未发送远程请求。","Shǒujī cāozuò shībài. Qǐng tíngzhǐ bìng jiǎnchá móxíng jiānróngxìng huò cúnchǔ, zài shǒudòng chóngshì. Wèi fāsòng yuǎnchéng qǐngqiú."),
    PhoneComplete("Completed on phone","已在手机完成","Yǐ zài shǒujī wánchéng"),
    PhoneCancelled("Stopped; this question will not be replayed.","已停止；不会重放此问题。","Yǐ tíngzhǐ; bú huì chóngfàng cǐ wèntí."),
    PhoneInterrupted("Interrupted by process exit; no automatic retry.","因进程退出中断；不会自动重试。","Yīn jìnchéng tuìchū zhōngduàn; bú huì zìdòng chóngshì."),
    PhoneTokenLimit("Output limit reached; answer may be incomplete.","已达输出限制；回答可能不完整。","Yǐ dá shūchū xiànzhì; huídá kěnéng bù wánzhěng."),
    PhoneFailed("Generation failed; this question will not be replayed.","生成失败；不会重放此问题。","Shēngchéng shībài; bú huì chóngfàng cǐ wèntí."),
    PhoneReview("Review for handoff","审阅待转交内容","Shěnyuè dài zhuǎnjiāo nèiróng"),
    PhoneReviewHelp("Edit this phone-generated excerpt before copying. To share with Hermes, paste it into the intended connection and chat, review the destination, then send it yourself. No action or approval is transferred.","复制前请编辑手机生成的摘录。如需分享给 Hermes，请粘贴到目标连接和聊天，检查目标后自行发送。不会转交操作或批准。","Fùzhì qián qǐng biānjí shǒujī shēngchéng de zhāilù. Rú xū fēnxiǎng gěi Hermes, qǐng zhāntiē dào mùbiāo liánjiē hé liáotiān, jiǎnchá mùbiāo hòu zìxíng fāsòng. Bú huì zhuǎnjiāo cāozuò huò pīzhǔn."),
    PhoneCopy("Copy reviewed excerpt","复制已审阅摘录","Fùzhì yǐ shěnyuè zhāilù"),
