    WorkspaceRequestId("Mutation request ID","修改请求标识","Xiūgǎi qǐngqiú biāozhì"),
    WorkspaceChange("Change host directory","更改主机目录","Gēnggǎi zhǔjī mùlù"),
    WorkspaceReview("Review directory change","审阅目录更改","Shěnyuè mùlù gēnggǎi"),
    WorkspaceDirectory("Absolute directory on the Hermes host","Hermes 主机上的绝对目录","Hermes zhǔjī shàng de juéduì mùlù"),
    WorkspaceBefore("Previously reported directory","先前报告的目录","Xiānqián bàogào de mùlù"),
    WorkspaceRequested("Requested directory","请求的目录","Qǐngqiú de mùlù"),
    WorkspaceFences("Revision {revision} · execution generation {generation}","修订 {revision} · 执行代次 {generation}","Xiūdìng {revision} · zhíxíng dàicì {generation}"),
    WorkspaceEffect("This changes the session's execution directory and terminal policy on the Hermes host. Hermes verifies permissions, idle state and revisions. The host may normalize the path and probe Git. A Pi path does not bind a Windows worker project. A lost result is never retried automatically.","这会更改 Hermes 主机上此会话的执行目录和终端策略。Hermes 会验证权限、空闲状态和修订。主机可能规范化路径并检查 Git。Pi 路径不会绑定 Windows 工作节点项目。结果丢失时不会自动重试。","Zhè huì gēnggǎi Hermes zhǔjī shàng cǐ huìhuà de zhíxíng mùlù hé zhōngduān cèlüè. Hermes huì yànzhèng quánxiàn, kòngxián zhuàngtài hé xiūdìng. Zhǔjī kěnéng guīfànhuà lùjìng bìng jiǎnchá Git. Pi lùjìng bú huì bǎngdìng Windows gōngzuò jiédiǎn xiàngmù. Jiéguǒ diūshī shí bú huì zìdòng chóngshì."),
    WorkspaceConsent("I approve this directory change for this exact Hermes session.","我批准对此确切 Hermes 会话的目录更改。","Wǒ pīzhǔn duì cǐ quèqiè Hermes huìhuà de mùlù gēnggǎi."),
    WorkspaceInvalid("Enter a different absolute host path, without control characters (up to 8 KiB UTF-8).","请输入不同的主机绝对路径，不含控制字符（UTF-8 最多 8 KiB）。","Qǐng shūrù bùtóng de zhǔjī juéduì lùjìng, bù hán kòngzhì zìfú (UTF-8 zuìduō 8 KiB)."),
    WorkspaceUnavailable("A valid directory and usable revision are required. A reported running session cannot be changed here; Hermes still decides whether it is idle and permitted.","需要有效目录和可用修订。此处不能更改报告为运行中的会话；Hermes 仍负责判断是否空闲并获得许可。","Xūyào yǒuxiào mùlù hé kěyòng xiūdìng. Cǐchù bù néng gēnggǎi bàogào wéi yùnxíng zhōng de huìhuà; Hermes réng fùzé pànduàn shìfǒu kòngxián bìng huòdé xǔkě."),
    WorkspaceAcknowledged("Hermes acknowledged the directory change. Open a freshly reviewed viewer to read its current context. This does not verify worker binding or tool execution.","Hermes 已确认目录更改。请重新审阅并打开查看器以读取当前上下文。这不能验证工作节点绑定或工具执行。","Hermes yǐ quèrèn mùlù gēnggǎi. Qǐng chóngxīn shěnyuè bìng dǎkāi chákànqì yǐ dúqǔ dāngqián shàngxiàwén. Zhè bù néng yànzhèng gōngzuò jiédiǎn bǎngdìng huò gōngjù zhíxíng."),
    WorkspaceUncertain("The directory change could not be verified. Inspect its management receipt and the exact session in Hermes before reviewing uncertainty. Do not repeat the operation.","无法验证目录更改。请先检查其管理回执及 Hermes 中的确切会话，再审阅不确定结果。不要重复操作。","Wúfǎ yànzhèng mùlù gēnggǎi. Qǐng xiān jiǎnchá qí guǎnlǐ huízhí jí Hermes zhōng de quèqiè huìhuà, zài shěnyuè bù quèdìng jiéguǒ. Bú yào chóngfù cāozuò."),
    WorkspaceLocalReviewEffect("This only marks the uncertain directory change reviewed on this device. Inspect the exact session, mutation receipt and directory in Hermes first. It does not retry, undo or confirm execution.","这只会在本设备上将不确定的目录更改标为已检查。请先在 Hermes 中检查确切会话、修改回执及目录。不会重试、撤销或确认执行。","Zhè zhǐ huì zài běn shèbèi shàng jiāng bù quèdìng de mùlù gēnggǎi biāo wéi yǐ jiǎnchá. Qǐng xiān zài Hermes zhōng jiǎnchá quèqiè huìhuà, xiūgǎi huízhí jí mùlù. Bú huì chóngshì, chèxiāo huò quèrèn zhíxíng."),
    WorkspaceLocalReviewConsent("I inspected this session's mutation receipt and directory in Hermes.","我已在 Hermes 中检查此会话的修改回执和目录。","Wǒ yǐ zài Hermes zhōng jiǎnchá cǐ huìhuà de xiūgǎi huízhí hé mùlù."),
    ViewerWorkspace("Session workspace","会话工作区","Huìhuà gōngzuòqū"),
    ViewerWorkspaceSnapshot("Directory reported when this viewer attached. Refreshing the connection requires another explicit review.","此目录由 Hermes 在查看器连接时报告。刷新连接需要再次明确审阅。","Cǐ mùlù yóu Hermes zài chákànqì liánjiē shí bàogào. Shuāxīn liánjiē xūyào zàicì míngquè shěnyuè."),
    ViewerWorkspaceUnset("Hermes reported no directory.","Hermes 报告未设置目录。","Hermes bàogào wèi shèzhì mùlù."),
    ViewerWorkspaceUnavailable("A usable directory was not provided in this snapshot.","此快照未提供可用目录。","Cǐ kuàizhào wèi tígōng kěyòng mùlù."),
    ViewerWorkspaceBoundary("This is a directory on the Hermes authority host. It does not verify a Windows, NAS or other worker project, file access or execution permissions.","这是 Hermes 权威主机上的目录。它不能验证 Windows、NAS 或其他工作节点项目、文件访问或执行权限。","Zhè shì Hermes quánwēi zhǔjī shàng de mùlù. Tā bù néng yànzhèng Windows, NAS huò qítā gōngzuò jiédiǎn xiàngmù, wénjiàn fǎngwèn huò zhíxíng quánxiàn."),
    PhoneDraftReady("Phone draft ready","手机草稿已就绪","Shǒujī cǎogǎo yǐ jiùxù"),
    PhoneDraftNotReady("Phone draft unavailable","手机草稿不可用","Shǒujī cǎogǎo bù kěyòng"),
    PhoneDraftOpen("Use unsent draft on phone","在手机上使用未发送草稿","Zài shǒujī shàng shǐyòng wèi fāsòng cǎogǎo"),
    PhoneDraftReview("Review new phone question","审阅新的手机问题","Shěnyuè xīn de shǒujī wèntí"),
    PhoneDraftHelp("Copy only this reviewed text into a new phone conversation. Images, Hermes history, settings and approvals are excluded. Your Hermes draft stays unchanged. Choose and load a phone model, then send separately. This does not retry a failed or uncertain Hermes request.","仅将此已审阅文本复制到新的手机对话。不包含图片、Hermes 历史、设置或批准。Hermes 草稿保持不变。请选择并加载手机模型，然后单独发送。此操作不会重试失败或结果不明的 Hermes 请求。","Jǐn jiāng cǐ yǐ shěnyuè wénběn fùzhì dào xīn de shǒujī duìhuà. Bù bāohán túpiàn, Hermes lìshǐ, shèzhì huò pīzhǔn. Hermes cǎogǎo bǎochí bú biàn. Qǐng xuǎnzé bìng jiāzài shǒujī móxíng, ránhòu dāndú fāsòng. Cǐ cāozuò bú huì chóngshì shībài huò jiéguǒ bù míng de Hermes qǐngqiú."),
    PhoneDraftConfirm("Open as new phone draft","作为新手机草稿打开","Zuòwéi xīn shǒujī cǎogǎo dǎkāi"),
    PhoneDraftUnavailable("Use a new text-only question that has not been submitted. Finish checking the selected Hermes run first. Images and staged retries cannot be copied here.","请使用尚未提交的新纯文本问题。请先完成所选 Hermes 运行的状态检查。此处不能复制图片或已准备的重试内容。","Qǐng shǐyòng shàng wèi tíjiāo de xīn chún wénběn wèntí. Qǐng xiān wánchéng suǒ xuǎn Hermes yùnxíng de zhuàngtài jiǎnchá. Cǐchù bù néng fùzhì túpiàn huò yǐ zhǔnbèi de chóngshì nèiróng."),
    PhoneDraftReceived("Reviewed question copied to a new phone draft. Choose a model and send when ready; nothing was sent to Hermes.","已将审阅过的问题复制到新手机草稿。请选择模型，准备好后发送；未向 Hermes 发送任何内容。","Yǐ jiāng shěnyuè guò de wèntí fùzhì dào xīn shǒujī cǎogǎo. Qǐng xuǎnzé móxíng, zhǔnbèi hǎo hòu fāsòng; wèi xiàng Hermes fāsòng rènhé nèiróng."),
    PhoneDraftExpired("The temporary phone handoff could not be used or has expired. Your Hermes draft is retained; return and review it again. No question was sent.","临时手机交接无法使用或已过期。Hermes 草稿已保留；请返回并再次审阅。未发送问题。","Línshí shǒujī jiāojiē wúfǎ shǐyòng huò yǐ guòqī. Hermes cǎogǎo yǐ bǎoliú; qǐng fǎnhuí bìng zàicì shěnyuè. Wèi fāsòng wèntí."),
    PhoneNoHistory("No saved phone conversations.","没有已保存的手机对话。","Méiyǒu yǐ bǎocún de shǒujī duìhuà."),
    RoomsTitle("Hermes rooms","Hermes 群聊室","Hermes qúnliáo shì"),
    RoomsBoundary("Read rooms from the selected connection and profile. Room controls and decisions remain in Hermes.","读取所选连接和配置中的群聊室。群聊控制和决策仍在 Hermes 中处理。","Dúqǔ suǒ xuǎn liánjiē hé pèizhì zhōng de qúnliáo shì. Qúnliáo kòngzhì hé juécè réng zài Hermes zhōng chǔlǐ."),
    RoomsSharedScope("Some rooms are shared across profiles. Room details show their authority.","部分群聊室会在多个配置中共享。群聊室详情会显示其托管方。","Bùfen qúnliáo shì huì zài duō gè pèizhì zhōng gòngxiǎng. Qúnliáo shì xiángqíng huì xiǎnshì qí tuōguǎn fāng."),
    RoomsUnsupported("This Hermes endpoint does not offer a supported room protocol. Check its version and room configuration.","此 Hermes 端点未提供支持的群聊协议。请检查版本和群聊配置。","Cǐ Hermes duāndiǎn wèi tígōng zhīchí de qúnliáo xiéyì. Qǐng jiǎnchá bǎnběn hé qúnliáo pèizhì."),
    RoomsReadHeld("Rooms could not be read. Any previous result is from the last successful read. Refresh to try again.","无法读取群聊室。先前结果来自上次成功读取。请刷新后重试。","Wúfǎ dúqǔ qúnliáo shì. Xiānqián jiéguǒ láizì shàng cì chénggōng dúqǔ. Qǐng shuāxīn hòu chóngshì."),
