    KanbanStatusUnknown("The attempted change is unresolved. Fresh reads do not prove what that attempt did. Do not replay it blindly.","此更改尝试尚未解决。最新读取不能证明该次尝试的结果。请勿盲目重试。","Cǐ gēnggǎi chángshì shàngwèi jiějué. Zuìxīn dúqǔ bùnéng zhèngmíng gāi cì chángshì de jiéguǒ. Qǐng wù mángmù chóngshì."),
    KanbanStatusReceiptBoundary("A reported task row does not verify descendant changes, worker shutdown, file cleanup, hooks, loaded models or engineering completion.","任务记录报告不能验证后代更改、工作进程停止、文件清理、钩子、已加载模型或工程完成。","Rènwù jìlù bàogào bùnéng yànzhèng hòudài gēnggǎi, gōngzuò jìnchéng tíngzhǐ, wénjiàn qīnglǐ, gōuzi, yǐ jiāzài móxíng huò gōngchéng wánchéng."),
    KanbanStatusLatestEffect("The host acts on the task and its latest graph at write time. Preflight is not an atomic run lock.","主机在写入时作用于任务及其最新关系图。预检不是原子运行锁。","Zhǔjī zài xiěrù shí zuòyòng yú rènwù jí qí zuìxīn guānxì tú. Yùjiǎn bú shì yuánzǐ yùnxíng suǒ."),
    KanbanStatusRefusalEffect("A host refusal may still append an audit event. A lost reply can leave the outcome unknown.","主机拒绝仍可能追加审计事件。回复丢失可能导致结果未知。","Zhǔjī jùjué réng kěnéng zhuījiā shěnjì shìjiàn. Huífù diūshī kěnéng dǎozhì jiéguǒ wèizhī."),
    KanbanStatusCloseEffect("The host may close the current attempt.","主机可能关闭当前尝试。","Zhǔjī kěnéng guānbì dāngqián chángshì."),
    KanbanStatusForceEffect("Completion or review can override a live worker claim.","完成或审查可能覆盖活动工作进程的认领。","Wánchéng huò shěnchá kěnéng fùgài huódòng gōngzuò jìnchéng de rènlǐng."),
    KanbanStatusTerminateEffect("The host may request termination of this task or affected descendant workers.","主机可能请求终止此任务或受影响的后代工作进程。","Zhǔjī kěnéng qǐngqiú zhōngzhǐ cǐ rènwù huò shòu yǐngxiǎng de hòudài gōngzuò jìnchéng."),
    KanbanStatusContinueEffect("Workers may continue despite the task status. Process shutdown is not verified.","尽管任务状态改变，工作进程仍可能继续。未验证进程停止。","Jǐnguǎn rènwù zhuàngtài gǎibiàn, gōngzuò jìnchéng réng kěnéng jìxù. Wèi yànzhèng jìnchéng tíngzhǐ."),
    KanbanStatusQueueEffect("Existing dispatchers may queue or start task, reviewer or child work.","现有调度器可能排队或启动任务、审查或子任务工作。","Xiànyǒu diàodùqì kěnéng páiduì huò qǐdòng rènwù, shěnchá huò zǐ rènwù gōngzuò."),
    KanbanStatusRestoreEffect("Leaving review may restore implementer routing.","离开审查可能恢复实施者路由。","Líkāi shěnchá kěnéng huīfù shíshīzhě lùyóu."),
    KanbanStatusReviewerEffect("Review may inherit a configured reviewer.","审查可能继承已配置的审查者。","Shěnchá kěnéng jìchéng yǐ pèizhì de shěncházhě."),
    KanbanStatusResumeEffect("Making work ready may return it to review after host gating.","主机检查后，将工作设为就绪可能使其返回审查。","Zhǔjī jiǎnchá hòu, jiāng gōngzuò shè wéi jiùxù kěnéng shǐ qí fǎnhuí shěnchá."),
    KanbanStatusInvalidateEffect("Reopening finished work may reset descendant states and failure counters, and close their attempts.","重新打开已完成工作可能重置后代状态和失败计数，并关闭其尝试。","Chóngxīn dǎkāi yǐ wánchéng gōngzuò kěnéng chóngzhì hòudài zhuàngtài hé shībài jìshù, bìng guānbì qí chángshì."),
    KanbanStatusCleanupEffect("Finishing or archiving may clean managed and deferred parent workspaces. Worktree guards may retain files; this app does not verify erasure or backup.","完成或归档可能清理受管理工作区及延迟清理的父工作区。工作树保护可能保留文件；此应用不验证删除或备份。","Wánchéng huò guīdàng kěnéng qīnglǐ shòu guǎnlǐ gōngzuòqū jí yánchí qīnglǐ de fù gōngzuòqū. Gōngzuò shù bǎohù kěnéng bǎoliú wénjiàn; cǐ yìngyòng bù yànzhèng shānchú huò bèifèn."),
    KanbanStatusStageEffect("The host may copy or stage files referenced by the result or summary.","主机可能复制或暂存结果或摘要中引用的文件。","Zhǔjī kěnéng fùzhì huò zàncún jiéguǒ huò zhāiyào zhōng yǐnyòng de wénjiàn."),
    KanbanStatusReplaceEffect("Your result replaces the stored result.","您的结果会替换已保存结果。","Nín de jiéguǒ huì tìhuàn yǐ bǎocún jiéguǒ."),
    KanbanStatusParkEffect("Scheduled parks the task; it does not create a wake time.","已计划状态会停放任务，但不创建唤醒时间。","Yǐ jìhuà zhuàngtài huì tíngfàng rènwù, dàn bù chuàngjiàn huànxǐng shíjiān."),
    KanbanStatusHookEffect("Host lifecycle hooks may run.","主机生命周期钩子可能运行。","Zhǔjī shēngmìng zhōuqī gōuzi kěnéng yùnxíng."),

