    ModelStatusInfo("Serving status shows the last check. Request choices do not load models or change stored session settings. Hermes applies its own routing policy.","服务状态显示上次检查结果。请求选项不会加载模型或更改已保存的会话设置。Hermes 应用其自身的路由策略。","Fúwù zhuàngtài xiǎnshì shàng cì jiǎnchá jiéguǒ. Qǐngqiú xuǎnxiàng bú huì jiāzài móxíng huò gēnggǎi yǐ bǎocún de huìhuà shèzhì. Hermes yìngyòng qí zìshēn de lùyóu cèlüè."),
    Dictation("Dictation","听写","Tīngxiě"),
    ReadAloud("Read aloud","朗读","Lǎngdú"),
    ReadAloudInfo("Read the latest assistant reply from your current conversation. No microphone or speech recognition is needed.","朗读当前对话中助手的最新回复，无需麦克风或语音识别。","Lǎngdú dāngqián duìhuà zhōng zhùshǒu de zuìxīn huífù, wúxū màikèfēng huò yǔyīn shíbié."),
