    SpeechSettings("Open speech settings","打开语音设置","Dǎkāi yǔyīn shèzhì"),
    SpeechSetupInfo("In Android text-to-speech settings, select a preferred engine and check that an offline voice is installed for your language. Review the engine’s prompts, then return here and refresh. Your speech privacy settings stay unchanged.","在 Android 文字转语音设置中选择首选引擎，并检查是否已安装所选语言的离线声音。审阅引擎提示后返回此处刷新。语音隐私设置保持不变。","Zài Android wénzì zhuǎn yǔyīn shèzhì zhōng xuǎnzé shǒuxuǎn yǐnqíng, bìng jiǎnchá shìfǒu yǐ ānzhuāng suǒ xuǎn yǔyán de líxiàn shēngyīn. Shěnyuè yǐnqíng tíshì hòu fǎnhuí cǐ chù shuāxīn. Yǔyīn yǐnsī shèzhì bǎochí bú biàn."),
    SpeechSettingsUnavailable("Android could not open speech settings. Open Android Settings manually and search for text-to-speech or preferred engine, then return here and refresh.","Android 无法打开语音设置。请手动打开 Android 设置，搜索文字转语音或首选引擎，然后返回此处刷新。","Android wúfǎ dǎkāi yǔyīn shèzhì. Qǐng shǒudòng dǎkāi Android shèzhì, sōusuǒ wénzì zhuǎn yǔyīn huò shǒuxuǎn yǐnqíng, ránhòu fǎnhuí cǐ chù shuāxīn."),
    SpeechAudioError("Android could not record audio. Close other microphone apps and try again, or type your message.","Android 无法录音。请关闭其他使用麦克风的应用后重试，或输入文字。","Android wúfǎ lùyīn. Qǐng guānbì qítā shǐyòng màikèfēng de yìngyòng hòu chóngshì, huò shūrù wénzì."),
    SpeechLanguageUnsupported("This recognizer does not support the selected language. Choose another language or type.","此识别服务不支持所选语言，请选择其他语言或输入文字。","Cǐ shíbié fúwù bù zhīchí suǒ xuǎn yǔyán, qǐng xuǎnzé qítā yǔyán huò shūrù wénzì."),
    SpeechLanguageUnavailable("The selected recognition language is not ready on this device. Check its installed language data, then refresh.","此设备尚未准备好所选识别语言，请检查已安装的语言数据后刷新。","Cǐ shèbèi shàng wèi zhǔnbèi hǎo suǒ xuǎn shíbié yǔyán, qǐng jiǎnchá yǐ ānzhuāng de yǔyán shùjù hòu shuāxīn."),
    SpeechServiceError("The recognition service disconnected or is unavailable. Refresh and try again, or type.","识别服务已断开或不可用，请刷新后重试，或输入文字。","Shíbié fúwù yǐ duànkāi huò bù kěyòng, qǐng shuāxīn hòu chóngshì, huò shūrù wénzì."),
    SpeechReplyRequired("Send a typed message in Chat first, wait for an assistant reply, then return here to read it aloud.","请先在对话中发送文字，等待助手回复后返回此处朗读。","Qǐng xiān zài duìhuà zhōng fāsòng wénzì, děngdài zhùshǒu huífù hòu fǎnhuí cǐ chù lǎngdú."),
    SpeechChatBusy("Wait for the current conversation turn to finish.","请等待当前对话轮次结束。","Qǐng děngdài dāngqián duìhuà lúncì jiéshù."),
    SpeechListeningBusy("Finish or cancel dictation before reading aloud.","朗读前请结束或取消听写。","Lǎngdú qián qǐng jiéshù huò qǔxiāo tīngxiě."),
    SpeechStarting("Starting Android read-aloud…","正在启动 Android 朗读…","Zhèngzài qǐdòng Android lǎngdú…"),
    SpeechEngineUnavailable("Android read-aloud could not start. Open speech settings, select a preferred text-to-speech engine, then return and refresh.","Android 朗读无法启动。请打开语音设置，选择首选文字转语音引擎，然后返回刷新。","Android lǎngdú wúfǎ qǐdòng. Qǐng dǎkāi yǔyīn shèzhì, xuǎnzé shǒuxuǎn wénzì zhuǎn yǔyīn yǐnqíng, ránhòu fǎnhuí shuāxīn."),
    SpeechPlaybackError("Android could not read this reply aloud. Refresh speech services and try again. Dictation settings are separate.","Android 无法朗读此回复，请刷新语音服务后重试。听写设置与朗读分开。","Android wúfǎ lǎngdú cǐ huífù, qǐng shuāxīn yǔyīn fúwù hòu chóngshì. Tīngxiě shèzhì yǔ lǎngdú fēnkāi."),
