    KanbanOverrideSetReasoning("Set reasoning effort","设置推理力度","Shèzhì tuīlǐ lìdù"),
    KanbanOverrideNextDispatch("Overrides apply on the next dispatch. Saving does not load model weights, replace a running worker or change this conversation's model.","覆盖在下一次调度时生效。保存不会加载模型权重、替换正在运行的工作进程或更改此对话的模型。","Fùgài zài xià yí cì diàodù shí shēngxiào. Bǎocún bú huì jiāzài móxíng quánzhòng, tìhuàn zhèngzài yùnxíng de gōngzuò jìnchéng huò gēnggǎi cǐ duìhuà de móxíng."),
    KanbanOverrideModelEffect("Setting a model without a provider clears the task's provider override. Clear removes both model and provider overrides. This request leaves reasoning unchanged.","设置模型但不指定提供商会清除任务的提供商覆盖。清除操作会移除模型和提供商覆盖。此请求不更改推理设置。","Shèzhì móxíng dàn bù zhǐdìng tígōngshāng huì qīngchú rènwù de tígōngshāng fùgài. Qīngchú cāozuò huì yíchú móxíng hé tígōngshāng fùgài. Cǐ qǐngqiú bù gēnggǎi tuīlǐ shèzhì."),
    KanbanOverrideReasoningEffect("None explicitly pins thinking off. Clear inherits profile reasoning. This request leaves model and provider unchanged. Supported efforts depend on the host's model and provider.","None 明确关闭思考。清除操作会继承档案推理设置。此请求不更改模型和提供商。支持的力度取决于主机模型和提供商。","None míngquè guānbì sīkǎo. Qīngchú cāozuò huì jìchéng dàng’àn tuīlǐ shèzhì. Cǐ qǐngqiú bù gēnggǎi móxíng hé tígōngshāng. Zhīchí de lìdù qǔjué yú zhǔjī móxíng hé tígōngshāng."),
    KanbanOverrideProviderClear("This request clears the task provider override.","此请求会清除任务的提供商覆盖。","Cǐ qǐngqiú huì qīngchú rènwù de tígōngshāng fùgài."),
    KanbanOverrideMissing("This task report omits override metadata. Editing is unavailable until the server reports all three choices.","此任务报告缺少覆盖元数据。服务器报告全部三个选项前无法编辑。","Cǐ rènwù bàogào quēshǎo fùgài yuánshùjù. Fúwùqì bàogào quánbù sān gè xuǎnxiàng qián wúfǎ biānjí."),
    KanbanOverrideArchived("Archived tasks cannot change overrides.","已归档任务无法更改覆盖。","Yǐ guīdàng rènwù wúfǎ gēnggǎi fùgài."),
    KanbanOverrideInvalid("Choose an action and valid target values before review.","审核前请选择操作并提供有效的目标值。","Shěnhé qián qǐng xuǎnzé cāozuò bìng tígōng yǒuxiào de mùbiāo zhí."),
