    SetupStepCount("Step {step} of {total}","第 {step} 步，共 {total} 步","Dì {step} bù, gòng {total} bù"),
    SetupExisting("Connect an existing agent","连接现有智能体","Liánjiē xiànyǒu zhìnéngtǐ"),
    SetupNewLinux("Install a new Pi / Linux agent","安装新的树莓派 / Linux 智能体","Ānzhuāng xīn de Shùméipài / Linux zhìnéngtǐ"),
    SetupWhere("Run host commands on the computer or Pi running Hermes. Enter URLs and sign in on your phone. This guide never runs commands or sends a chat for you.","在运行 Hermes 的电脑或树莓派上执行主机命令。在手机上输入网址并登录。本指南不会代你执行命令或发送对话。","Zài yùnxíng Hermes de diànnǎo huò Shùméipài shàng zhíxíng zhǔjī mìnglìng. Zài shǒujī shàng shūrù wǎngzhǐ bìng dēnglù. Běn zhǐnán bú huì dài nǐ zhíxíng mìnglìng huò fāsòng duìhuà."),
    SetupSavedApi("Saved chat API address","已保存的对话 API 地址","Yǐ bǎocún de duìhuà API dìzhǐ"),
    SetupSavedAddressNote("Shown from this connection’s saved settings; this is not a connection test. Keys and passwords are never shown here.","此处显示当前连接保存的设置，并非连接测试。不会显示密钥或密码。","Cǐchù xiǎnshì dāngqián liánjiē bǎocún de shèzhì, bìng fēi liánjiē cèshì. Bú huì xiǎnshì mìyào huò mìmǎ."),
    SetupRoles("With a Pi and a separate model server, the phone connects to Hermes on the Pi. Spark supplies inference to Hermes; its model API key stays on the host. Your Windows worker keeps project files and runs its tools. Do not point Signal Grove at Spark’s model port.","使用树莓派和独立模型服务器时，手机连接树莓派上的 Hermes。Spark 为 Hermes 提供推理；模型 API 密钥保留在主机上。Windows 工作机保存项目文件并运行工具。不要将 Signal Grove 指向 Spark 的模型端口。","Shǐyòng Shùméipài hé dúlì móxíng fúwùqì shí, shǒujī liánjiē Shùméipài shàng de Hermes. Spark wèi Hermes tígōng tuīlǐ; móxíng API mìyào bǎoliú zài zhǔjī shàng. Windows gōngzuòjī bǎocún xiàngmù wénjiàn bìng yùnxíng gōngjù. Bú yào jiāng Signal Grove zhǐxiàng Spark de móxíng duānkǒu."),
    SetupNewHostBody("For a new Raspberry Pi / Linux host, open a terminal there (or SSH from your computer), run the official installer below, then complete hermes setup and test a normal Hermes conversation. Choose your own provider, or configure your existing local model endpoint. Windows/macOS users should use the official installation guide for their platform. Keep an already configured agent on the existing-agent path.","对于新的树莓派 / Linux 主机，在主机上打开终端（或从电脑使用 SSH），运行下方官方安装程序，然后完成 hermes setup 并测试普通 Hermes 对话。选择自己的模型提供商，或配置现有本地模型端点。Windows/macOS 用户请按官方指南安装。已配置的智能体应选择连接现有智能体。","Duìyú xīn de Shùméipài / Linux zhǔjī, zài zhǔjī shàng dǎkāi zhōngduān (huò cóng diànnǎo shǐyòng SSH), yùnxíng xiàfāng guānfāng ānzhuāng chéngxù, ránhòu wánchéng hermes setup bìng cèshì pǔtōng Hermes duìhuà. Xuǎnzé zìjǐ de móxíng tígōngshāng, huò pèizhì xiànyǒu běndì móxíng duāndiǎn. Windows/macOS yònghù qǐng àn guānfāng zhǐnán ānzhuāng. Yǐ pèizhì de zhìnéngtǐ yīng xuǎnzé liánjiē xiànyǒu zhìnéngtǐ."),
    SetupApiKeys("Use three separate credentials: the Hermes API key is for chat; the dashboard login is for management; a model-provider key belongs on the Hermes host. Never paste a model key or dashboard password into Signal Grove’s API key field. Keep a working API key; do not replace it to follow this example.","区分三类凭据：Hermes API 密钥用于对话；控制台登录用于管理；模型提供商密钥保存在 Hermes 主机上。不要将模型密钥或控制台密码填入 Signal Grove 的 API 密钥字段。保留可用的 API 密钥，不要为了照抄示例而替换它。","Qūfēn sān lèi píngjù: Hermes API mìyào yòngyú duìhuà; kòngzhìtái dēnglù yòngyú guǎnlǐ; móxíng tígōngshāng mìyào bǎocún zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng. Bú yào jiāng móxíng mìyào huò kòngzhìtái mìmǎ tián rù Signal Grove de API mìyào zìduàn. Bǎoliú kěyòng de API mìyào, bú yào wèile zhàochāo shìlì ér tìhuàn tā."),
    SetupNetworkExisting("On the host, read tailscale serve status and copy the actual HTTPS DNS URL for the API. A working existing mapping needs no change. If none exists, follow the new-host example with an unused port. Install/open Tailscale on the phone and connect it to the same tailnet; access rules must allow this phone.","在主机上查看 tailscale serve status，复制 API 实际的 HTTPS DNS 网址。现有映射可用时无需修改。如果尚无映射，请使用新主机示例并选择未使用的端口。在手机上安装或打开 Tailscale，连接同一尾网，并确认访问规则允许此手机。","Zài zhǔjī shàng chákàn tailscale serve status, fùzhì API shíjì de HTTPS DNS wǎngzhǐ. Xiànyǒu yìngshè kěyòng shí wúxū xiūgǎi. Rúguǒ shàng wú yìngshè, qǐng shǐyòng xīn zhǔjī shìlì bìng xuǎnzé wèi shǐyòng de duānkǒu. Zài shǒujī shàng ānzhuāng huò dǎkāi Tailscale, liánjiē tóng yī wěiwǎng, bìng quèrèn fǎngwèn guīzé yǔnxǔ cǐ shǒujī."),
    SetupDashboardExisting("Use the dashboard’s own HTTPS address from your existing Serve configuration. It is often a different port from chat. A managed installation can use a loopback relay (for example 9118); a new stock dashboard defaults to 9119. Keep the actual existing target and public URL. The API address alone does not identify the dashboard address.","请使用现有 Serve 配置中控制台自己的 HTTPS 地址，其端口通常与对话不同。托管安装可能使用回环中继（例如 9118）；新安装的标准控制台默认使用 9119。请保留实际的现有目标和公共网址。仅凭 API 地址无法确定控制台地址。","Qǐng shǐyòng xiànyǒu Serve pèizhì zhōng kòngzhìtái zìjǐ de HTTPS dìzhǐ, qí duānkǒu tōngcháng yǔ duìhuà bùtóng. Tuōguǎn ānzhuāng kěnéng shǐyòng huíhuán zhōngjì (lìrú jiǔyīyībā); xīn ānzhuāng de biāozhǔn kòngzhìtái mòrèn shǐyòng jiǔyīyījiǔ. Qǐng bǎoliú shíjì de xiànyǒu mùbiāo hé gōnggòng wǎngzhǐ. Jǐn píng API dìzhǐ wúfǎ quèdìng kòngzhìtái dìzhǐ."),
    SetupManagementSteps("On the phone: Settings → Hermes management → enter the dashboard HTTPS URL → sign in using the browser → return to Signal Grove → choose the profile that owns your agent. If sign-in expires, renew it there. API key authentication and dashboard sign-in are separate.","在手机上：设置 → Hermes 管理 → 输入控制台 HTTPS 网址 → 使用浏览器登录 → 返回 Signal Grove → 选择智能体所属的配置档。登录过期时在此续期。API 密钥验证与控制台登录相互独立。","Zài shǒujī shàng: shèzhì → Hermes guǎnlǐ → shūrù kòngzhìtái HTTPS wǎngzhǐ → shǐyòng liúlǎnqì dēnglù → fǎnhuí Signal Grove → xuǎnzé zhìnéngtǐ suǒshǔ de pèizhì dàng. Dēnglù guòqī shí zài cǐ xùqī. API mìyào yànzhèng yǔ kòngzhìtái dēnglù xiānghù dúlì."),
    SetupModels("6. Follow the serving model","6. 跟随正在服务的模型","Liù. Gēnsuí zhèngzài fúwù de móxíng"),
    SetupModelsBody("Open Chat → sliders → Automatic · use serving model → Apply to new turns. In Models & connection, compare Verified serving model with Server default and Requested model. Automatic uses fresh verified status when the optional host observer is available; it keeps the draft if status is stale or unavailable. Without that extension the server manages the model. Selecting a model does not load weights or clear a session lock. Reasoning and service are preset menus; use Server default when no service tier is offered.","打开对话 → 滑块图标 → 自动 · 使用正在服务的模型 → 应用于新请求。在模型与连接中，对比已验证的服务模型、服务器默认值和请求的模型。主机提供可选观察器时，自动模式使用新鲜且已验证的状态；状态过旧或不可用时会保留草稿。没有该扩展时由服务器管理模型。选择模型不会加载权重或清除会话锁。推理和服务使用预设菜单；未提供服务层级时使用服务器默认值。","Dǎkāi duìhuà → huákuài túbiāo → zìdòng · shǐyòng zhèngzài fúwù de móxíng → yìngyòng yú xīn qǐngqiú. Zài móxíng yǔ liánjiē zhōng, duìbǐ yǐ yànzhèng de fúwù móxíng, fúwùqì mòrèn zhí hé qǐngqiú de móxíng. Zhǔjī tígōng kě xuǎn guāncháqì shí, zìdòng móshì shǐyòng xīnxiān qiě yǐ yànzhèng de zhuàngtài; zhuàngtài guò jiù huò bù kěyòng shí huì bǎoliú cǎogǎo. Méiyǒu gāi kuòzhǎn shí yóu fúwùqì guǎnlǐ móxíng. Xuǎnzé móxíng bú huì jiāzài quánzhòng huò qīngchú huìhuà suǒ. Tuīlǐ hé fúwù shǐyòng yùshè càidān; wèi tígōng fúwù céngjí shí shǐyòng fúwùqì mòrèn zhí."),
    SetupChats("7. Find your existing chats","7. 查找已有对话","Qī. Cházhǎo yǐyǒu duìhuà"),
    SetupChatsBody("Open Chat → Conversation history (clock icon), refresh the server list, then load older pages if needed. Check the connection and Hermes profile; search/source filters only cover loaded rows. Open an existing chat and confirm its earlier messages load. Desktop, Discord and other non-API histories may be read-only. Do not create a replacement chat or retry an old uncertain message just to test the connection.","打开对话 → 会话历史（时钟图标），刷新服务器列表，必要时加载更早页面。检查连接和 Hermes 配置档；搜索及来源筛选只覆盖已加载的记录。打开已有对话并确认早期消息已加载。桌面、Discord 等非 API 历史可能为只读。不要为了测试连接而创建替代对话或重试结果不确定的旧消息。","Dǎkāi duìhuà → huìhuà lìshǐ (shízhōng túbiāo), shuāxīn fúwùqì lièbiǎo, bìyào shí jiāzài gèng zǎo yèmiàn. Jiǎnchá liánjiē hé Hermes pèizhì dàng; sōusuǒ jí láiyuán shāixuǎn zhǐ fùgài yǐ jiāzài de jìlù. Dǎkāi yǐyǒu duìhuà bìng quèrèn zǎoqī xiāoxī yǐ jiāzài. Zhuōmiàn, Discord děng fēi API lìshǐ kěnéng wéi zhǐdú. Bú yào wèile cèshì liánjiē ér chuàngjiàn tìdài duìhuà huò chóngshì jiéguǒ bù quèdìng de jiù xiāoxī."),
    SetupProjects("8. Find your stored projects","8. 查找已保存的项目","Bā. Cházhǎo yǐ bǎocún de xiàngmù"),
    SetupProjectsBody("Open Settings → Hermes management → select the intended profile → Host projects → Read stored projects. Review/confirm that read, choose a project and use Refresh project details. This reads Hermes’s stored project metadata. It does not copy files to your phone, attach a chat to a folder, enroll a worker or authorize a project write. Files and application tools stay on the project’s verified execution worker.","打开设置 → Hermes 管理 → 选择目标配置档 → 主机项目 → 读取已存储项目。审阅并确认读取，选择项目，然后刷新项目详情。这会读取 Hermes 保存的项目元数据，不会复制文件到手机、将对话绑定到文件夹、注册工作机或授权项目写入。文件和应用工具保留在项目已验证的执行工作机上。","Dǎkāi shèzhì → Hermes guǎnlǐ → xuǎnzé mùbiāo pèizhì dàng → zhǔjī xiàngmù → dúqǔ yǐ cúnchǔ xiàngmù. Shěnyuè bìng quèrèn dúqǔ, xuǎnzé xiàngmù, ránhòu shuāxīn xiàngmù xiángqíng. Zhè huì dúqǔ Hermes bǎocún de xiàngmù yuán shùjù, bú huì fùzhì wénjiàn dào shǒujī, jiāng duìhuà bǎngdìng dào wénjiànjiā, zhùcè gōngzuòjī huò shòuquán xiàngmù xiěrù. Wénjiàn hé yìngyòng gōngjù bǎoliú zài xiàngmù yǐ yànzhèng de zhíxíng gōngzuòjī shàng."),
    SetupReady("Return to server settings","返回服务器设置","Fǎnhuí fúwùqì shèzhì"),
    SetupFinalCheck("You are ready for basic chat when connection testing succeeds, a fresh no-tool reply arrives, and earlier history loads. Check project details separately after management sign-in. A successful chat does not prove every tool, worker or automation is available.","连接测试成功、收到新的无工具回复且早期历史加载后，即可开始基本对话。管理登录后请单独检查项目详情。对话成功不能证明所有工具、工作机或自动化均可用。","Liánjiē cèshì chénggōng, shōudào xīn de wú gōngjù huífù qiě zǎoqī lìshǐ jiāzài hòu, jí kě kāishǐ jīběn duìhuà. Guǎnlǐ dēnglù hòu qǐng dāndú jiǎnchá xiàngmù xiángqíng. Duìhuà chénggōng bù néng zhèngmíng suǒyǒu gōngjù, gōngzuòjī huò zìdònghuà jūn kěyòng."),
    SetupEnvFile("Edit the intended host profile’s .env file","编辑主机目标配置档的 .env 文件","Biānjí zhǔjī mùbiāo pèizhì dàng de .env wénjiàn"),
    SetupDashboardLoginConfig("For a new dashboard, set a private login and a stable signing secret of at least 32 random bytes in that profile’s protected .env file. Replace the placeholders privately. Keep existing credentials and signing secrets. A configured public HTTPS URL engages authentication on the reviewed Hermes versions even with a loopback listener; verify the gate before connecting.","为新控制台在该配置档受保护的 .env 文件中设置私有登录凭据，以及至少 32 个随机字节的稳定签名密钥。私下替换占位符，保留现有凭据和签名密钥。在已审阅的 Hermes 版本中，即使监听回环地址，配置公共 HTTPS 网址也会启用身份验证；连接前请验证身份验证已启用。","Wèi xīn kòngzhìtái zài gāi pèizhì dàng shòu bǎohù de .env wénjiàn zhōng shèzhì sīyǒu dēnglù píngjù, yǐjí zhìshǎo sānshí’èr gè suíjī zìjié de wěndìng qiānmíng mìyào. Sīxià tìhuàn zhànwèifú, bǎoliú xiànyǒu píngjù hé qiānmíng mìyào. Zài yǐ shěnyuè de Hermes bǎnběn zhōng, jíshǐ jiāntīng huíhuán dìzhǐ, pèizhì gōnggòng HTTPS wǎngzhǐ yě huì qǐyòng shēnfèn yànzhèng; liánjiē qián qǐng yànzhèng shēnfèn yànzhèng yǐ qǐyòng."),
    SetupDashboardStart("For a new dashboard only, save the settings, then run this command in its own host terminal and leave it running (or use your existing service manager). Run the Serve command below from another terminal. An existing dashboard and relay need no replacement.","仅为新控制台保存设置，然后在单独的主机终端中运行此命令并保持运行（或使用现有服务管理器）。在另一个终端中执行下方 Serve 命令。无需替换现有控制台和中继。","Jǐn wèi xīn kòngzhìtái bǎocún shèzhì, ránhòu zài dāndú de zhǔjī zhōngduān zhōng yùnxíng cǐ mìnglìng bìng bǎochí yùnxíng (huò shǐyòng xiànyǒu fúwù guǎnlǐqì). Zài lìng yī gè zhōngduān zhōng zhíxíng xiàfāng Serve mìnglìng. Wúxū tìhuàn xiànyǒu kòngzhìtái hé zhōngjì."),
    SetupDashboardGate("At the dashboard HTTPS address, open /api/status and check auth_required is true with your login provider advertised. If false or the provider is missing, fix the host’s public URL/login configuration before using management. Do not disable the gate or TLS checks.","在控制台 HTTPS 地址打开 /api/status，确认 auth_required 为 true，且已提供你的登录方式。如果为 false 或缺少登录方式，请先修正主机的公共网址和登录配置，再使用管理功能。不要关闭身份验证或 TLS 检查。","Zài kòngzhìtái HTTPS dìzhǐ dǎkāi /api/status, quèrèn auth_required wéi true, qiě yǐ tígōng nǐ de dēnglù fāngshì. Rúguǒ wéi false huò quēshǎo dēnglù fāngshì, qǐng xiān xiūzhèng zhǔjī de gōnggòng wǎngzhǐ hé dēnglù pèizhì, zài shǐyòng guǎnlǐ gōngnéng. Bú yào guānbì shēnfèn yànzhèng huò TLS jiǎnchá."),
    SetupGuide("Set up Hermes","设置 Hermes","Shèzhì Hermes"),
    SetupIntro("Connect to your own agent. This guide changes no server settings and sends no requests. Commands are examples for the server administrator.","连接您自己的智能体。本指南不会更改服务器设置或发送请求。命令是供服务器管理员参考的示例。","Liánjiē nín zìjǐ de zhìnéngtǐ. Běn zhǐnán bú huì gēnggǎi fúwùqì shèzhì huò fāsòng qǐngqiú. Mìnglìng shì gōng fúwùqì guǎnlǐyuán cānkǎo de shìlì."),
    SetupHost("1. Prepare your agent","1. 准备智能体","Yī. Zhǔnbèi zhìnéngtǐ"),
    SetupHostBody("Install Hermes on the computer or Pi that will own your agent. Keep its existing Hermes home, profile, identity and sessions. Configure your model provider there and verify a normal Hermes conversation. Signal Grove is the phone client; it does not install a server or run model weights.","在负责智能体的电脑或树莓派上安装 Hermes。保留现有 Hermes 主目录、配置档案、身份和会话。在该主机上配置模型提供商，并验证普通 Hermes 对话。Signal Grove 是手机客户端，不会安装服务器或运行模型权重。","Zài fùzé zhìnéngtǐ de diànnǎo huò Shùméipài shàng ānzhuāng Hermes. Bǎoliú xiànyǒu Hermes zhǔ mùlù, pèizhì dàng’àn, shēnfèn hé huìhuà. Zài gāi zhǔjī shàng pèizhì móxíng tígōngshāng, bìng yànzhèng pǔtōng Hermes duìhuà. Signal Grove shì shǒujī kèhùduān, bú huì ānzhuāng fúwùqì huò yùnxíng móxíng quánzhòng."),
    SetupApi("2. Enable the authenticated API","2. 启用经过身份验证的 API","Èr. Qǐyòng jīngguò shēnfèn yànzhèng de API"),
    SetupApiBody("In the intended Hermes profile’s .env file, enable the API and bind it to loopback. Keep an existing strong API_SERVER_KEY; otherwise generate one privately on the server. The API key grants agent access. Never use your model-provider key or dashboard password here, and never paste credentials into a chat. Restart the existing gateway with this profile after checking for active work. A foreground installation uses hermes gateway.","在目标 Hermes 配置档案的 .env 文件中启用 API，并绑定到回环地址。保留现有的强 API_SERVER_KEY；否则在服务器上私密生成。API 密钥授予智能体访问权限。此处不要使用模型提供商密钥或控制台密码，也不要将凭据粘贴到聊天中。检查正在运行的工作后，用此档案重启现有网关。前台安装使用 hermes gateway。","Zài mùbiāo Hermes pèizhì dàng’àn de .env wénjiàn zhōng qǐyòng API, bìng bǎngdìng dào huíhuán dìzhǐ. Bǎoliú xiànyǒu de qiáng API_SERVER_KEY; fǒuzé zài fúwùqì shàng sīmì shēngchéng. API mìyào shòuyǔ zhìnéngtǐ fǎngwèn quánxiàn. Cǐchù bú yào shǐyòng móxíng tígōngshāng mìyào huò kòngzhìtái mìmǎ, yě bú yào jiāng píngjù zhāntiē dào liáotiān zhōng. Jiǎnchá zhèngzài yùnxíng de gōngzuò hòu, yòng cǐ dàng’àn chóngqǐ xiànyǒu wǎngguān. Qiántái ānzhuāng shǐyòng hermes gateway."),
    SetupNetwork("3. Add private HTTPS access","3. 添加私有 HTTPS 访问","Sān. Tiānjiā sīyǒu HTTPS fǎngwèn"),
    SetupNetworkBody("One option is Tailscale on both your phone and agent host, signed into the same tailnet. On the host, inspect tailscale serve status, then forward an unused HTTPS port to the loopback API. Follow Tailscale’s HTTPS enablement instructions. Use Serve for tailnet access; do not enable Funnel or router port forwarding. Keep existing Serve mappings. A trusted HTTPS reverse proxy is also supported.","一种方法是在手机和智能体主机上安装 Tailscale，并登录同一个尾网。在主机上检查 tailscale serve status，然后将未使用的 HTTPS 端口转发到回环 API。按照 Tailscale 的说明启用 HTTPS。使用 Serve 进行尾网访问；不要启用 Funnel 或路由器端口转发。保留现有 Serve 映射。也支持可信的 HTTPS 反向代理。","Yì zhǒng fāngfǎ shì zài shǒujī hé zhìnéngtǐ zhǔjī shàng ānzhuāng Tailscale, bìng dēnglù tóng yí gè wěiwǎng. Zài zhǔjī shàng jiǎnchá tailscale serve status, ránhòu jiāng wèi shǐyòng de HTTPS duānkǒu zhuǎnfā dào huíhuán API. Ànzhào Tailscale de shuōmíng qǐyòng HTTPS. Shǐyòng Serve jìnxíng wěiwǎng fǎngwèn; bú yào qǐyòng Funnel huò lùyóuqì duānkǒu zhuǎnfā. Bǎoliú xiànyǒu Serve yìngshè. Yě zhīchí kěxìn de HTTPS fǎnxiàng dàilǐ."),
    SetupPhone("4. Connect Signal Grove","4. 连接 Signal Grove","Sì. Liánjiē Signal Grove"),
    SetupPhoneBody("On the phone: 1. Connect Tailscale to the same tailnet. 2. In Settings → Server, turn Demo mode off. 3. Enter the host’s HTTPS API base URL, without /v1; keep any configured profile/proxy path prefix. 4. Enter API_SERVER_KEY in the API key field, then choose Save & test connection. 5. Allow local network access if Android requests it. An existing saved connection can keep its saved key; the guide never reads or replaces it.","在手机上：1. 将 Tailscale 连接到同一尾网。2. 在设置 → 服务器中关闭演示模式。3. 输入主机的 HTTPS API 基础网址，不添加 /v1，并保留已配置的配置档或代理路径前缀。4. 在 API 密钥字段输入 API_SERVER_KEY，然后选择保存并测试连接。5. Android 请求本地网络权限时予以允许。现有连接可保留已保存的密钥；本指南不会读取或替换它。","Zài shǒujī shàng: yī, jiāng Tailscale liánjiē dào tóng yī wěiwǎng. Èr, zài shèzhì → fúwùqì zhōng guānbì yǎnshì móshì. Sān, shūrù zhǔjī de HTTPS API jīchǔ wǎngzhǐ, bù tiānjiā /v1, bìng bǎoliú yǐ pèizhì de pèizhì dàng huò dàilǐ lùjìng qiánzhuì. Sì, zài API mìyào zìduàn shūrù API_SERVER_KEY, ránhòu xuǎnzé bǎocún bìng cèshì liánjiē. Wǔ, Android qǐngqiú běndì wǎngluò quánxiàn shí yǔyǐ yǔnxǔ. Xiànyǒu liánjiē kě bǎoliú yǐ bǎocún de mìyào; běn zhǐnán bú huì dúqǔ huò tìhuàn tā."),
    SetupDashboard("5. Connect management (optional)","5. 连接管理功能（可选）","Wǔ. Liánjiē guǎnlǐ gōngnéng (kě xuǎn)"),
    SetupDashboardBody("Management uses the separate Hermes dashboard and its browser login. Enable dashboard authentication before sharing it. Keep existing credentials and the signing secret. Set HERMES_DASHBOARD_PUBLIC_URL to its exact external HTTPS URL in the dashboard process environment. For a new loopback dashboard on port 9119, forward a second unused HTTPS port. Existing deployments may need a different target; preserve their desktop clients. In Signal Grove, enter this URL under Hermes management, sign in using the browser, return to the app and select the verified profile.","管理功能使用独立的 Hermes 控制台和浏览器登录。共享前请启用控制台身份验证。保留现有凭据和签名密钥。在控制台进程环境中，将 HERMES_DASHBOARD_PUBLIC_URL 设为准确的外部 HTTPS 网址。对于端口 9119 上的新回环控制台，转发第二个未使用的 HTTPS 端口。现有部署可能需要其他目标；请保留桌面客户端。在 Signal Grove 的 Hermes 管理中输入此网址，使用浏览器登录，返回应用并选择已验证的档案。","Guǎnlǐ gōngnéng shǐyòng dúlì de Hermes kòngzhìtái hé liúlǎnqì dēnglù. Gòngxiǎng qián qǐng qǐyòng kòngzhìtái shēnfèn yànzhèng. Bǎoliú xiànyǒu píngjù hé qiānmíng mìyào. Zài kòngzhìtái jìnchéng huánjìng zhōng, jiāng HERMES_DASHBOARD_PUBLIC_URL shè wéi zhǔnquè de wàibù HTTPS wǎngzhǐ. Duìyú duānkǒu jiǔyīyījiǔ shàng de xīn huíhuán kòngzhìtái, zhuǎnfā dì èr gè wèi shǐyòng de HTTPS duānkǒu. Xiànyǒu bùshǔ kěnéng xūyào qítā mùbiāo; qǐng bǎoliú zhuōmiàn kèhùduān. Zài Signal Grove de Hermes guǎnlǐ zhōng shūrù cǐ wǎngzhǐ, shǐyòng liúlǎnqì dēnglù, fǎnhuí yìngyòng bìng xuǎnzé yǐ yànzhèng de dàng’àn."),
    SetupVerify("9. Check that it works","9. 确认能够使用","Jiǔ. Quèrèn nénggòu shǐyòng"),
    SetupVerifyBody("Open Server details and read the host’s capabilities and readiness. Then send a harmless greeting and verify it reaches the intended agent. A working login or live gateway does not prove the model and tools are ready. Keep project files on their verified execution worker; a phone connection does not enroll a worker or authorize project writes. Approve actions only after checking their host, profile and exact scope.","打开服务器详情，查看主机能力和就绪状态。然后发送无害的问候，确认到达目标智能体。登录成功或网关在线并不能证明模型和工具已就绪。将项目文件保留在已验证的执行工作机上；手机连接不会注册工作机或授权项目写入。仅在检查主机、档案和确切范围后批准操作。","Dǎkāi fúwùqì xiángqíng, chákàn zhǔjī nénglì hé jiùxù zhuàngtài. Ránhòu fāsòng wúhài de wènhòu, quèrèn dàodá mùbiāo zhìnéngtǐ. Dēnglù chénggōng huò wǎngguān zàixiàn bìng bù néng zhèngmíng móxíng hé gōngjù yǐ jiùxù. Jiāng xiàngmù wénjiàn bǎoliú zài yǐ yànzhèng de zhíxíng gōngzuòjī shàng; shǒujī liánjiē bú huì zhùcè gōngzuòjī huò shòuquán xiàngmù xiěrù. Jǐn zài jiǎnchá zhǔjī, dàng’àn hé quèqiè fànwéi hòu pīzhǔn cāozuò."),
    SetupTroubleshoot("Connection checks","连接检查","Liánjiē jiǎnchá"),
    SetupTroubleshootBody("Timeout: check Tailscale, access rules, Serve and the listener. 401: check the API key and profile; dashboard login uses separate credentials. Invalid Host: use the configured DNS hostname. Certificate error: correct HTTPS and hostname; keep TLS validation enabled. Unsupported capability: check the deployed Hermes version and enabled features. An uncertain tool result requires receipt review before any retry.","超时：检查 Tailscale、访问规则、Serve 和监听器。401：检查 API 密钥和档案；控制台登录使用独立凭据。无效主机：使用已配置的 DNS 主机名。证书错误：修正 HTTPS 和主机名，保持 TLS 验证启用。不支持的能力：检查已部署的 Hermes 版本和已启用功能。工具结果不确定时，重试前需要审阅回执。","Chāoshí: jiǎnchá Tailscale, fǎngwèn guīzé, Serve hé jiāntīngqì. Sì líng yī: jiǎnchá API mìyào hé dàng’àn; kòngzhìtái dēnglù shǐyòng dúlì píngjù. Wúxiào zhǔjī: shǐyòng yǐ pèizhì de DNS zhǔjīmíng. Zhèngshū cuòwù: xiūzhèng HTTPS hé zhǔjīmíng, bǎochí TLS yànzhèng qǐyòng. Bù zhīchí de nénglì: jiǎnchá yǐ bùshǔ de Hermes bǎnběn hé yǐ qǐyòng gōngnéng. Gōngjù jiéguǒ bù quèdìng shí, chóngshì qián xūyào shěnyuè huízhí."),
    SetupPrevious("Previous step","上一步","Shàng yí bù"),
    SetupNext("Next step","下一步","Xià yí bù"),
    SetupApiDocs("Official Hermes API guide","Hermes 官方 API 指南","Hermes guānfāng API zhǐnán"),
    SetupDashboardDocs("Official dashboard and login guide","官方控制台和登录指南","Guānfāng kòngzhìtái hé dēnglù zhǐnán"),
    SetupTailscaleDocs("Official Tailscale Serve guide","Tailscale Serve 官方指南","Tailscale Serve guānfāng zhǐnán"),
    SetupInstallDocs("Official Hermes installation guide","Hermes 官方安装指南","Hermes guānfāng ānzhuāng zhǐnán"),
    ProjectDraftPrivate("Drafts stay in memory and are discarded on close or scope change. Review the exact values before sending.","草稿仅保存在内存中，关闭或更改范围时丢弃。发送前请审阅确切值。","Cǎogǎo jǐn bǎocún zài nèicún zhōng, guānbì huò gēnggǎi fànwéi shí diūqì. Fāsòng qián qǐng shěnyuè quèqiè zhí."),
    ProjectNameInput("Project name (required)","项目名称（必填）","Xiàngmù míngchēng (bì tián)"),
    ProjectSlugInput("Optional slug; empty lets the host choose","可选短名；留空由主机选择","Kě xuǎn duǎnmíng; liú kōng yóu zhǔjī xuǎnzé"),
    ProjectSlugEffect("Slugs use letters a–z, digits, dashes or underscores, up to 64 characters. The host may add a suffix to avoid duplicates.","短名使用 a–z 字母、数字、短横线或下划线，最多 64 个字符。主机可添加后缀以避免重复。","Duǎnmíng shǐyòng a–z zìmǔ, shùzì, duǎn héngxiàn huò xiàhuàxiàn, zuìduō liùshísì gè zìfú. Zhǔjī kě tiānjiā hòuzhuì yǐ bìmiǎn chóngfù."),
    ProjectIconInput("Icon value","图标值","Túbiāo zhí"),
    ProjectColorInput("Color value","颜色值","Yánsè zhí"),
    ProjectBoardInput("Board reference; does not create a board","看板引用；不会创建看板","Kànbǎn yǐnyòng; bù huì chuàngjiàn kànbǎn"),
    ProjectPathsInput("Optional host folders, one per line","可选主机文件夹，每行一个","Kě xuǎn zhǔjī wénjiànjiā, měi háng yí gè"),
    ProjectPathInput("Host folder path (required)","主机文件夹路径（必填）","Zhǔjī wénjiànjiā lùjìng (bì tián)"),
    ProjectPrimaryPathInput("Optional primary host folder","可选主机主文件夹","Kě xuǎn zhǔjī zhǔ wénjiànjiā"),
    ProjectPathsEffect("Enter host paths exactly, without blank lines. The host normalizes paths; the phone cannot verify their mapping or contents. No phone folders are opened.","请原样输入主机路径，不留空行。主机会规范化路径；手机无法验证对应关系或内容。不会打开手机文件夹。","Qǐng yuányàng shūrù zhǔjī lùjìng, bù liú kōng háng. Zhǔjī huì guīfànhuà lùjìng; shǒujī wúfǎ yànzhèng duìyìng guānxì huò nèiróng. Bù huì dǎkāi shǒujī wénjiànjiā."),
    ProjectLabelInput("Folder label; empty saves an empty label","文件夹标签；留空保存为空标签","Wénjiànjiā biāoqiān; liú kōng bǎocún wéi kōng biāoqiān"),
    ProjectLabelSet("Set or replace this folder label","设置或替换此文件夹标签","Shèzhì huò tìhuàn cǐ wénjiànjiā biāoqiān"),
    ProjectPrimaryInput("Make this the primary folder","将其设为主文件夹","Jiāng qí shè wéi zhǔ wénjiànjiā"),
    ProjectFolderPrimaryEffect("If no folder is marked primary, the host may make this one primary even when this option is off.","若没有文件夹标为主文件夹，即使关闭此选项，主机也可能将此文件夹设为主文件夹。","Ruò méiyǒu wénjiànjiā biāo wéi zhǔ wénjiànjiā, jíshǐ guānbì cǐ xuǎnxiàng, zhǔjī yě kěnéng jiāng cǐ wénjiànjiā shè wéi zhǔ wénjiànjiā."),
    ProjectChangeName("Change name","更改名称","Gēnggǎi míngchēng"),
    ProjectChangeDescription("Set description (empty is a saved empty string)","设置说明（留空保存为空字符串）","Shèzhì shuōmíng (liú kōng bǎocún wéi kōng zìfúchuàn)"),
    ProjectChangeIcon("Change or clear icon","更改或清除图标","Gēnggǎi huò qīngchú túbiāo"),
    ProjectChangeColor("Change or clear color","更改或清除颜色","Gēnggǎi huò qīngchú yánsè"),
    ProjectChangeBoard("Change or clear board reference","更改或清除看板引用","Gēnggǎi huò qīngchú kànbǎn yǐnyòng"),
    ProjectUpdateFields("Unchecked fields stay unchanged. Empty icon, color or board clears it; empty description is saved as empty. The project ID and slug are not edited.","未勾选字段保持不变。图标、颜色或看板留空表示清除；说明留空保存为空。不会编辑项目 ID 和短名。","Wèi gōuxuǎn zìduàn bǎochí bù biàn. Túbiāo, yánsè huò kànbǎn liú kōng biǎoshì qīngchú; shuōmíng liú kōng bǎocún wéi kōng. Bù huì biānjí xiàngmù ID hé duǎnmíng."),
    ProjectReadFirst("Read the complete stored inventory before preparing a project change.","准备项目更改前请读取完整的已保存列表。","Zhǔnbèi xiàngmù gēnggǎi qián qǐng dúqǔ wánzhěng de yǐ bǎocún lièbiǎo."),
    ProjectNoEdits("Choose at least one field to change.","请至少选择一个要更改的字段。","Qǐng zhìshǎo xuǎnzé yí gè yào gēnggǎi de zìduàn."),
    ProjectDraftInvalid("Check required names/paths, blank folder lines, slug syntax and field length. Names/labels/icons allow 512 characters, color 128, description 8192, paths 4096; up to 128 distinct folders.","请检查必填名称和路径、空文件夹行、短名格式及字段长度。名称、标签、图标最多 512 字符，颜色 128，说明 8192，路径 4096；最多 128 个不同文件夹。","Qǐng jiǎnchá bì tián míngchēng hé lùjìng, kōng wénjiànjiā háng, duǎnmíng géshì jí zìduàn chángdù. Míngchēng, biāoqiān, túbiāo zuìduō wǔbǎi yīshí'èr zìfú, yánsè yìbǎi èrshíbā, shuōmíng bāqiān yìbǎi jiǔshí'èr, lùjìng sìqiān líng jiǔshíliù; zuìduō yìbǎi èrshíbā gè bù tóng wénjiànjiā."),
    ProjectEmptyValue("Empty string","空字符串","Kōng zìfúchuàn"),
    ProjectCreateEffect("Create stored project and folder metadata without activating it. The host may normalize paths, choose a slug suffix and make the first folder primary. This does not create project directories or a board.","创建已保存的项目和文件夹元数据，但不激活。主机可能规范化路径、选择短名后缀并将首个文件夹设为主文件夹。此操作不会创建项目目录或看板。","Chuàngjiàn yǐ bǎocún de xiàngmù hé wénjiànjiā yuán shùjù, dàn bù jīhuó. Zhǔjī kěnéng guīfànhuà lùjìng, xuǎnzé duǎnmíng hòuzhuì bìng jiāng shǒu gè wénjiànjiā shè wéi zhǔ wénjiànjiā. Cǐ cāozuò bù huì chuàngjiàn xiàngmù mùlù huò kànbǎn."),
    ProjectUpdateEffect("Change only the selected display fields. Empty icon/color/board clears that value; empty description stays an empty string. A board reference does not verify or create a board.","仅更改所选显示字段。图标、颜色、看板留空会清除该值；说明留空保持为空字符串。看板引用不会验证或创建看板。","Jǐn gēnggǎi suǒ xuǎn xiǎnshì zìduàn. Túbiāo, yánsè, kànbǎn liú kōng huì qīngchú gāi zhí; shuōmíng liú kōng bǎochí wéi kōng zìfúchuàn. Kànbǎn yǐnyòng bù huì yànzhèng huò chuàngjiàn kànbǎn."),
    ProjectAddFolderEffect("Attach this host path, or update its explicitly supplied label. The host normalizes the path. It can become primary when selected or when no folder is marked primary. Files are not created or moved.","关联此主机路径，或更新明确提供的标签。主机会规范化路径。选中主文件夹选项或无文件夹标为主文件夹时，此文件夹可能成为主文件夹。不会创建或移动文件。","Guānlián cǐ zhǔjī lùjìng, huò gēngxīn míngquè tígōng de biāoqiān. Zhǔjī huì guīfànhuà lùjìng. Xuǎnzhòng zhǔ wénjiànjiā xuǎnxiàng huò wú wénjiànjiā biāo wéi zhǔ wénjiànjiā shí, cǐ wénjiànjiā kěnéng chéngwéi zhǔ wénjiànjiā. Bù huì chuàngjiàn huò yídòng wénjiàn."),
    ProjectRemoveFolderEffect("Detach this folder's metadata. If it was primary, the host chooses the oldest remaining folder or clears primary. Folder contents are not deleted.","移除此文件夹的元数据关联。若它是主文件夹，主机会选择最早的剩余文件夹或清除主文件夹。不会删除文件夹内容。","Yíchú cǐ wénjiànjiā de yuán shùjù guānlián. Ruò tā shì zhǔ wénjiànjiā, zhǔjī huì xuǎnzé zuì zǎo de shèngyú wénjiànjiā huò qīngchú zhǔ wénjiànjiā. Bù huì shānchú wénjiànjiā nèiróng."),
    ProjectSetPrimaryEffect("Request this attached host path as primary metadata. A successful reply alone does not prove the primary changed; the report checks the returned effect and a separate read.","请求将此已关联主机路径设为主文件夹元数据。仅成功回复不证明主文件夹已更改；报告会检查返回的效果及单独读取。","Qǐngqiú jiāng cǐ yǐ guānlián zhǔjī lùjìng shè wéi zhǔ wénjiànjiā yuán shùjù. Jǐn chénggōng huífù bù zhèngmíng zhǔ wénjiànjiā yǐ gēnggǎi; bàogào huì jiǎnchá fǎnhuí de xiàoguǒ jí dāndú dúqǔ."),
    ProjectArchiveEffect("Change the stored archive flag only. Existing work is not stopped and the host's active pointer is not automatically cleared.","仅更改已保存的归档标记。不会停止现有工作，也不会自动清除主机的活动指针。","Jǐn gēnggǎi yǐ bǎocún de guīdàng biāojì. Bù huì tíngzhǐ xiànyǒu gōngzuò, yě bù huì zìdòng qīngchú zhǔjī de huódòng zhǐzhēn."),
    ProjectDeleteEffect("Delete this project's metadata and attached folder records. Project files are not deleted. An active pointer may remain unmatched; clear it separately if intended.","删除此项目的元数据和关联文件夹记录。不会删除项目文件。活动指针可能仍无匹配；如有需要请单独清除。","Shānchú cǐ xiàngmù de yuán shùjù hé guānlián wénjiànjiā jìlù. Bù huì shānchú xiàngmù wénjiàn. Huódòng zhǐzhēn kěnéng réng wú pǐpèi; rú yǒu xūyào qǐng dāndú qīngchú."),
    ProjectActiveEffect("Change only the host's stored active-project pointer. Existing mobile conversations keep their working directory and running work is not restarted or stopped.","仅更改主机已保存的活动项目指针。现有手机会话保持其工作目录，运行中的工作不会重启或停止。","Jǐn gēnggǎi zhǔjī yǐ bǎocún de huódòng xiàngmù zhǐzhēn. Xiànyǒu shǒujī huìhuà bǎochí qí gōngzuò mùlù, yùnxíng zhōng de gōngzuò bù huì chóngqǐ huò tíngzhǐ."),
    ProjectConcurrency("The app checks current metadata before sending, but the host cannot make that check and change indivisible. Another client can change metadata or ID/slug resolution in between. An interrupted write is never automatically repeated.","应用会在发送前检查当前元数据，但主机无法让检查和更改不可分割。其他客户端可能在其间更改元数据或 ID 与短名解析。中断的写入绝不自动重复。","Yìngyòng huì zài fāsòng qián jiǎnchá dāngqián yuán shùjù, dàn zhǔjī wúfǎ ràng jiǎnchá hé gēnggǎi bù kě fēngē. Qítā kèhùduān kěnéng zài qíjiān gēnggǎi yuán shùjù huò ID yǔ duǎnmíng jiěxī. Zhōngduàn de xiěrù jué bù zìdòng chóngfù."),
    ProjectChangeGrant("I approve this exact metadata change and understand the concurrent-change limit.","我同意此确切元数据更改，并理解并发更改限制。","Wǒ tóngyì cǐ quèqiè yuán shùjù gēnggǎi, bìng lǐjiě bìngfā gēnggǎi xiànzhì."),
    ProjectChangeUnknown("A project change may have reached the host. Inspect current projects and review its uncertainty before another change; do not repeat it.","项目更改可能已到达主机。另一项更改前请检查当前项目并审阅不确定结果；不要重复。","Xiàngmù gēnggǎi kěnéng yǐ dàodá zhǔjī. Lìng yí xiàng gēnggǎi qián qǐng jiǎnchá dāngqián xiàngmù bìng shěnyuè bù quèdìng jiéguǒ; bú yào chóngfù."),
    ProjectChangeRefused("The change was not sent or its target was missing. Read current projects before preparing another request.","更改未发送或目标缺失。准备另一请求前请读取当前项目。","Gēnggǎi wèi fāsòng huò mùbiāo quēshī. Zhǔnbèi lìng yī qǐngqiú qián qǐng dúqǔ dāngqián xiàngmù."),
    ProjectNoReturnedProject("The host returned no project details. Creation is not confirmed; inspect current inventory before another request.","主机未返回项目详情。尚未确认创建；另一请求前请检查当前列表。","Zhǔjī wèi fǎnhuí xiàngmù xiángqíng. Shàng wèi quèrèn chuàngjiàn; lìng yī qǐngqiú qián qǐng jiǎnchá dāngqián lièbiǎo."),
    ProjectCollision("This ID also matches another project's slug. Changes are disabled until the host identities are unambiguous.","此 ID 也匹配另一项目的短名。在主机身份明确前禁用更改。","Cǐ ID yě pǐpèi lìng yī xiàngmù de duǎnmíng. Zài zhǔjī shēnfèn míngquè qián jìnyòng gēnggǎi."),
    ProjectReloadInventory("Details differ from the stored inventory. Close details and read the full inventory again before editing.","详情与已读取列表不同。编辑前请关闭详情并重新读取完整列表。","Xiángqíng yǔ yǐ dúqǔ lièbiǎo bù tóng. Biānjí qián qǐng guānbì xiángqíng bìng chóngxīn dúqǔ wánzhěng lièbiǎo."),
    ProjectNoActive("The host reports no active-project pointer.","主机报告无活动项目指针。","Zhǔjī bàogào wú huódòng xiàngmù zhǐzhēn."),
    ProjectAlreadyActive("This project is already the reported active project.","此项目已是报告的活动项目。","Cǐ xiàngmù yǐ shì bàogào de huódòng xiàngmù."),
    ProjectReturnReceipts("Return to management receipts","返回管理记录","Fǎnhuí guǎnlǐ jìlù"),
    ProjectCreate("Create project","创建项目","Chuàngjiàn xiàngmù"),
    ProjectUpdate("Edit project","编辑项目","Biānjí xiàngmù"),
    ProjectAddFolder("Add host folder","添加主机文件夹","Tiānjiā zhǔjī wénjiànjiā"),
    ProjectRemoveFolder("Detach host folder","移除主机文件夹关联","Yíchú zhǔjī wénjiànjiā guānlián"),
    ProjectSetPrimary("Set primary folder","设置主文件夹","Shèzhì zhǔ wénjiànjiā"),
    ProjectArchive("Archive project","归档项目","Guīdàng xiàngmù"),
    ProjectRestore("Restore project","恢复项目","Huīfù xiàngmù"),
    ProjectDelete("Delete project metadata","删除项目元数据","Shānchú xiàngmù yuán shùjù"),
    ProjectSetActive("Set host active project","设置主机活动项目","Shèzhì zhǔjī huódòng xiàngmù"),
    ProjectClearActive("Clear host active project","清除主机活动项目","Qīngchú zhǔjī huódòng xiàngmù"),
    ProjectReceiptLocationChanged("This receipt belongs to a different reported project store. Verify its original profile location before reviewing it.","此记录属于另一个已报告的项目存储。审阅前请验证原始配置位置。","Cǐ jìlù shǔyú lìng yí gè yǐ bàogào de xiàngmù cúnchǔ. Shěnyuè qián qǐng yànzhèng yuánshǐ pèizhì wèizhì."),
    ProjectSharedPending("Unresolved project change","未解决的项目更改","Wèi jiějué de xiàngmù gēnggǎi"),
    ProjectSharedPrivate("Another connection or profile has an unresolved change in the same reported project store. Its private details are hidden.","另一连接或配置在相同的已报告项目存储中有未解决的更改。其私密详情已隐藏。","Lìng yī liánjiē huò pèizhì zài xiāngtóng de yǐ bàogào xiàngmù cúnchǔ zhōng yǒu wèi jiějué de gēnggǎi. Qí sīmì xiángqíng yǐ yǐncáng."),
    ProjectReviewEffect("Check that this profile still uses the same reported project store, then mark only this local uncertain receipt reviewed. This releases this device’s pending guard. It does not cancel, repeat or verify the host change. Inspect the host’s current projects before approving another change.","检查此配置是否仍使用相同的已报告项目存储，然后仅将此本地不确定记录标记为已审阅。这会解除此设备的待定保护，不会取消、重复或验证主机更改。批准另一项更改前，请检查主机当前项目。","Jiǎnchá cǐ pèizhì shìfǒu réng shǐyòng xiāngtóng de yǐ bàogào xiàngmù cúnchǔ, ránhòu jǐn jiāng cǐ běndì bù quèdìng jìlù biāojì wéi yǐ shěnyuè. Zhè huì jiěchú cǐ shèbèi de dàidìng bǎohù, bù huì qǔxiāo, chóngfù huò yànzhèng zhǔjī gēnggǎi. Pīzhǔn lìng yí xiàng gēnggǎi qián, qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī dāngqián xiàngmù."),
    ProjectReviewGrant("I understand that the host outcome remains uncertain and approve releasing this local guard.","我理解主机结果仍不确定，并同意解除此本地保护。","Wǒ lǐjiě zhǔjī jiéguǒ réng bù quèdìng, bìng tóngyì jiěchú cǐ běndì bǎohù."),
    ProjectReceiptPrivate("Original project names, descriptions and host paths are not stored in this receipt. Reading current projects does not repeat the change.","此记录不保存原始项目名称、说明和主机路径。读取当前项目不会重复更改。","Cǐ jìlù bù bǎocún yuánshǐ xiàngmù míngchēng, shuōmíng hé zhǔjī lùjìng. Dúqǔ dāngqián xiàngmù bù huì chóngfù gēnggǎi."),
    ProjectAcknowledged("The host acknowledged the project request.","主机已确认收到项目请求。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn shōudào xiàngmù qǐngqiú."),
    ProjectEffectReported("The reply reports the requested metadata effect.","回复报告了请求的元数据效果。","Huífù bàogào le qǐngqiú de yuán shùjù xiàoguǒ."),
    ProjectEffectUnreported("The reply does not establish the requested metadata effect.","回复未能证明请求的元数据效果。","Huífù wèi néng zhèngmíng qǐngqiú de yuán shùjù xiàoguǒ."),
    ProjectConfigurationObserved("A separate read observed matching project configuration.","单独读取观测到匹配的项目配置。","Dāndú dúqǔ guāncè dào pǐpèi de xiàngmù pèizhì."),
    ProjectConfigurationUnchecked("Matching project configuration has not been independently observed.","尚未独立观测到匹配的项目配置。","Shàng wèi dúlì guāncè dào pǐpèi de xiàngmù pèizhì."),
    ProjectPathMapping("The host normalized folder paths. Their mapping to the original input is not independently verified.","主机规范化了文件夹路径。尚未独立验证其与原始输入的对应关系。","Zhǔjī guīfànhuà le wénjiànjiā lùjìng. Shàng wèi dúlì yànzhèng qí yǔ yuánshǐ shūrù de duìyìng guānxì."),
    KanbanBoardControls("Board controls","看板控制","Kànbǎn kòngzhì"),
    KanbanBoardCreate("Create board","创建看板","Chuàngjiàn kànbǎn"),
    KanbanBoardUpdate("Edit board metadata","编辑看板元数据","Biānjí kànbǎn yuán shùjù"),
    KanbanBoardArchive("Archive board directory","归档看板目录","Guīdàng kànbǎn mùlù"),
    KanbanBoardDelete("Delete board directory","删除看板目录","Shānchú kànbǎn mùlù"),
    KanbanBoardSwitch("Set host current board","设置主机当前看板","Shèzhì zhǔjī dāngqián kànbǎn"),
    KanbanReadFirst("Read the board inventory before preparing changes.","请先读取看板清单，再准备更改。","Qǐng xiān dúqǔ kànbǎn qīngdān, zài zhǔnbèi gēnggǎi."),
    KanbanAnchorRequired("A non-archived default board with a reported database path is required to fence these writes. Read the inventory again or check the host.","这些写入需要一个未归档且报告数据库路径的默认看板。请重新读取清单或检查主机。","Zhèxiē xiěrù xūyào yí gè wèi guīdàng qiě bàogào shùjùkù lùjìng de mòrèn kànbǎn. Qǐng chóngxīn dúqǔ qīngdān huò jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    KanbanBoardInvalid("Choose a new valid slug or valid checked fields within their bounds. A project binding requires the separately read canonical project.","请选择新的有效短名或范围内的有效勾选字段。项目绑定需要单独读取的规范项目。","Qǐng xuǎnzé xīn de yǒuxiào duǎnmíng huò fànwéi nèi de yǒuxiào gōuxuǎn zìduàn. Xiàngmù bǎngdìng xūyào dāndú dúqǔ de guīfàn xiàngmù."),
    KanbanBoardName("Board display name","看板显示名称","Kànbǎn xiǎnshì míngchēng"),
    KanbanBoardSlug("Board slug","看板短名","Kànbǎn duǎnmíng"),
    KanbanBoardWorkdir("Host default workspace directory","主机默认工作目录","Zhǔjī mòrèn gōngzuò mùlù"),
    KanbanBoardSetWorkdir("Change default workspace directory","更改默认工作目录","Gēnggǎi mòrèn gōngzuò mùlù"),
    KanbanBoardSetProject("Change project binding","更改项目绑定","Gēnggǎi xiàngmù bǎngdìng"),
    KanbanBoardNoBinding("No project binding","不绑定项目","Bù bǎngdìng xiàngmù"),
    KanbanBoardReadProjects("Read host projects for binding","读取用于绑定的主机项目","Dúqǔ yòngyú bǎngdìng de zhǔjī xiàngmù"),
    KanbanBoardProjectsEffect("Open a separate authenticated gateway read for all stored projects in this access profile, including archived entries and private host paths. It does not write a board or activate a project.","单独打开已认证的网关读取，获取此访问配置的全部已保存项目，包括归档条目和私有主机路径。此操作不会写入看板或激活项目。","Dāndú dǎkāi yǐ rènzhèng de wǎngguān dúqǔ, huòqǔ cǐ fǎngwèn pèizhì de quánbù yǐ bǎocún xiàngmù, bāokuò guīdàng tiáomù hé sīyǒu zhǔjī lùjìng. Cǐ cāozuò bù huì xiěrù kànbǎn huò jīhuó xiàngmù."),
    KanbanBoardProjectsFirst("To choose a binding, close this draft and read host projects first. Only non-archived canonical IDs without known ID/slug collisions are offered. Clearing a binding needs no project lookup.","如需选择绑定，请关闭草稿并先读取主机项目。仅提供未归档且无已知 ID／短名冲突的规范 ID。清除绑定无需查找项目。","Rú xū xuǎnzé bǎngdìng, qǐng guānbì cǎogǎo bìng xiān dúqǔ zhǔjī xiàngmù. Jǐn tígōng wèi guīdàng qiě wú yǐzhī ID/duǎnmíng chōngtū de guīfàn ID. Qīngchú bǎngdìng wúxū cházhǎo xiàngmù."),
    KanbanBoardFields("Unchecked fields stay unchanged. Empty name uses the host’s derived name; empty description/icon/color saves empty text. Empty checked directory/project clears that value.","未勾选字段保持不变。空名称使用主机派生名称；空说明、图标或颜色保存为空文本。勾选后留空的目录或项目将被清除。","Wèi gōuxuǎn zìduàn bǎochí bù biàn. Kōng míngchēng shǐyòng zhǔjī pàishēng míngchēng; kōng shuōmíng, túbiāo huò yánsè bǎocún wéi kōng wénběn. Gōuxuǎn hòu liúkōng de mùlù huò xiàngmù jiāng bèi qīngchú."),
    KanbanBoardBindingEffect("On create, a blank directory can inherit the project’s primary folder. On edit, an omitted directory can inherit it; an explicitly empty directory prevents seeding. Clearing a binding keeps the directory unless separately changed. Host-resolved path identity is unverified here.","创建时，空目录可继承项目主文件夹。编辑时，省略目录可继承主文件夹；显式空目录会阻止填入。清除绑定会保留目录，除非另行更改。此处未验证主机解析的路径身份。","Chuàngjiàn shí, kōng mùlù kě jìchéng xiàngmù zhǔ wénjiànjiā. Biānjí shí, shěnglüè mùlù kě jìchéng zhǔ wénjiànjiā; xiǎnshì kōng mùlù huì zǔzhǐ tiánrù. Qīngchú bǎngdìng huì bǎoliú mùlù, chúfēi lìngxíng gēnggǎi. Cǐchù wèi yànzhèng zhǔjī jiěxī de lùjìng shēnfèn."),
    KanbanBoardCreateEffect("The reviewed slug must be absent, including archived entries. Create explicitly keeps switch off. The host has no create-only token: if another client takes the slug after checking, this request can update that existing metadata and clear its archive flag. A matching readback does not prove a newly created board.","审阅的短名必须不存在，包括归档条目。创建时显式关闭切换。主机没有仅创建令牌：若其他客户端在检查后占用短名，此请求可更新已有元数据并清除归档标记。匹配的回读不能证明新建了看板。","Shěnyuè de duǎnmíng bìxū bù cúnzài, bāokuò guīdàng tiáomù. Chuàngjiàn shí xiǎnshì guānbì qiēhuàn. Zhǔjī méiyǒu jǐn chuàngjiàn lìngpái: ruò qítā kèhùduān zài jiǎnchá hòu zhànyòng duǎnmíng, cǐ qǐngqiú kě gēngxīn yǐyǒu yuán shùjù bìng qīngchú guīdàng biāojì. Pǐpèi de huídú bù néng zhèngmíng xīnjiàn le kànbǎn."),
    KanbanBoardEditEffect("This edits the board’s metadata and defaults for future tasks. Existing tasks/workers are not moved or stopped. Editing an archived entry changes its tombstone, not its archived copy. The slug is immutable.","此操作编辑看板元数据及未来任务的默认值。已有任务或工作进程不会被移动或停止。编辑归档条目更改的是墓碑记录，而非归档副本。短名不可更改。","Cǐ cāozuò biānjí kànbǎn yuán shùjù jí wèilái rènwù de mòrèn zhí. Yǐyǒu rènwù huò gōngzuò jìnchéng bù huì bèi yídòng huò tíngzhǐ. Biānjí guīdàng tiáomù gēnggǎi de shì mùbēi jìlù, ér fēi guīdàng fùběn. Duǎnmíng bù kě gēnggǎi."),
    KanbanBoardArchiveEffect("The host moves this board directory into its archive area and leaves an archived tombstone. Contained databases, workspaces, logs and attachments move with it. Workers are not stopped; host path overrides may leave data elsewhere. Removing a reported-current board can clear the stored current pointer before the move. A later failure may leave partial effects.","主机将此看板目录移入归档区域，并留下归档墓碑记录。其中的数据库、工作区、日志和附件会一起移动。工作进程不会停止；主机路径覆盖可使数据保留在其他位置。移除报告为当前的看板可在移动前清除已保存的当前指针。后续失败可能留下部分效果。","Zhǔjī jiāng cǐ kànbǎn mùlù yírù guīdàng qūyù, bìng liúxià guīdàng mùbēi jìlù. Qízhōng de shùjùkù, gōngzuòqū, rìzhì hé fùjiàn huì yìqǐ yídòng. Gōngzuò jìnchéng bù huì tíngzhǐ; zhǔjī lùjìng fùgài kě shǐ shùjù bǎoliú zài qítā wèizhì. Yíchú bàogào wéi dāngqián de kànbǎn kě zài yídòng qián qīngchú yǐ bǎocún de dāngqián zhǐzhēn. Hòuxù shībài kěnéng liúxià bùfen xiàoguǒ."),
    KanbanBoardDeleteEffect("The host recursively deletes this board directory and its contained database, workspaces, logs and attachments. Workers are not stopped. Path overrides and earlier archived copies can leave data elsewhere. Deleting an archived entry removes its tombstone, not its previously archived directory. The stored current pointer can change before deletion; a later failure can leave partial effects.","主机递归删除此看板目录及其中的数据库、工作区、日志和附件。工作进程不会停止。路径覆盖和早期归档副本可使数据保留在其他位置。删除归档条目会移除墓碑记录，而非先前的归档目录。已保存的当前指针可在删除前改变；后续失败可能留下部分效果。","Zhǔjī dìguī shānchú cǐ kànbǎn mùlù jí qízhōng de shùjùkù, gōngzuòqū, rìzhì hé fùjiàn. Gōngzuò jìnchéng bù huì tíngzhǐ. Lùjìng fùgài hé zǎoqī guīdàng fùběn kě shǐ shùjù bǎoliú zài qítā wèizhì. Shānchú guīdàng tiáomù huì yíchú mùbēi jìlù, ér fēi xiānqián de guīdàng mùlù. Yǐ bǎocún de dāngqián zhǐzhēn kě zài shānchú qián gǎibiàn; hòuxù shībài kěnéng liúxià bùfen xiàoguǒ."),
    KanbanBoardSwitchEffect("Write the host’s shared current-board pointer for callers without an explicit board. This phone’s browsing choice stays local. A successful reply reports the requested slug; fresh inventory may still reflect host environment overrides. This does not dispatch work or adopt a chat workspace.","为未指定看板的调用者写入主机共享的当前看板指针。手机的浏览选择仍为本地选择。成功回复报告请求的短名；新清单仍可能反映主机环境覆盖。此操作不会调度工作或采用聊天工作区。","Wèi wèi zhǐdìng kànbǎn de diàoyòngzhě xiěrù zhǔjī gòngxiǎng de dāngqián kànbǎn zhǐzhēn. Shǒujī de liúlǎn xuǎnzé réng wéi běndì xuǎnzé. Chénggōng huífù bàogào qǐngqiú de duǎnmíng; xīn qīngdān réng kěnéng fǎnyìng zhǔjī huánjìng fùgài. Cǐ cāozuò bù huì diàodù gōngzuò huò cǎiyòng liáotiān gōngzuòqū."),
    KanbanBoardConcurrency("The host provides no atomic revision/check-and-write guard. Another client can change the board, project resolution or paths after preflight. Interrupted or failed attempts are never automatically repeated.","主机不提供原子修订或检查后写入保护。其他客户端可在预检后更改看板、项目解析或路径。中断或失败的尝试绝不会自动重复。","Zhǔjī bù tígōng yuánzǐ xiūdìng huò jiǎnchá hòu xiěrù bǎohù. Qítā kèhùduān kě zài yùjiǎn hòu gēnggǎi kànbǎn, xiàngmù jiěxī huò lùjìng. Zhōngduàn huò shībài de chángshì jué bù huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    KanbanBoardGrant("I approve this exact board request and its shared-storage, path and concurrent-change effects.","我批准此精确看板请求及其共享存储、路径和并发更改效果。","Wǒ pīzhǔn cǐ jīngquè kànbǎn qǐngqiú jí qí gòngxiǎng cúnchǔ, lùjìng hé bìngfā gēnggǎi xiàoguǒ."),
    KanbanBoardDeleteSlug("Type the exact board slug to approve directory deletion","输入精确看板短名以批准删除目录","Shūrù jīngquè kànbǎn duǎnmíng yǐ pīzhǔn shānchú mùlù"),
    KanbanBoardDefaultProtected("The default board cannot be archived or deleted.","默认看板不能归档或删除。","Mòrèn kànbǎn bù néng guīdàng huò shānchú."),
    KanbanBoardArchivedControls("This is an archived tombstone. Edit/delete affect this entry; switching or restoring its archived files is unavailable here.","这是归档墓碑记录。编辑或删除影响此条目；此处无法切换或恢复归档文件。","Zhè shì guīdàng mùbēi jìlù. Biānjí huò shānchú yǐngxiǎng cǐ tiáomù; cǐchù wúfǎ qiēhuàn huò huīfù guīdàng wénjiàn."),
    KanbanBoardUnknown("The board attempt may have partially applied. Read current configuration and inspect the host; do not repeat it automatically. The shared local barrier needs a separate explicit review.","看板尝试可能已部分生效。请读取当前配置并检查主机；不要自动重复。共享本地屏障需要单独明确审阅。","Kànbǎn chángshì kěnéng yǐ bùfen shēngxiào. Qǐng dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì bìng jiǎnchá zhǔjī; bù yào zìdòng chóngfù. Gòngxiǎng běndì píngzhàng xūyào dāndú míngquè shěnyuè."),
    KanbanBoardReadbackPending("The host acknowledgement is retained. A fresh matching configuration read is still needed; no write will be replayed.","主机确认已保留。仍需重新读取匹配配置；不会重放写入。","Zhǔjī quèrèn yǐ bǎoliú. Réng xū chóngxīn dúqǔ pǐpèi pèizhì; bù huì chóngfàng xiěrù."),
    KanbanBoardAcknowledged("Host acknowledged the board request","主机已确认看板请求","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn kànbǎn qǐngqiú"),
    KanbanBoardObserved("Matching board configuration observed","已观测到匹配的看板配置","Yǐ guāncè dào pǐpèi de kànbǎn pèizhì"),
    KanbanBoardEffectNotReported("The reply did not report every requested field effect. Inspect current configuration.","回复未报告所有请求字段的效果。请检查当前配置。","Huífù wèi bàogào suǒyǒu qǐngqiú zìduàn de xiàoguǒ. Qǐng jiǎnchá dāngqián pèizhì."),
    KanbanBoardReceiptBoundary("This receipt does not prove new-board creation, path equivalence, file erasure or worker shutdown. Private values are omitted from durable summaries.","此收据不能证明新建看板、路径等价、文件擦除或工作进程停止。持久摘要省略私有值。","Cǐ shōujù bù néng zhèngmíng xīnjiàn kànbǎn, lùjìng děngjià, wénjiàn cāchú huò gōngzuò jìnchéng tíngzhǐ. Chíjiǔ zhāiyào shěnglüè sīyǒu zhí."),
    KanbanBoardArchivePath("Host-reported archive path","主机报告的归档路径","Zhǔjī bàogào de guīdàng lùjìng"),
    KanbanBoardReturnReceipts("Return to management receipts","返回管理收据","Fǎnhuí guǎnlǐ shōujù"),
    HostKanban("Host Kanban boards","主机 Kanban 看板","Zhǔjī Kanban kànbǎn"),
    KanbanTaskAdvanced("Assignment, workspace and execution options","分配、工作区和执行选项","Fēnpèi, gōngzuòqū hé zhíxíng xuǎnxiàng"),
    KanbanTaskParentLimit("Select up to 128 dependencies from the current board observation.","可从当前看板观测中选择最多 128 项依赖任务。","Kě cóng dāngqián kànbǎn guāncè zhōng xuǎnzé zuìduō yìbǎi èrshíbā xiàng yīlài rènwù."),
    KanbanTaskCreateReadFirst("Read the board inventory and selected board before creating a task.","创建任务前请读取看板清单和所选看板。","Chuàngjiàn rènwù qián qǐng dúqǔ kànbǎn qīngdān hé suǒ xuǎn kànbǎn."),
    KanbanTaskWorkspace("Requested workspace kind","请求的工作区类型","Qǐngqiú de gōngzuòqū lèixíng"),
    KanbanTaskPath("Requested host workspace path","请求的主机工作区路径","Qǐngqiú de zhǔjī gōngzuòqū lùjìng"),
    KanbanTaskSetBodyCreate("Supply a description","提供任务说明","Tígōng rènwù shuōmíng"),
    KanbanTaskSetAssignee("Supply an assignee","提供受派配置","Tígōng shòupài pèizhì"),
    KanbanTaskSetTenant("Supply a tenant","提供租户","Tígōng zūhù"),
    KanbanTaskSetPath("Supply a workspace path","提供工作区路径","Tígōng gōngzuòqū lùjìng"),
    KanbanTaskSetRuntime("Supply a positive runtime limit","提供正数运行时限","Tígōng zhèngshù yùnxíng shíxiàn"),
    KanbanTaskSetSkills("Supply skill selection","提供技能选择","Tígōng jìnéng xuǎnzé"),
    KanbanTaskSetTurns("Supply a positive goal turn limit","提供正数目标轮次上限","Tígōng zhèngshù mùbiāo lúncì shàngxiàn"),
    KanbanTaskSetModel("Supply a task model","提供任务模型","Tígōng rènwù móxíng"),
    KanbanTaskSetProvider("Supply a provider with the model","随模型提供提供商","Suí móxíng tígōng tígōngshāng"),
    KanbanTaskWorkspaceDefault("Use host / board defaults","使用主机或看板默认值","Shǐyòng zhǔjī huò kànbǎn mòrèn zhí"),
    KanbanTaskScratch("Scratch workspace","临时工作区","Línshí gōngzuòqū"),
    KanbanTaskDirectory("Directory workspace","目录工作区","Mùlù gōngzuòqū"),
    KanbanTaskWorktree("Git worktree workspace","Git 工作树工作区","Git gōngzuòshù gōngzuòqū"),
    KanbanTaskProjectInherit("Inherit the board project when applicable","适用时继承看板项目","Shìyòng shí jìchéng kànbǎn xiàngmù"),
    KanbanTaskProjectOptOut("Explicitly use no project","明确不使用项目","Míngquè bù shǐyòng xiàngmù"),
    KanbanTaskProjectRead("Canonical project choices require a separate approved read in the board browser. Close this form to load them, or explicitly opt out of project linkage.","规范项目选项需要在看板浏览器中单独批准读取。请关闭此表单以加载，或明确不关联项目。","Guīfàn xiàngmù xuǎnxiàng xūyào zài kànbǎn liúlǎnqì zhōng dāndú pīzhǔn dúqǔ. Qǐng guānbì cǐ biǎodān yǐ jiāzài, huò míngquè bù guānlián xiàngmù."),
    KanbanTaskTriageCreate("Hold in triage","保留在分诊状态","Bǎoliú zài fēnzhěn zhuàngtài"),
    KanbanTaskPickParents("Choose dependencies from this board","从此看板选择依赖任务","Cóng cǐ kànbǎn xuǎnzé yīlài rènwù"),
    KanbanTaskSkillLines("Enter one skill per line. Names are trimmed and duplicates removed; an explicitly empty list requests no skills. The host decides which names it supports.","每行输入一项技能。名称去除首尾空白并删除重复项；明确的空列表请求不使用技能。主机决定支持哪些名称。","Měi háng shūrù yí xiàng jìnéng. Míngchēng qùchú shǒuwěi kòngbái bìng shānchú chóngfù xiàng; míngquè de kōng lièbiǎo qǐngqiú bù shǐyòng jìnéng. Zhǔjī juédìng zhīchí nǎxiē míngchēng."),
    KanbanTaskCreateInvalid("Enter a nonblank title and valid optional values. Priority is a signed 32-bit integer; runtime and turn limits must be positive. Provider requires a model; project linkage requires current canonical project choices.","请输入非空标题和有效可选值。优先级为有符号 32 位整数；运行时限和轮次上限必须为正数。提供商需要模型；项目关联需要当前规范项目选项。","Qǐng shūrù fēi kōng biāotí hé yǒuxiào kěxuǎn zhí. Yōuxiānjí wéi yǒu fúhào sānshí'èr wèi zhěngshù; yùnxíng shíxiàn hé lúncì shàngxiàn bìxū wéi zhèngshù. Tígōngshāng xūyào móxíng; xiàngmù guānlián xūyào dāngqián guīfàn xiàngmù xuǎnxiàng."),
    KanbanTaskCreateEffect("Ready work may be assigned or started immediately by an existing dispatcher. Parents may supply tenant and delivery subscriptions. Triage defers dispatch; it does not guarantee future inactivity. Preflight refreshes the board, dependencies and any canonical project before one creation attempt.","就绪任务可能立即被现有调度器分配或启动。父任务可能提供租户和投递订阅。分诊推迟调度，但不保证将来不会运行。单次创建尝试前，预检会刷新看板、依赖和相关规范项目。","Jiùxù rènwù kěnéng lìjí bèi xiànyǒu diàodùqì fēnpèi huò qǐdòng. Fù rènwù kěnéng tígōng zūhù hé tóudì dìngyuè. Fēnzhěn tuīchí diàodù, dàn bù bǎozhèng jiānglái bú huì yùnxíng. Dāncì chuàngjiàn chángshì qián, yùjiǎn huì shuāxīn kànbǎn, yīlài hé xiāngguān guīfàn xiàngmù."),
    KanbanTaskProjectEffect("Omitted project selection can inherit the board project; scratch opts out of that inheritance. An explicitly selected project with a primary repository can promote scratch to a worktree. The host may derive paths, branches and initial status. Configuration readback does not prove path identity, runtime adoption or exclusive creation of a new task.","省略项目选择可继承看板项目；临时工作区不继承。明确选择具有主仓库的项目可将临时工作区提升为工作树。主机可能派生路径、分支和初始状态。配置回读不能证明路径身份、运行时采用或独占创建了新任务。","Shěnglüè xiàngmù xuǎnzé kě jìchéng kànbǎn xiàngmù; línshí gōngzuòqū bù jìchéng. Míngquè xuǎnzé jùyǒu zhǔ cāngkù de xiàngmù kě jiāng línshí gōngzuòqū tíshēng wéi gōngzuòshù. Zhǔjī kěnéng pàishēng lùjìng, fēnzhī hé chūshǐ zhuàngtài. Pèizhì huídú bù néng zhèngmíng lùjìng shēnfèn, yùnxíngshí cǎiyòng huò dúzhàn chuàngjiàn le xīn rènwù."),
    KanbanTaskEdit("Edit task text","编辑任务文本","Biānjí rènwù wénběn"),
    KanbanTaskPriority("Change task priority","更改任务优先级","Gēnggǎi rènwù yōuxiānjí"),
    KanbanTaskAssign("Assign or unassign task","分配或取消分配任务","Fēnpèi huò qǔxiāo fēnpèi rènwù"),
    KanbanTaskComment("Add task comment","添加任务评论","Tiānjiā rènwù pínglùn"),
    KanbanTaskDelete("Delete host task","删除主机任务","Shānchú zhǔjī rènwù"),
    KanbanTaskCreate("Create host task","创建主机任务","Chuàngjiàn zhǔjī rènwù"),
    KanbanTaskLink("Add task dependency","添加任务依赖","Tiānjiā rènwù yīlài"),
    KanbanTaskUnlink("Remove task dependency","移除任务依赖","Yíchú rènwù yīlài"),
    KanbanDependencyNone("This task has no dependencies to remove.","此任务没有可移除的依赖。","Cǐ rènwù méiyǒu kě yíchú de yīlài."),
    KanbanDependencyRunning("A dependency cannot be added to a running task. Read its current state before trying again.","无法向运行中的任务添加依赖。重试前请读取其当前状态。","Wúfǎ xiàng yùnxíng zhōng de rènwù tiānjiā yīlài. Chóngshì qián qǐng dúqǔ qí dāngqián zhuàngtài."),
    KanbanDependencyNoCandidates("No additional dependency is available in this board snapshot. Refresh the board to see new tasks.","此看板快照中没有其他可选依赖。刷新看板以查看新任务。","Cǐ kànbǎn kuàizhào zhōng méiyǒu qítā kě xuǎn yīlài. Shuāxīn kànbǎn yǐ chákàn xīn rènwù."),
    KanbanDependencyChild("Dependent task (child)","依赖方任务（子任务）","Yīlài fāng rènwù (zǐ rènwù)"),
    KanbanDependencyParent("Dependency (parent task)","被依赖的任务（父任务）","Bèi yīlài de rènwù (fù rènwù)"),
    KanbanDependencyDirection("Direction: the child depends on the parent. Selecting a parent does not change either task.","方向：子任务依赖父任务。选择父任务不会更改任一任务。","Fāngxiàng: zǐ rènwù yīlài fù rènwù. Xuǎnzé fù rènwù bù huì gēnggǎi rènyī rènwù."),
    KanbanDependencyRead("Review a fresh read of both tasks","审阅两个任务的最新读取","Shěnyuè liǎng gè rènwù de zuìxīn dúqǔ"),
    KanbanDependencyReadEffect("Approval reads private details for both displayed task IDs using this host, profile and board. This read does not add or remove a dependency. A separate exact request review and approval follows.","批准后将使用此主机、配置和看板读取两个所示任务 ID 的私有详情。此读取不会添加或移除依赖。随后还需单独审阅并批准精确请求。","Pīzhǔn hòu jiāng shǐyòng cǐ zhǔjī, pèizhì hé kànbǎn dúqǔ liǎng gè suǒ shì rènwù ID de sīyǒu xiángqíng. Cǐ dúqǔ bù huì tiānjiā huò yíchú yīlài. Suíhòu hái xū dāndú shěnyuè bìng pīzhǔn jīngquè qǐngqiú."),
    KanbanDependencyLinkEffect("Adding this edge can move ready work to waiting and inherit the parent’s notification subscriptions. The host checks cycles and running-task races. This does not stop a worker.","添加此依赖可能将就绪任务转为等待，并继承父任务的通知订阅。主机会检查循环依赖及运行状态竞争。此操作不会停止工作进程。","Tiānjiā cǐ yīlài kěnéng jiāng jiùxù rènwù zhuǎn wéi děngdài, bìng jìchéng fù rènwù de tōngzhī dìngyuè. Zhǔjī huì jiǎnchá xúnhuán yīlài jí yùnxíng zhuàngtài jìngzhēng. Cǐ cāozuò bù huì tíngzhǐ gōngzuò jìnchéng."),
    KanbanDependencyUnlinkEffect("Removing this edge can make waiting work ready for a running dispatcher. The host may acknowledge that no edge was removed. Neither acknowledgement nor a matching later read proves worker shutdown or exclusive causation.","移除此依赖可能使等待任务就绪并被活动调度器启动。主机可能确认未移除任何依赖。确认或随后匹配的读取均不能证明工作进程已停止或变化仅由此操作引起。","Yíchú cǐ yīlài kěnéng shǐ děngdài rènwù jiùxù bìng bèi huódòng diàodùqì qǐdòng. Zhǔjī kěnéng quèrèn wèi yíchú rènhé yīlài. Quèrèn huò suíhòu pǐpèi de dúqǔ jūn bù néng zhèngmíng gōngzuò jìnchéng yǐ tíngzhǐ huò biànhuà jǐn yóu cǐ cāozuò yǐnqǐ."),
    KanbanTaskTitle("Task title","任务标题","Rènwù biāotí"),
    KanbanTaskSetTitle("Change title","更改标题","Gēnggǎi biāotí"),
    KanbanTaskSetBody("Change description (empty clears it)","更改说明（留空清除）","Gēnggǎi shuōmíng (liúkòng qīngchú)"),
    KanbanTaskAuthor("Declared comment author","声明的评论作者","Shēngmíng de pínglùn zuòzhě"),
    KanbanTaskCommentBody("Comment text","评论文本","Pínglùn wénběn"),
    KanbanTaskReadFirst("Read the board inventory, this board and task details before editing.","编辑前请读取看板清单、此看板和任务详情。","Biānjí qián qǐng dúqǔ kànbǎn qīngdān, cǐ kànbǎn hé rènwù xiángqíng."),
    KanbanTaskInvalid("Select text fields to change and enter valid values. Priority must be a signed 32-bit integer; title, comment and declared author cannot be blank.","请选择要更改的文本字段并输入有效值。优先级须为有符号 32 位整数；标题、评论和声明作者不能为空。","Qǐng xuǎnzé yào gēnggǎi de wénběn zìduàn bìng shūrù yǒuxiào zhí. Yōuxiānjí xū wéi yǒu fúhào sānshí'èr wèi zhěngshù; biāotí, pínglùn hé shēngmíng zuòzhě bù néng wéi kōng."),
    KanbanTaskAssignEffect("An empty assignee explicitly unassigns. The host trims and lowercases the name. Assignment can clear the failure streak and make ready work available to a running dispatcher; a claimed running task may refuse.","受派配置留空会明确取消分配。主机会去除首尾空白并转为小写。分配可清除连续失败计数并使就绪任务可被调度；已认领的运行任务可能拒绝。","Shòupài pèizhì liúkòng huì míngquè qǔxiāo fēnpèi. Zhǔjī huì qùchú shǒuwěi kòngbái bìng zhuǎn wéi xiǎoxiě. Fēnpèi kě qīngchú liánxù shībài jìshù bìng shǐ jiùxù rènwù kě bèi diàodù; yǐ rènlǐng de yùnxíng rènwù kěnéng jùjué."),
    KanbanTaskCommentEffect("The author is a declared label, not verified identity. The host returns no created comment ID; acknowledgement cannot identify your exact comment even if matching text is later visible.","作者是声明标签，并非已验证身份。主机不返回新评论 ID；即使稍后可见相同文本，确认也不能识别您的确切评论。","Zuòzhě shì shēngmíng biāoqiān, bìng fēi yǐ yànzhèng shēnfèn. Zhǔjī bù fǎnhuí xīn pínglùn ID; jíshǐ shāohòu kějiàn xiāngtóng wénběn, quèrèn yě bù néng shíbié nín de quèqiè pínglùn."),
    KanbanTaskDeleteEffect("Deletion removes task records, dependencies, comments, events, attempts and subscriptions and can release other work. It does not use the worker-stop path. File erasure and active-process termination are unverified.","删除会移除任务记录、依赖、评论、事件、尝试和订阅，并可能释放其他任务。它不使用停止工作进程的路径。文件擦除和活动进程终止未经验证。","Shānchú huì yíchú rènwù jìlù, yīlài, pínglùn, shìjiàn, chángshì hé dìngyuè, bìng kěnéng shìfàng qítā rènwù. Tā bù shǐyòng tíngzhǐ gōngzuò jìnchéng de lùjìng. Wénjiàn cāchú hé huódòng jìnchéng zhōngzhǐ wèi jīng yànzhèng."),
    KanbanTaskEditEffect("Only the displayed fields are sent in this one request. Host observers may run after a committed write. Another client or worker can change the task after preflight; a failed or lost reply may still follow a write.","此单次请求仅发送所显示的字段。提交写入后主机观察器可能运行。其他客户端或工作进程可在预检后更改任务；失败或丢失的回复仍可能发生在写入之后。","Cǐ dāncì qǐngqiú jǐn fāsòng suǒ xiǎnshì de zìduàn. Tíjiāo xiěrù hòu zhǔjī guāncháqì kěnéng yùnxíng. Qítā kèhùduān huò gōngzuò jìnchéng kě zài yùjiǎn hòu gēnggǎi rènwù; shībài huò diūshī de huífù réng kěnéng fāshēng zài xiěrù zhīhòu."),
    KanbanTaskGrant("I approve this exact task request and the displayed effects.","我批准此精确任务请求及所显示的效果。","Wǒ pīzhǔn cǐ jīngquè rènwù qǐngqiú jí suǒ xiǎnshì de xiàoguǒ."),
    KanbanTaskDeleteId("Type the exact task ID to approve deletion","输入精确任务 ID 以批准删除","Shūrù jīngquè rènwù ID yǐ pīzhǔn shānchú"),
    KanbanTaskUnknown("The task request may have applied. Inspect the host and review the pending receipt separately before another write. Nothing will be replayed automatically.","任务请求可能已生效。请检查主机并单独审阅待处理收据后再写入。不会自动重放任何请求。","Rènwù qǐngqiú kěnéng yǐ shēngxiào. Qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī bìng dāndú shěnyuè dài chǔlǐ shōujù hòu zài xiěrù. Bù huì zìdòng chóngfàng rènhé qǐngqiú."),
    KanbanTaskAcknowledged("Host acknowledged the task request","主机已确认任务请求","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn rènwù qǐngqiú"),
    KanbanTaskObserved("Matching stored task configuration observed","已观测到匹配的任务存储配置","Yǐ guāncè dào pǐpèi de rènwù cúnchǔ pèizhì"),
    KanbanTaskReceiptBoundary("This receipt does not prove worker health, shutdown, file erasure, runtime adoption or creation of a particular task/comment. Private request values stay out of durable summaries.","此收据不能证明工作进程健康、停止、文件擦除、运行时采用或创建了某个任务或评论。持久摘要不保存私有请求值。","Cǐ shōujù bù néng zhèngmíng gōngzuò jìnchéng jiànkāng, tíngzhǐ, wénjiàn cāchú, yùnxíngshí cǎiyòng huò chuàngjiàn le mǒu gè rènwù huò pínglùn. Chíjiǔ zhāiyào bù bǎocún sīyǒu qǐngqiú zhí."),
    KanbanInventoryRead("Read board inventory","读取看板清单","Dúqǔ kànbǎn qīngdān"),
    KanbanBoardRead("Read this board","读取此看板","Dúqǔ cǐ kànbǎn"),
    KanbanTaskRead("Refresh task details","刷新任务详情","Shuāxīn rènwù xiángqíng"),
    KanbanReadEffect("The host can load the Kanban plugin and initialize, migrate or repair board storage during reads. Task text, comments, summaries and host paths may be private.","主机可在读取时加载 Kanban 插件并初始化、迁移或修复看板存储。任务文本、评论、摘要和主机路径可能属于隐私。","Zhǔjī kě zài dúqǔ shí jiāzài Kanban chājiàn bìng chūshǐhuà, qiānyí huò xiūfù kànbǎn cúnchǔ. Rènwù wénběn, pínglùn, zhāiyào hé zhǔjī lùjìng kěnéng shǔyú yǐnsī."),
    KanbanBoundary("These boards belong to the host’s shared Kanban storage, accessed through this management profile. They are separate from local phone tasks. Selection here is local; the host’s current-board pointer is only reported.","这些看板属于主机共享的 Kanban 存储，通过此管理配置访问，与手机本地任务相互独立。此处选择仅在手机生效；主机的当前看板指针仅用于显示。","Zhèxiē kànbǎn shǔyú zhǔjī gòngxiǎng de Kanban cúnchǔ, tōngguò cǐ guǎnlǐ pèizhì fǎngwèn, yǔ shǒujī běndì rènwù xiānghù dúlì. Cǐchù xuǎnzé jǐn zài shǒujī shēngxiào; zhǔjī de dāngqián kànbǎn zhǐzhēn jǐn yòngyú xiǎnshì."),
    KanbanObservation("This is a stored observation. Counts and task details can change between reads. Reported paths do not prove filesystem identity, and task/run status or a heartbeat does not establish current worker health.","这是已存储状态的一次观测。计数和任务详情可在读取之间改变。报告的路径无法证明文件系统身份，任务或运行状态及心跳也不代表工作进程当前健康。","Zhè shì yǐ cúnchǔ zhuàngtài de yí cì guāncè. Jìshù hé rènwù xiángqíng kě zài dúqǔ zhījiān gǎibiàn. Bàogào de lùjìng wúfǎ zhèngmíng wénjiàn xìtǒng shēnfèn, rènwù huò yùnxíng zhuàngtài jí xīntiào yě bù dàibiǎo gōngzuò jìnchéng dāngqián jiànkāng."),
    KanbanUnsupported("Kanban data is unavailable, oversized or unsupported. The host may not have the Kanban plugin enabled.","Kanban 数据不可用、过大或不受支持。主机可能未启用 Kanban 插件。","Kanban shùjù bù kěyòng, guò dà huò bù shòu zhīchí. Zhǔjī kěnéng wèi qǐyòng Kanban chājiàn."),
    KanbanScopeChanged("The access profile or reported board location changed. Refresh management access and the board inventory, then review again.","访问配置或报告的看板位置已更改。请刷新管理访问和看板清单，然后重新审阅。","Fǎngwèn pèizhì huò bàogào de kànbǎn wèizhì yǐ gēnggǎi. Qǐng shuāxīn guǎnlǐ fǎngwèn hé kànbǎn qīngdān, ránhòu chóngxīn shěnyuè."),
    KanbanArchivedRead("Archived board metadata only; archived boards cannot be opened.","仅显示已归档看板的元数据；无法打开已归档看板。","Jǐn xiǎnshì yǐ guīdàng kànbǎn de yuán shùjù; wúfǎ dǎkāi yǐ guīdàng kànbǎn."),
