    KanbanAttachmentInfo("Files stay on the host. Attachment contents are not downloaded. Event payloads, arbitrary run metadata and stored file paths are omitted from this view.","文件保留在主机上，附件内容不会被下载。此视图省略事件载荷、任意运行元数据和存储文件路径。","Wénjiàn bǎoliú zài zhǔjī shàng, fùjiàn nèiróng bù huì bèi xiàzài. Cǐ shìtú shěnglüè shìjiàn zàihè, rènyì yùnxíng yuán shùjù hé cúnchǔ wénjiàn lùjìng."),
