    HostProjectsRead("Read stored projects","读取已保存的项目","Dúqǔ yǐ bǎocún de xiàngmù"),
    HostProjectsReadEffect("Open one authenticated gateway connection and read stored projects for this profile. Project names, descriptions and host folder paths may be private.","打开一次已认证的网关连接，读取此配置的已保存项目。项目名称、说明和主机文件夹路径可能属于隐私。","Dǎkāi yí cì yǐ rènzhèng de wǎngguān liánjiē, dúqǔ cǐ pèizhì de yǐ bǎocún xiàngmù. Xiàngmù míngchēng, shuōmíng hé zhǔjī wénjiànjiā lùjìng kěnéng shǔyú yǐnsī."),
    HostProjectsBoundary("The host’s active-project pointer is separate from this phone’s chat workspace. Folder entries describe host directories.","主机的活动项目指针与手机的聊天工作目录相互独立。文件夹条目描述主机目录。","Zhǔjī de huódòng xiàngmù zhǐzhēn yǔ shǒujī de liáotiān gōngzuò mùlù xiānghù dúlì. Wénjiànjiā tiáomù miáoshù zhǔjī mùlù."),
    HostProjectsScopeChanged("The selected profile or its location changed. Refresh management access and review again.","所选配置或其位置已更改。请刷新管理访问并重新审阅。","Suǒ xuǎn pèizhì huò qí wèizhì yǐ gēnggǎi. Qǐng shuāxīn guǎnlǐ fǎngwèn bìng chóngxīn shěnyuè."),
    HostProjectsUnsupported("Project metadata is unavailable, oversized or unsupported by this host.","项目元数据不可用、过大或不受此主机支持。","Xiàngmù yuán shùjù bù kěyòng, guò dà huò bù shòu cǐ zhǔjī zhīchí."),
