    HostProjectsReload("Verified management access and a supported profile with a reported location are required.","需要已验证的管理访问，以及报告位置的受支持配置。","Xūyào yǐ yànzhèng de guǎnlǐ fǎngwèn, yǐjí bàogào wèizhì de shòu zhīchí pèizhì."),

    RelayCodeUnchecked("Code issued; redemption status has not been checked.","代码已发出；尚未检查兑换状态。","Dàimǎ yǐ fāchū; shàng wèi jiǎnchá duìhuàn zhuàngtài."),
    RelayCodeCreate("Create link code","创建关联代码","Chuàngjiàn guānlián dàimǎ"),
    RelayCodeCreateEffect("Create one code for this shared-bot platform and instance? Whoever sends it to the bot can link their chat account to this instance. Keep it private. This does not open a bot or send a message, and a new code does not cancel older codes. Interrupted requests stay uncertain and are never automatically repeated.","为此共享机器人平台及实例创建一个代码？向机器人发送代码的人可将其聊天账户关联到此实例。请保密。此操作不会打开机器人或发送消息，新代码也不会取消旧代码。中断的请求保持不确定，绝不自动重复。","Wèi cǐ gòngxiǎng jīqìrén píngtái jí shílì chuàngjiàn yí gè dàimǎ? Xiàng jīqìrén fāsòng dàimǎ de rén kě jiāng qí liáotiān zhànghù guānlián dào cǐ shílì. Qǐng bǎomì. Cǐ cāozuò bù huì dǎkāi jīqìrén huò fāsòng xiāoxi, xīn dàimǎ yě bù huì qǔxiāo jiù dàimǎ. Zhōngduàn de qǐngqiú bǎochí bù quèdìng, jué bù zìdòng chóngfù."),
    RelayCodeCreateGrant("I approve creating this private link code.","我同意创建此私密关联代码。","Wǒ tóngyì chuàngjiàn cǐ sīmì guānlián dàimǎ."),
    RelayCodeRetention("The local copy is encrypted for up to 15 minutes, or until an earlier reported expiry. Closing keeps that saved copy. Clearing it, signing out or its local expiry does not revoke the remote code. Status checks send the original code back to this Hermes server.","本地副本会加密保存最多十五分钟，或至主机报告的更早到期时间。关闭会保留已保存副本。清除副本、退出登录或本地到期均不会撤销远程代码。状态检查会将原始代码发回此 Hermes 服务器。","Běndì fùběn huì jiāmì bǎocún zuìduō shíwǔ fēnzhōng, huò zhì zhǔjī bàogào de gèng zǎo dàoqī shíjiān. Guānbì huì bǎoliú yǐ bǎocún fùběn. Qīngchú fùběn, tuìchū dēnglù huò běndì dàoqī jūn bù huì chèxiāo yuǎnchéng dàimǎ. Zhuàngtài jiǎnchá huì jiāng yuánshǐ dàimǎ fā huí cǐ Hermes fúwùqì."),
    RelayCodeIssued("The host acknowledged that it issued a code. No account link is confirmed.","主机已确认发出代码。尚未确认任何账户关联。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn fāchū dàimǎ. Shàng wèi quèrèn rènhé zhànghù guānlián."),
    RelayCodeNotIssued("The host refused before issuing a code. Read the account report again and use Portal when it manages this instance.","主机在发出代码前拒绝请求。请重新读取账户报告；如果此实例由 Portal 管理，请使用 Portal。","Zhǔjī zài fāchū dàimǎ qián jùjué qǐngqiú. Qǐng chóngxīn dúqǔ zhànghù bàogào; rúguǒ cǐ shílì yóu Portal guǎnlǐ, qǐng shǐyòng Portal."),
    RelayCodeUnknown("The request may have issued a code, but its outcome is unknown. No original code is available to check. Read linked accounts separately; no new code will be created automatically.","请求可能已发出代码，但结果未知。没有可用于检查的原始代码。请另行读取已关联账户；不会自动创建新代码。","Qǐngqiú kěnéng yǐ fāchū dàimǎ, dàn jiéguǒ wèizhī. Méiyǒu kě yòngyú jiǎnchá de yuánshǐ dàimǎ. Qǐng lìngxíng dúqǔ yǐ guānlián zhànghù; bù huì zìdòng chuàngjiàn xīn dàimǎ."),
    RelayCodePending("Reported pending: not yet redeemed.","报告为待处理：尚未兑换。","Bàogào wéi dài chǔlǐ: shàng wèi duìhuàn."),
    RelayCodeInactive("Reported inactive: used or expired. This does not confirm an account link.","报告为无效：已使用或已到期。这不代表账户已关联。","Bàogào wéi wúxiào: yǐ shǐyòng huò yǐ dàoqī. Zhè bù dàibiǎo zhànghù yǐ guānlián."),
    RelayCodeRefused("The host reported that the code was refused. No account link is confirmed.","主机报告代码已被拒绝。尚未确认任何账户关联。","Zhǔjī bàogào dàimǎ yǐ bèi jùjué. Shàng wèi quèrèn rènhé zhànghù guānlián."),
    RelayCodeUnavailable("The original local code is unavailable, expired or could not be saved. Check device storage. No replacement is created automatically; the remote code may still exist.","原始本地代码不可用、已到期或未能保存。请检查设备存储。不会自动创建替代代码；远程代码可能仍然存在。","Yuánshǐ běndì dàimǎ bù kěyòng, yǐ dàoqī huò wèi néng bǎocún. Qǐng jiǎnchá shèbèi cúnchǔ. Bù huì zìdòng chuàngjiàn tìdài dàimǎ; yuǎnchéng dàimǎ kěnéng réngrán cúnzài."),
    RelayCodeFull("Saved codes reached the local limit. Clear unneeded local codes before creating another. No new request was sent.","已保存代码达到本地上限。请先清除不再需要的本地代码，再创建新代码。未发送新请求。","Yǐ bǎocún dàimǎ dádào běndì shàngxiàn. Qǐng xiān qīngchú bù zài xūyào de běndì dàimǎ, zài chuàngjiàn xīn dàimǎ. Wèi fāsòng xīn qǐngqiú."),
    RelayCodeVerifyFirst("Check the original code’s status before revealing or sharing it. This does not create another code.","显示或分享前请检查原始代码的状态。此操作不会创建其他代码。","Xiǎnshì huò fēnxiǎng qián qǐng jiǎnchá yuánshǐ dàimǎ de zhuàngtài. Cǐ cāozuò bù huì chuàngjiàn qítā dàimǎ."),
    RelayCodeRefresh("Check original code status","检查原始代码状态","Jiǎnchá yuánshǐ dàimǎ zhuàngtài"),
    RelayCodeCommand("Private link command","私密关联命令","Sīmì guānlián mìnglìng"),
    RelayCodeLocalExpiry("Local copy expires at","本地副本到期时间","Běndì fùběn dàoqī shíjiān"),
    RelayCodeCopy("Copy reviewed command","复制已审阅命令","Fùzhì yǐ shěnyuè mìnglìng"),
    RelayCodeOpenBot("Review bot destination","审阅机器人目标","Shěnyuè jīqìrén mùbiāo"),
    RelayCodeShareEffect("The app rechecks the original code and instance before sharing. Copy puts the private command on your clipboard; other apps may access it. Opening a bot uses your browser or messaging app without the Hermes bearer. WhatsApp may prefill the command. You choose whether to send it. A pending check cannot lock the code against later use or expiry.","分享前应用会重新检查原始代码及实例。复制会把私密命令放入剪贴板，其他应用可能读取。打开机器人使用浏览器或消息应用，不附带 Hermes 令牌。WhatsApp 可能预填命令，由您决定是否发送。待处理状态检查无法锁定代码以防后续使用或到期。","Fēnxiǎng qián yìngyòng huì chóngxīn jiǎnchá yuánshǐ dàimǎ jí shílì. Fùzhì huì bǎ sīmì mìnglìng fàng rù jiǎntiēbǎn, qítā yìngyòng kěnéng dúqǔ. Dǎkāi jīqìrén shǐyòng liúlǎnqì huò xiāoxi yìngyòng, bù fùdài Hermes lìngpái. WhatsApp kěnéng yù tián mìnglìng, yóu nín juédìng shìfǒu fāsòng. Dài chǔlǐ zhuàngtài jiǎnchá wúfǎ suǒdìng dàimǎ yǐ fáng hòuxù shǐyòng huò dàoqī."),
    RelayCodeBrowserGrant("I approve opening this exact bot destination.","我同意打开此确切机器人目标。","Wǒ tóngyì dǎkāi cǐ quèqiè jīqìrén mùbiāo."),
    RelayCodeNoBot("No supported bot destination was supplied. You can copy the reviewed command and send it manually to the correct shared bot.","未提供受支持的机器人目标。可复制已审阅命令，手动发送给正确的共享机器人。","Wèi tígōng shòu zhīchí de jīqìrén mùbiāo. Kě fùzhì yǐ shěnyuè mìnglìng, shǒudòng fāsòng gěi zhèngquè de gòngxiǎng jīqìrén."),
    RelayCodeForeground("Return to this screen and approve the action again. Nothing was shared while the app was in the background.","请返回此屏幕并再次批准操作。应用处于后台时未分享任何内容。","Qǐng fǎnhuí cǐ píngmù bìng zàicì pīzhǔn cāozuò. Yìngyòng chǔyú hòutái shí wèi fēnxiǎng rènhé nèiróng."),
    RelayCodeBrowserFailed("No app could open the reviewed bot destination.","没有应用能够打开已审阅机器人目标。","Méiyǒu yìngyòng nénggòu dǎkāi yǐ shěnyuè jīqìrén mùbiāo."),
    RelayCodeClipboardFailed("The private command could not be copied.","无法复制私密命令。","Wúfǎ fùzhì sīmì mìnglìng."),
    RelayCodesClear("Clear saved link codes","清除已保存关联代码","Qīngchú yǐ bǎocún guānlián dàimǎ"),
    RelayCodesClearEffect("Clear saved codes for this exact server, profile and sign-in? This removes local recovery copies. Remote codes, clipboard copies, receipts and uncertainty remain; no code is canceled and no account is changed.","清除此确切服务器、配置及登录的已保存代码？这会移除本地恢复副本。远程代码、剪贴板副本、记录及不确定状态仍保留；不会取消代码或更改账户。","Qīngchú cǐ quèqiè fúwùqì, pèizhì jí dēnglù de yǐ bǎocún dàimǎ? Zhè huì yíchú běndì huīfù fùběn. Yuǎnchéng dàimǎ, jiǎntiēbǎn fùběn, jìlù jí bù quèdìng zhuàngtài réng bǎoliú; bù huì qǔxiāo dàimǎ huò gēnggǎi zhànghù."),
    RelayCodesClearGrant("I approve clearing these local code copies.","我同意清除这些本地代码副本。","Wǒ tóngyì qīngchú zhèxiē běndì dàimǎ fùběn."),
    RelayCodesCleared("Local code copies cleared; remote codes and receipts remain.","本地代码副本已清除；远程代码及记录仍保留。","Běndì dàimǎ fùběn yǐ qīngchú; yuǎnchéng dàimǎ jí jìlù réng bǎoliú."),
    RelayCodeReceipt("This receipt records code issuance or an explicit pre-issuance refusal and later reported status only. It contains no private code. Read linked accounts separately; no status here proves account ownership or delivery.","此记录仅保存代码发出、发出前明确拒绝及后续报告状态，不包含私密代码。请另行读取已关联账户；此处任何状态均不能证明账户所有权或消息送达。","Cǐ jìlù jǐn bǎocún dàimǎ fāchū, fāchū qián míngquè jùjué jí hòuxù bàogào zhuàngtài, bù bāohán sīmì dàimǎ. Qǐng lìngxíng dúqǔ yǐ guānlián zhànghù; cǐ chù rènhé zhuàngtài jūn bù néng zhèngmíng zhànghù suǒyǒuquán huò xiāoxi sòngdá."),

    RelayUnlink("Unlink this account","解除此账户关联","Jiěchú cǐ zhànghù guānlián"),
    RelayUnlinkEffect("Remove this reviewed account’s route to this Team Gateway instance? This can interrupt its access; messages already in flight may continue. It does not delete the platform account or revoke provider credentials. The exact target is stored encrypted on this device for receipt review, and can be cleared separately. A changed reported account, bot link, authority or profile refuses before sending. A lost reply remains uncertain and is never automatically repeated.","移除此已审阅账户通往此团队网关实例的路由？这可能会中断其访问；已在传输的消息可能继续处理。不会删除平台账户或撤销提供方凭据。确切目标会加密保存在此设备中，以便审阅记录，并可单独清除。如果报告的账户、机器人链接、管理权限来源或配置发生变化，发送前会拒绝。丢失响应时结果保持不确定，不会自动重复。","Yíchú cǐ yǐ shěnyuè zhànghù tōngwǎng cǐ tuánduì wǎngguān shílì de lùyóu? Zhè kěnéng huì zhōngduàn qí fǎngwèn; yǐ zài chuánshū de xiāoxi kěnéng jìxù chǔlǐ. Bù huì shānchú píngtái zhànghù huò chèxiāo tígōngfāng píngjù. Quèqiè mùbiāo huì jiāmì bǎocún zài cǐ shèbèi zhōng, yǐbiàn shěnyuè jìlù, bìng kě dāndú qīngchú. Rúguǒ bàogào de zhànghù, jīqìrén liànjiē, guǎnlǐ quánxiàn láiyuán huò pèizhì fāshēng biànhuà, fāsòng qián huì jùjué. Diūshī xiǎngyìng shí jiéguǒ bǎochí bù quèdìng, bù huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    RelayUnlinkGrant("I approve unlinking this exact reviewed account.","我同意解除此确切已审阅账户的关联。","Wǒ tóngyì jiěchú cǐ quèqiè yǐ shěnyuè zhànghù de guānlián."),
    RelayUnlinkUnsupported("This platform or account identifier cannot be safely addressed by this route. Use the host’s supported controls.","此路由无法安全指定此平台或账户标识。请使用主机支持的控件。","Cǐ lùyóu wúfǎ ānquán zhǐdìng cǐ píngtái huò zhànghù biāozhì. Qǐng shǐyòng zhǔjī zhīchí de kòngjiàn."),
    RelayUnlinkAcknowledged("The host acknowledged the unlink request.","主机已确认解除关联请求。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn jiěchú guānlián qǐngqiú."),
    RelayUnlinkAbsent("Unlink acknowledged. The reviewed account was absent from the later report. This does not prove credential revocation or delivery has stopped.","解除关联已确认。该已审阅账户未出现在后续报告中。这不代表凭据已撤销或消息传输已停止。","Jiěchú guānlián yǐ quèrèn. Gāi yǐ shěnyuè zhànghù wèi chūxiàn zài hòuxù bàogào zhōng. Zhè bù dàibiǎo píngjù yǐ chèxiāo huò xiāoxi chuánshū yǐ tíngzhǐ."),
    RelayUnlinkStillListed("Unlink acknowledged, but the account is still listed. Read the report again explicitly; no second unlink was sent.","解除关联已确认，但账户仍在列表中。请手动重新读取报告；未再次发送解除关联请求。","Jiěchú guānlián yǐ quèrèn, dàn zhànghù réng zài lièbiǎo zhōng. Qǐng shǒudòng chóngxīn dúqǔ bàogào; wèi zàicì fāsòng jiěchú guānlián qǐngqiú."),
    RelayUnlinkContextChanged("Unlink acknowledged, but the later authority or bot context changed. The account’s absence could not be verified against the reviewed context.","解除关联已确认，但后续管理权限来源或机器人环境已变化。无法根据已审阅环境验证账户是否已移除。","Jiěchú guānlián yǐ quèrèn, dàn hòuxù guǎnlǐ quánxiàn láiyuán huò jīqìrén huánjìng yǐ biànhuà. Wúfǎ gēnjù yǐ shěnyuè huánjìng yànzhèng zhànghù shìfǒu yǐ yíchú."),
    RelayUnlinkReceipt("This records the host acknowledgement only. A later account report is a separate snapshot. The private original target can be inspected locally; neither observation nor local uncertainty review repeats the request.","此处仅记录主机确认。后续账户报告是独立快照。可在本地查看私密原始目标；查看结果或本地审阅不确定状态均不会重复请求。","Cǐ chù jǐn jìlù zhǔjī quèrèn. Hòuxù zhànghù bàogào shì dúlì kuàizhào. Kě zài běndì chákàn sīmì yuánshǐ mùbiāo; chákàn jiéguǒ huò běndì shěnyuè bù quèdìng zhuàngtài jūn bù huì chóngfù qǐngqiú."),
    RelayOriginalTarget("Original reviewed target","原始已审阅目标","Yuánshǐ yǐ shěnyuè mùbiāo"),
    RelayHistoricalTarget("This is the local historical target for this receipt, not a current account report. Read linked accounts separately to inspect the instance now.","这是此记录的本地历史目标，并非当前账户报告。请另行读取已关联账户以检查实例的当前状态。","Zhè shì cǐ jìlù de běndì lìshǐ mùbiāo, bìngfēi dāngqián zhànghù bàogào. Qǐng lìngxíng dúqǔ yǐ guānlián zhànghù yǐ jiǎnchá shílì de dāngqián zhuàngtài."),
    RelayOriginalUnavailable("The private original target is unavailable or was cleared. The receipt remains; no request was repeated.","私密原始目标不可用或已清除。记录仍保留；未重复请求。","Sīmì yuánshǐ mùbiāo bù kěyòng huò yǐ qīngchú. Jìlù réng bǎoliú; wèi chóngfù qǐngqiú."),
    RelayPrivateUnavailable("Private target storage is unavailable. Check device storage. Signing out clears saved targets; receipts and any uncertainty remain.","私密目标存储不可用。请检查设备存储。退出登录会清除已保存目标；记录及任何不确定状态仍保留。","Sīmì mùbiāo cúnchǔ bù kěyòng. Qǐng jiǎnchá shèbèi cúnchǔ. Tuìchū dēnglù huì qīngchú yǐ bǎocún mùbiāo; jìlù jí rènhé bù quèdìng zhuàngtài réng bǎoliú."),
    RelayPrivateFull("Saved relay targets reached the local limit. Clear targets you no longer need before unlinking another account. No unlink was sent.","已保存的中继目标达到本地上限。请先清除不再需要的目标，再解除其他账户关联。未发送解除关联请求。","Yǐ bǎocún de zhōngjì mùbiāo dádào běndì shàngxiàn. Qǐng xiān qīngchú bù zài xūyào de mùbiāo, zài jiěchú qítā zhànghù guānlián. Wèi fāsòng jiěchú guānlián qǐngqiú."),
    RelayClearPrivate("Clear saved relay targets","清除已保存的中继目标","Qīngchú yǐ bǎocún de zhōngjì mùbiāo"),
    RelayClearPrivateEffect("Clear the encrypted original targets for this exact server, profile and sign-in on this device? Historical and uncertain targets will no longer be available here. Receipts and pending guards remain. This does not unlink an account, cancel a remote request or clear uncertainty.","清除此设备中此确切服务器、配置及登录的加密原始目标？此处将无法再查看历史及不确定请求的目标。记录及待处理保护仍保留。这不会解除账户关联、取消远程请求或清除不确定状态。","Qīngchú cǐ shèbèi zhōng cǐ quèqiè fúwùqì, pèizhì jí dēnglù de jiāmì yuánshǐ mùbiāo? Cǐ chù jiāng wúfǎ zài chákàn lìshǐ jí bù quèdìng qǐngqiú de mùbiāo. Jìlù jí dài chǔlǐ bǎohù réng bǎoliú. Zhè bù huì jiěchú zhànghù guānlián, qǔxiāo yuǎnchéng qǐngqiú huò qīngchú bù quèdìng zhuàngtài."),
    RelayClearPrivateGrant("I approve clearing these local private targets.","我同意清除这些本地私密目标。","Wǒ tóngyì qīngchú zhèxiē běndì sīmì mùbiāo."),
    RelayPrivateCleared("Local private relay targets cleared. Receipts, pending guards and remote accounts are unchanged.","本地私密中继目标已清除。记录、待处理保护及远程账户未改变。","Běndì sīmì zhōngjì mùbiāo yǐ qīngchú. Jìlù, dài chǔlǐ bǎohù jí yuǎnchéng zhànghù wèi gǎibiàn."),

    RelayBrowserFailed("No browser could open the reviewed Portal destination.","没有浏览器能够打开已审阅的 Portal 目标。","Méiyǒu liúlǎnqì nénggòu dǎkāi yǐ shěnyuè de Portal mùbiāo."),
    RelayAccounts("Team Gateway accounts","团队网关账户","Tuánduì wǎngguān zhànghù"),
    RelayRead("Read linked accounts","读取已关联账户","Dúqǔ yǐ guānlián zhànghù"),
    RelayPrivacy("This reads private account identifiers, names, handles and bot links. Hermes must first confirm that the selected profile is the running instance’s launch profile. No code is created and no account or message is changed.","这会读取私密账户标识、名称、用户名及机器人链接。Hermes 必须先确认所选配置是正在运行实例的启动配置。不会创建代码，也不会更改账户或消息。","Zhè huì dúqǔ sīmì zhànghù biāozhì, míngchēng, yònghùmíng jí jīqìrén liànjiē. Hermes bìxū xiān quèrèn suǒ xuǎn pèizhì shì zhèngzài yùnxíng shílì de qǐdòng pèizhì. Bù huì chuàngjiàn dàimǎ, yě bù huì gēnggǎi zhànghù huò xiāoxi."),
    RelayScopeUnavailable("Hermes did not confirm this profile as a relay-fronted launch home. Account reads are unavailable here. Select the instance’s launch profile or check its Team Gateway setup.","Hermes 未确认此配置为通过中继连接的启动目录。此处无法读取账户。请选择实例的启动配置，或检查团队网关设置。","Hermes wèi quèrèn cǐ pèizhì wéi tōngguò zhōngjì liánjiē de qǐdòng mùlù. Cǐ chù wúfǎ dúqǔ zhànghù. Qǐng xuǎnzé shílì de qǐdòng pèizhì, huò jiǎnchá tuánduì wǎngguān shèzhì."),
    RelayUnavailable("The account report was incomplete or did not match the verified instance platforms. No account details were retained.","账户报告不完整，或与已验证的实例平台不匹配。未保留账户详情。","Zhànghù bàogào bù wánzhěng, huò yǔ yǐ yànzhèng de shílì píngtái bù pǐpèi. Wèi bǎoliú zhànghù xiángqíng."),
    RelayPortalManaged("Accounts are managed in Nous Portal.","账户由 Nous Portal 管理。","Zhànghù yóu Nous Portal guǎnlǐ."),
    RelayConnectorManaged("Accounts are managed by the Team Gateway connector.","账户由团队网关连接器管理。","Zhànghù yóu tuánduì wǎngguān liánjiēqì guǎnlǐ."),
    RelayUnknownManaged("The account management authority is unknown.","账户管理权限来源未知。","Zhànghù guǎnlǐ quánxiàn láiyuán wèizhī."),
    RelayAccountCount("Reported accounts","报告的账户数","Bàogào de zhànghù shù"),
    RelayReported("This is a host-reported snapshot. It does not prove ownership, delivery or current access. Account reports stay in this screen’s memory and are cleared when it closes or the connection changes. Reviewed unlink targets have separately disclosed encrypted storage.","这是主机报告的快照，不能证明所有权、消息送达或当前访问权限。账户报告仅保留在此屏幕的内存中，关闭屏幕或更改连接时会清除。解除关联的已审阅目标另有明确说明的加密存储。","Zhè shì zhǔjī bàogào de kuàizhào, bù néng zhèngmíng suǒyǒuquán, xiāoxi sòngdá huò dāngqián fǎngwèn quánxiàn. Zhànghù bàogào jǐn bǎoliú zài cǐ píngmù de nèicún zhōng, guānbì píngmù huò gēnggǎi liánjiē shí huì qīngchú. Jiěchú guānlián de yǐ shěnyuè mùbiāo lìng yǒu míngquè shuōmíng de jiāmì cúnchǔ."),
    RelayAccountId("Platform account ID","平台账户标识","Píngtái zhànghù biāozhì"),
    RelayAccountName("Display name","显示名称","Xiǎnshì míngchēng"),
    RelayAccountHandle("Handle","用户名","Yònghùmíng"),
    RelayBotUrl("Reported bot link","报告的机器人链接","Bàogào de jīqìrén liànjiē"),
    RelayPortalReview("Review Portal handoff","审阅 Portal 跳转","Shěnyuè Portal tiàozhuǎn"),
    RelayPortalEffect("Review the destination before opening your browser. The app rechecks this instance’s profile, management authority and Portal URL first. Your browser uses its own Portal sign-in; the app does not send its Hermes bearer. Linking and access changes happen there.","打开浏览器前请审阅目标地址。应用会先重新检查此实例的配置、管理权限来源及 Portal 地址。浏览器使用自己的 Portal 登录；应用不会发送 Hermes 令牌。关联及访问权限更改在 Portal 中进行。","Dǎkāi liúlǎnqì qián qǐng shěnyuè mùbiāo dìzhǐ. Yìngyòng huì xiān chóngxīn jiǎnchá cǐ shílì de pèizhì, guǎnlǐ quánxiàn láiyuán jí Portal dìzhǐ. Liúlǎnqì shǐyòng zìjǐ de Portal dēnglù; yìngyòng bù huì fāsòng Hermes lìngpái. Guānlián jí fǎngwèn quánxiàn gēnggǎi zài Portal zhōng jìnxíng."),
    RelayPortalGrant("I approve opening this reviewed Portal destination.","我同意打开此已审阅的 Portal 目标。","Wǒ tóngyì dǎkāi cǐ yǐ shěnyuè de Portal mùbiāo."),
    RelayPortalUnavailable("A safe HTTPS Portal destination is unavailable. Check the host’s Portal configuration.","没有安全的 HTTPS Portal 目标。请检查主机的 Portal 配置。","Méiyǒu ānquán de HTTPS Portal mùbiāo. Qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī de Portal pèizhì."),
    RelayLocalControlsPending("Connector-managed accounts use the separately approved code and unlink controls. Portal-managed or unknown-authority accounts cannot use those controls here.","连接器管理的账户使用单独批准的代码及解除关联控件。由 Portal 管理或管理权限来源未知的账户无法在此使用这些控件。","Liánjiēqì guǎnlǐ de zhànghù shǐyòng dāndú pīzhǔn de dàimǎ jí jiěchú guānlián kòngjiàn. Yóu Portal guǎnlǐ huò guǎnlǐ quánxiàn láiyuán wèizhī de zhànghù wúfǎ zài cǐ shǐyòng zhèxiē kòngjiàn."),

    AppUpdates("App updates","应用更新","Yìngyòng gēngxīn"),
    UpdateInstalled("Installed","已安装","Yǐ ānzhuāng"),
    UpdateSource("Updates come from the public Signal Grove GitHub releases. Checks do not send your Hermes credentials.","更新来自 Signal Grove 的公开 GitHub 发布，检查不会发送 Hermes 凭据。","Gēngxīn láizì Signal Grove de gōngkāi GitHub fābù, jiǎnchá bù huì fāsòng Hermes píngjù."),
    UpdateAutomatic("Check daily when the app opens","打开应用时每天检查一次","Dǎkāi yìngyòng shí měitiān jiǎnchá yí cì"),
    UpdatePreviews("Include preview releases","包含预览版本","Bāohán yùlǎn bǎnběn"),
    UpdateLastChecked("Last checked","上次检查","Shàng cì jiǎnchá"),
    UpdateCheck("Check for updates","检查更新","Jiǎnchá gēngxīn"),
    UpdateAvailable("A new version is available:","有新版本：","Yǒu xīn bǎnběn:"),
    UpdateReady("Ready to install:","可以安装：","Kěyǐ ānzhuāng:"),
    UpdateReview("Review update","审阅更新","Shěnyuè gēngxīn"),
    UpdateDownload("Download & update","下载并更新","Xiàzài bìng gēngxīn"),
    UpdateDownloading("Downloading","正在下载","Zhèngzài xiàzài"),
    UpdateDownloadEffect("Downloads this APK from GitHub using your connection. Its size, SHA-256, app identity, newer version and matching signing certificate are checked before installation. Cancel stops the download. A changed or incompatible APK is rejected.","使用网络从 GitHub 下载此 APK。安装前检查大小、SHA-256、应用标识、更新版本及匹配的签名证书。取消会停止下载；更改或不兼容的 APK 会被拒绝。","Shǐyòng wǎngluò cóng GitHub xiàzài cǐ APK. Ānzhuāng qián jiǎnchá dàxiǎo, SHA-256, yìngyòng biāozhì, gèng xīn bǎnběn jí pǐpèi de qiānmíng zhèngshū. Qǔxiāo huì tíngzhǐ xiàzài; gēnggǎi huò bù jiānróng de APK huì bèi jùjué."),
    UpdateInstallEffect("Android will ask you to allow updates from this app and confirm installation. App data stays in place. Installing restarts Signal Grove; it waits while app work is active. If you leave or cancel the installer, the verified download stays available here.","Android 会要求允许此应用安装更新并确认安装。应用数据会保留。安装会重启 Signal Grove；应用工作进行时会等待。如果离开或取消安装程序，已验证的下载仍保留在此。","Android huì yāoqiú yǔnxǔ cǐ yìngyòng ānzhuāng gēngxīn bìng quèrèn ānzhuāng. Yìngyòng shùjù huì bǎoliú. Ānzhuāng huì chóngqǐ Signal Grove; yìngyòng gōngzuò jìnxíng shí huì děngdài. Rúguǒ líkāi huò qǔxiāo ānzhuāng chéngxù, yǐ yànzhèng de xiàzài réng bǎoliú zài cǐ."),
    UpdateFinishWork("Finish active app work before installing.","请完成当前应用工作后再安装。","Qǐng wánchéng dāngqián yìngyòng gōngzuò hòu zài ānzhuāng."),
    UpdateInstall("Install verified update","安装已验证的更新","Ānzhuāng yǐ yànzhèng de gēngxīn"),
    UpdateAllowInstall("Allow updates from Signal Grove","允许 Signal Grove 安装更新","Yǔnxǔ Signal Grove ānzhuāng gēngxīn"),
    UpdateNotes("Release notes","版本说明","Bǎnběn shuōmíng"),
    UpdateReleasePage("View on GitHub","在 GitHub 查看","Zài GitHub chákàn"),
    UpdateHint("Review the release and approve the download in Settings.","请在设置中审阅版本并批准下载。","Qǐng zài shèzhì zhōng shěnyuè bǎnběn bìng pīzhǔn xiàzài."),
    UpdateCurrent("No newer version was found on this update channel.","此更新渠道未发现更新版本。","Cǐ gēngxīn qúdào wèi fāxiàn gèng xīn bǎnběn."),
    UpdateMissingApk("This release has no verified APK for your installed variant. Open its GitHub page for details.","此版本没有适合已安装变体的已验证 APK。请打开 GitHub 页面查看详情。","Cǐ bǎnběn méiyǒu shìhé yǐ ānzhuāng biàntǐ de yǐ yànzhèng APK. Qǐng dǎkāi GitHub yèmiàn chákàn xiángqíng."),
    UpdateFailed("The update could not be checked or downloaded. Check your connection and try again.","无法检查或下载更新。请检查网络后重试。","Wúfǎ jiǎnchá huò xiàzài gēngxīn. Qǐng jiǎnchá wǎngluò hòu chóngshì."),
    UpdateRateLimit("GitHub is limiting update checks. Try again later.","GitHub 正在限制更新检查。请稍后重试。","GitHub zhèngzài xiànzhì gēngxīn jiǎnchá. Qǐng shāohòu chóngshì."),
    UpdateIntegrity("The download size or checksum did not match. Nothing was installed; check for updates again.","下载大小或校验和不匹配。未安装任何内容；请重新检查更新。","Xiàzài dàxiǎo huò jiàoyànhé bù pǐpèi. Wèi ānzhuāng rènhé nèiróng; qǐng chóngxīn jiǎnchá gēngxīn."),
    UpdateSignature("This APK uses a different signing key and cannot update this installation. Nothing was installed.","此 APK 使用不同签名密钥，无法更新当前安装。未安装任何内容。","Cǐ APK shǐyòng bùtóng qiānmíng mìyào, wúfǎ gēngxīn dāngqián ānzhuāng. Wèi ānzhuāng rènhé nèiróng."),
    UpdatePackage("The APK does not match this app and release. Nothing was installed.","APK 与此应用或版本不匹配。未安装任何内容。","APK yǔ cǐ yìngyòng huò bǎnběn bù pǐpèi. Wèi ānzhuāng rènhé nèiróng."),
    UpdateVersion("The APK is not newer than this installation. Nothing was installed.","APK 不比当前安装更新。未安装任何内容。","APK bù bǐ dāngqián ānzhuāng gèng xīn. Wèi ānzhuāng rènhé nèiróng."),
    UpdateAndroid("This update needs a newer Android version. Nothing was installed.","此更新需要更新的 Android 版本。未安装任何内容。","Cǐ gēngxīn xūyào gèng xīn de Android bǎnběn. Wèi ānzhuāng rènhé nèiróng."),
    UpdateCanceled("Update canceled. No installation was started.","更新已取消。未开始安装。","Gēngxīn yǐ qǔxiāo. Wèi kāishǐ ānzhuāng."),
    UpdateInstallerReturned("If installation was canceled, you can try again. A completed update restarts the app.","如果已取消安装，可以重试。完成更新会重启应用。","Rúguǒ yǐ qǔxiāo ānzhuāng, kěyǐ chóngshì. Wánchéng gēngxīn huì chóngqǐ yìngyòng."),
    UpdateInstallUnavailable("Android could not open the installer or its permission settings. The verified download is retained.","Android 无法打开安装程序或权限设置。已保留验证后的下载。","Android wúfǎ dǎkāi ānzhuāng chéngxù huò quánxiàn shèzhì. Yǐ bǎoliú yànzhèng hòu de xiàzài."),

    OrbitalHomestead("YOUR ORBITAL HOMESTEAD","你的轨道家园","Nǐ de guǐdào jiāyuán"),
    CustomEndpoints("Custom endpoints","自定义端点","Zì dìngyì duāndiǎn"),
    CustomEndpointsRead("Read configured custom endpoints","读取已配置的自定义端点","Dúqǔ yǐ pèizhì de zì dìngyì duāndiǎn"),
    CustomEndpointsReadEffect("Reads this profile’s endpoint catalog and raw provider/legacy configuration, which may contain secrets. Only selected fields stay in this open view; nothing is saved locally. Loading can normalize or migrate host configuration. Names and IDs remain visible and may be private. Key previews are omitted; this is not a connectivity or credential-health test.","读取此配置的端点目录及原始提供方和旧版配置，其中可能包含密钥。仅所选字段保留在此打开的界面中，不保存到本地。加载可能规范化或迁移主机配置。名称及标识仍可见且可能属于私有信息。省略密钥预览；此操作并非连接或凭据健康测试。","Dúqǔ cǐ pèizhì de duāndiǎn mùlù jí yuánshǐ tígōng fāng hé jiùbǎn pèizhì, qízhōng kěnéng bāohán mìyào. Jǐn suǒ xuǎn zìduàn bǎoliú zài cǐ dǎkāi de jièmiàn zhōng, bù bǎocún dào běndì. Jiāzài kěnéng guīfànhuà huò qiānyí zhǔjī pèizhì. Míngchēng jí biāozhì réng kějiàn qiě kěnéng shǔyú sīyǒu xìnxī. Shěnglüè mìyào yùlǎn; cǐ cāozuò bìng fēi liánjiē huò píngjù jiànkāng cèshì."),
    CustomEndpointsNew("Create a custom endpoint","创建自定义端点","Chuàngjiàn zì dìngyì duāndiǎn"),
    CustomEndpointsId("Endpoint ID (new: blank derives from name)","端点标识（新建时留空则从名称生成）","Duāndiǎn biāozhì (xīnjiàn shí liúkōng zé cóng míngchēng shēngchéng)"),
    CustomEndpointsName("Endpoint name","端点名称","Duāndiǎn míngchēng"),
    CustomEndpointsCurrent("Host-reported main route / current endpoint","主机报告的主路由或当前端点","Zhǔjī bàogào de zhǔ lùyóu huò dāngqián duāndiǎn"),
    CustomEndpointsProvider("Named provider configuration","命名提供方配置","Mìngmíng tígōng fāng pèizhì"),
    CustomEndpointsLegacy("Legacy custom-provider entry","旧版自定义提供方条目","Jiùbǎn zì dìngyì tígōng fāng tiáomù"),
    CustomEndpointsDirect("This row is a view of the inline main-model route. It has no independent provider entry for these controls. Use main-model configuration on Hermes to change it.","此条目是内嵌主模型路由的视图，没有可由这些控件操作的独立提供方条目。请通过 Hermes 的主模型配置更改它。","Cǐ tiáomù shì nèiqiàn zhǔ móxíng lùyóu de shìtú, méiyǒu kě yóu zhèxiē kòngjiàn cāozuò de dúlì tígōng fāng tiáomù. Qǐng tōngguò Hermes de zhǔ móxíng pèizhì gēnggǎi tā."),
    CustomEndpointsPrivate("Endpoint URLs and model catalogs may contain private data. Reveal only when needed. Existing key values and previews are never shown. Closing this screen discards the loaded fields and drafts.","端点地址及模型目录可能包含私有数据。仅在需要时显示。不会显示已存密钥值或预览。关闭此界面会丢弃已加载字段及草稿。","Duāndiǎn dìzhǐ jí móxíng mùlù kěnéng bāohán sīyǒu shùjù. Jǐn zài xūyào shí xiǎnshì. Bú huì xiǎnshì yǐ cún mìyào zhí huò yùlǎn. Guānbì cǐ jièmiàn huì diūqì yǐ jiāzài zìduàn jí cǎogǎo."),
    EndpointProbe("Probe endpoint","探测端点","Tàncè duāndiǎn"),
    EndpointProbeReport("Endpoint probe report","端点探测报告","Duāndiǎn tàncè bàogào"),
    EndpointProbeEffect("Hermes refreshes the reviewed catalog, then sends outbound requests from its host to the exact endpoint below. It can GET /models on this base and an alternate with /v1 added or removed, then make a small real inference POST: Chat/Anthropic up to 1 token, Responses up to 16 output tokens. Requests can incur charges and disclose your model and fresh key. Cancel cannot recall requests already sent.","Hermes 会刷新已审阅目录，然后从其主机向下方端点发送出站请求。它可能在此基础地址及添加或移除 /v1 的备用地址 GET /models，然后发送小型真实推理 POST：Chat/Anthropic 最多 1 个 token，Responses 最多 16 个输出 token。请求可能产生费用并披露模型及新密钥。取消无法撤回已发送请求。","Hermes huì shuāxīn yǐ shěnyuè mùlù, ránhòu cóng qí zhǔjī xiàng xiàfāng duāndiǎn fāsòng chūzhàn qǐngqiú. Tā kěnéng zài cǐ jīchǔ dìzhǐ jí tiānjiā huò yíchú /v1 de bèiyòng dìzhǐ GET /models, ránhòu fāsòng xiǎoxíng zhēnshí tuīlǐ POST: Chat/Anthropic zuìduō 1 gè token, Responses zuìduō 16 gè shūchū token. Qǐngqiú kěnéng chǎnshēng fèiyòng bìng pīlù móxíng jí xīn mìyào. Qǔxiāo wúfǎ chèhuí yǐ fāsòng qǐngqiú."),
    EndpointProbeScope("This route has no profile parameter. The displayed profile binds your review and local receipt; outbound probes use the listener/process network and proxy settings, not that profile's settings. Local/LAN/Tailscale targets bypass environment proxies in Hermes. The host may use a different resolved base URL.","此路由没有配置档参数。显示的配置档绑定审阅及本地回执；出站探测使用监听进程的网络及代理设置，而非该配置档设置。Hermes 对本地、局域网及 Tailscale 目标绕过环境代理。主机可能使用不同的解析后基础地址。","Cǐ lùyóu méiyǒu pèizhì dàng cānshù. Xiǎnshì de pèizhì dàng bǎngdìng shěnyuè jí běndì huízhí; chūzhàn tàncè shǐyòng jiāntīng jìnchéng de wǎngluò jí dàilǐ shèzhì, ér fēi gāi pèizhì dàng shèzhì. Hermes duì běndì, júyùwǎng jí Tailscale mùbiāo ràoguò huánjìng dàilǐ. Zhǔjī kěnéng shǐyòng bùtóng de jiěxī hòu jīchǔ dìzhǐ."),
    EndpointProbeCredentials("Only the fresh key shown in this review is supplied. Keep/clear sends no new credential; Hermes does not reuse your stored endpoint key for this probe. Keep API mode means automatic detection for the probe. Other save fields are not sent.","只提交本次审阅显示的新密钥。保留或清除均不发送新凭据；Hermes 不会为此次探测重用已存端点密钥。保留 API 模式在探测中表示自动检测。其他保存字段不会发送。","Zhǐ tíjiāo běn cì shěnyuè xiǎnshì de xīn mìyào. Bǎoliú huò qīngchú jūn bù fāsòng xīn píngjù; Hermes bù huì wèi cǐ cì tàncè chóngyòng yǐ cún duāndiǎn mìyào. Bǎoliú API móshì zài tàncè zhōng biǎoshì zìdòng jiǎncè. Qítā bǎocún zìduàn bù huì fāsòng."),
    EndpointProbeMeaning("These flags report one host probe. A positive result does not prove valid credentials, successful inference, runtime health or future availability: transport errors and statuses other than 404/405/501 can be inconclusive. No automatic retry is made after an uncertain outcome.","这些标记报告一次主机探测。肯定结果不能证明凭据有效、推理成功、运行健康或未来可用：传输错误及 404/405/501 以外的状态可能无法确定。结果不确定后不会自动重试。","Zhèxiē biāojì bàogào yí cì zhǔjī tàncè. Kěndìng jiéguǒ bù néng zhèngmíng píngjù yǒuxiào, tuīlǐ chénggōng, yùnxíng jiànkāng huò wèilái kěyòng: chuánshū cuòwù jí 404/405/501 yǐwài de zhuàngtài kěnéng wúfǎ quèdìng. Jiéguǒ bù quèdìng hòu bù huì zìdòng chóngshì."),
    EndpointProbeApprove("Allow this exact outbound probe and possible inference charge","允许此次明确出站探测及可能的推理费用","Yǔnxǔ cǐ cì míngquè chūzhàn tàncè jí kěnéng de tuīlǐ fèiyòng"),
    EndpointProbeNoKey("No new credential supplied","不提交新凭据","Bù tíjiāo xīn píngjù"),
    EndpointProbeReported("Hermes returned a typed probe report.","Hermes 已返回类型明确的探测报告。","Hermes yǐ fǎnhuí lèixíng míngquè de tàncè bàogào."),
    EndpointProbeOk("Host reported OK","主机报告 OK","Zhǔjī bàogào OK"),
    EndpointProbeReachable("Host reported reachable","主机报告可达","Zhǔjī bàogào kě dá"),
    EndpointProbeNoSave("No endpoint settings are saved by this probe. Private messages, URLs, models and alias details stay in this open view; only reported status flags enter the receipt. Inspect them before separately editing and reviewing a save. Alias metadata import is not available yet.","此次探测不会保存端点设置。私密消息、地址、模型及别名详情仅留在此打开视图；回执只保存报告状态标记。请检查后再单独编辑并审阅保存。暂不支持导入别名元数据。","Cǐ cì tàncè bù huì bǎocún duāndiǎn shèzhì. Sīmì xiāoxi, dìzhǐ, móxíng jí biémíng xiángqíng jǐn liú zài cǐ dǎkāi shìtú; huízhí zhǐ bǎocún bàogào zhuàngtài biāojì. Qǐng jiǎnchá hòu zài dāndú biānjí bìng shěnyuè bǎocún. Zàn bù zhīchí dǎorù biémíng yuán shùjù."),
    EndpointProbeDetailsUnavailable("Optional private probe details could not be read. The reported status flags remain recorded.","无法读取可选私密探测详情。报告状态标记仍已记录。","Wúfǎ dúqǔ kěxuǎn sīmì tàncè xiángqíng. Bàogào zhuàngtài biāojì réng yǐ jìlù."),
    EndpointProbeResolved("Host reported resolved base URL","主机报告的解析后基础地址","Zhǔjī bàogào de jiěxī hòu jīchǔ dìzhǐ"),
    CustomEndpointsSave("Save custom endpoint","保存自定义端点","Bǎocún zì dìngyì duāndiǎn"),
    CustomEndpointsActivate("Use as the main model route","用作主模型路由","Yòng zuò zhǔ móxíng lùyóu"),
    CustomEndpointsRemove("Remove configured endpoint","移除已配置端点","Yíchú yǐ pèizhì duāndiǎn"),
    CustomEndpointsKeepKey("Keep stored credentials (new: none supplied)","保留已存凭据（新建时不提供）","Bǎoliú yǐ cún píngjù (xīnjiàn shí bù tígōng)"),
    CustomEndpointsFreshKey("Replace with a fresh credential","使用新凭据替换","Shǐyòng xīn píngjù tìhuàn"),
    CustomEndpointsClearKey("Clear the generated key and inline credential","清除生成的密钥及内嵌凭据","Qīngchú shēngchéng de mìyào jí nèiqiàn píngjù"),
    CustomEndpointsKeyEffect("A fresh key is saved in the host environment and referenced by this provider. Keep can migrate an old plaintext key into that environment. Clear removes the generated key and inline/key_env fields; other aliases, headers, external credentials or active-model mirrors can remain. No provider token is revoked.","新密钥会保存到主机环境并由此提供方引用。保留操作可能将旧明文密钥迁移到该环境。清除会移除生成的密钥及内嵌或 key_env 字段；其他别名、标头、外部凭据或活动模型镜像可能保留。不会撤销提供方令牌。","Xīn mìyào huì bǎocún dào zhǔjī huánjìng bìng yóu cǐ tígōng fāng yǐnyòng. Bǎoliú cāozuò kěnéng jiāng jiù míngwén mìyào qiānyí dào gāi huánjìng. Qīngchú huì yíchú shēngchéng de mìyào jí nèiqiàn huò key_env zìduàn; qítā biémíng, biāotóu, wàibù píngjù huò huódòng móxíng jìngxiàng kěnéng bǎoliú. Bú huì chèxiāo tígōng fāng lìngpái."),
    CustomEndpointsDiscovery("Allow host model discovery","允许主机发现模型","Yǔnxǔ zhǔjī fāxiàn móxíng"),
    CustomEndpointsMakeDefault("Also set this as the main route","同时设为主路由","Tóngshí shè wéi zhǔ lùyóu"),
    CustomEndpointsSetContext("Set a positive context limit","设置正数上下文上限","Shèzhì zhèng shù shàngxiàwén shàngxiàn"),
    CustomEndpointsContext("Context limit","上下文上限","Shàngxiàwén shàngxiàn"),
    CustomEndpointsContextKeep("Keep the stored context settings","保留已存上下文设置","Bǎoliú yǐ cún shàngxiàwén shèzhì"),
    CustomEndpointsAdditionalModels("Additional model IDs, one per line","附加模型标识，每行一个","Fùjiā móxíng biāozhì, měi háng yí ge"),
    CustomEndpointsLimits("Saving adds or merges model entries and preserves their hidden metadata; it does not remove existing catalog models. An omitted context limit keeps stored limits. Clearing limits or removing catalog models requires other supported Hermes configuration tools. Saved route changes do not switch running agents.","保存会添加或合并模型条目并保留隐藏元数据，不会移除现有目录模型。省略上下文上限会保留已存上限。清除上限或移除目录模型需要其他受支持的 Hermes 配置工具。保存路由更改不会切换运行中的智能体。","Bǎocún huì tiānjiā huò hébìng móxíng tiáomù bìng bǎoliú yǐncáng yuán shùjù, bú huì yíchú xiànyǒu mùlù móxíng. Shěnglüè shàngxiàwén shàngxiàn huì bǎoliú yǐ cún shàngxiàn. Qīngchú shàngxiàn huò yíchú mùlù móxíng xūyào qítā shòu zhīchí de Hermes pèizhì gōngjù. Bǎocún lùyóu gēnggǎi bú huì qiēhuàn yùnxíng zhōng de zhìnéng tǐ."),
    CustomEndpointsSaveEffect("Saves the reviewed endpoint fields and credential choice. Existing unknown provider fields are retained by Hermes. Legacy entries can be promoted to named providers. Enabling model discovery can cause later host requests. If main-route selection is requested, Hermes can reject it after credential changes; an error does not prove that nothing changed.","保存已审阅端点字段及凭据选择。Hermes 会保留提供方的现有未知字段。旧版条目可能提升为命名提供方。启用模型发现可能导致之后的主机请求。如果请求选择主路由，Hermes 可能在凭据更改后拒绝；错误不能证明未发生任何更改。","Bǎocún yǐ shěnyuè duāndiǎn zìduàn jí píngjù xuǎnzé. Hermes huì bǎoliú tígōng fāng de xiànyǒu wèizhī zìduàn. Jiùbǎn tiáomù kěnéng tíshēng wéi mìngmíng tígōng fāng. Qǐyòng móxíng fāxiàn kěnéng dǎozhì zhīhòu de zhǔjī qǐngqiú. Rúguǒ qǐngqiú xuǎnzé zhǔ lùyóu, Hermes kěnéng zài píngjù gēnggǎi hòu jùjué; cuòwù bù néng zhèngmíng wèi fāshēng rènhé gēnggǎi."),
    CustomEndpointsActivateEffect("Selects this configured provider/model as the saved main route and may promote a legacy entry and mirror its credential reference. Hermes applies its model-selection policy. This endpoint offers no warning-override field. It does not prove connectivity, credentials or running-agent adoption.","将此配置的提供方及模型选为已存主路由，可能提升旧版条目并镜像凭据引用。Hermes 会应用模型选择策略。此端点不提供警告覆盖字段。此操作不能证明连接、凭据或运行中智能体的采用情况。","Jiāng cǐ pèizhì de tígōng fāng jí móxíng xuǎn wéi yǐ cún zhǔ lùyóu, kěnéng tíshēng jiùbǎn tiáomù bìng jìngxiàng píngjù yǐnyòng. Hermes huì yìngyòng móxíng xuǎnzé cèlüè. Cǐ duāndiǎn bù tígōng jǐnggào fùgài zìduàn. Cǐ cāozuò bù néng zhèngmíng liánjiē, píngjù huò yùnxíng zhōng zhìnéng tǐ de cǎiyòng qíngkuàng."),
    CustomEndpointsRemoveEffect("Removes this provider/legacy entry and its generated environment key. Hermes can detach the main-model provider, URL and credential mirror when its provider key or display name matches. Duplicate legacy entries, other aliases and external credentials may remain or restore a row. This does not revoke tokens or stop agents.","移除此提供方或旧版条目及其生成的环境密钥。当提供方标识或显示名称匹配时，Hermes 可能解除主模型的提供方、地址及凭据镜像。重复的旧版条目、其他别名及外部凭据可能保留或恢复条目。不会撤销令牌或停止智能体。","Yíchú cǐ tígōng fāng huò jiùbǎn tiáomù jí qí shēngchéng de huánjìng mìyào. Dāng tígōng fāng biāozhì huò xiǎnshì míngchēng pǐpèi shí, Hermes kěnéng jiěchú zhǔ móxíng de tígōng fāng, dìzhǐ jí píngjù jìngxiàng. Chóngfù de jiùbǎn tiáomù, qítā biémíng jí wàibù píngjù kěnéng bǎoliú huò huīfù tiáomù. Bú huì chèxiāo lìngpái huò tíngzhǐ zhìnéng tǐ."),
    CustomEndpointsConcurrency("Actor, profile home, catalog and private provider/legacy fields are checked again before sending. There is no server revision precondition: concurrent edits after that check can be overwritten. Environment secret rotations may be invisible. Unknown outcomes block further profile mutations until reviewed.","发送前会再次检查身份、配置主目录、目录及私有提供方或旧版字段。服务器没有版本前置条件；检查后的并发编辑可能被覆盖。环境密钥轮换可能不可见。结果未知时，审阅前会阻止此配置的后续变更。","Fāsòng qián huì zàicì jiǎnchá shēnfèn, pèizhì zhǔ mùlù, mùlù jí sīyǒu tígōng fāng huò jiùbǎn zìduàn. Fúwùqì méiyǒu bǎnběn qiánzhì tiáojiàn; jiǎnchá hòu de bìngfā biānjí kěnéng bèi fùgài. Huánjìng mìyào lúnhuàn kěnéng bù kějiàn. Jiéguǒ wèizhī shí, shěnyuè qián huì zǔzhǐ cǐ pèizhì de hòuxù biàngēng."),
    CustomEndpointsShared("Generated environment keys can be shared across endpoint IDs or profiles. Credential replacement, clearing, migration or removal can affect other consumers. The host may send prompts and credentials to the configured HTTP(S) destination when used.","生成的环境密钥可能由多个端点标识或配置共享。凭据替换、清除、迁移或移除可能影响其他使用方。使用时，主机可能向配置的 HTTP(S) 目标发送提示词及凭据。","Shēngchéng de huánjìng mìyào kěnéng yóu duō ge duāndiǎn biāozhì huò pèizhì gòngxiǎng. Píngjù tìhuàn, qīngchú, qiānyí huò yíchú kěnéng yǐngxiǎng qítā shǐyòng fāng. Shǐyòng shí, zhǔjī kěnéng xiàng pèizhì de HTTP(S) mùbiāo fāsòng tíshìcí jí píngjù."),
    CustomEndpointsKnownShared("Another reported or saved ID maps to this generated environment-key name. Review the shared-key effects.","另一个已报告或保存的标识映射到此生成的环境密钥名。请审阅共享密钥的影响。","Lìng yí ge yǐ bàogào huò bǎocún de biāozhì yìngshè dào cǐ shēngchéng de huánjìng mìyào míng. Qǐng shěnyuè gòngxiǎng mìyào de yǐngxiǎng."),
    CustomEndpointsApprove("I reviewed the profile, endpoint destination, credential choice, main-route effects and overwrite risk.","我已审阅配置、端点目标、凭据选择、主路由影响及覆盖风险。","Wǒ yǐ shěnyuè pèizhì, duāndiǎn mùbiāo, píngjù xuǎnzé, zhǔ lùyóu yǐngxiǎng jí fùgài fēngxiǎn."),
    CustomEndpointsUnavailable("Endpoint metadata or private preflight fields are incomplete, inconsistent or outside supported bounds. Inspect Hermes and read again.","端点元数据或私有预检字段不完整、不一致或超出支持范围。请检查 Hermes 后重新读取。","Duāndiǎn yuán shùjù huò sīyǒu yùjiǎn zìduàn bù wánzhěng, bù yízhì huò chāochū zhīchí fànwéi. Qǐng jiǎnchá Hermes hòu chóngxīn dúqǔ."),
    CustomEndpointsDuplicate("That ID already names a visible or saved provider/legacy entry. Choose another ID; creation cannot overwrite it.","该标识已指向可见或已存提供方或旧版条目。请选择其他标识；创建操作不能覆盖它。","Gāi biāozhì yǐ zhǐxiàng kějiàn huò yǐ cún tígōng fāng huò jiùbǎn tiáomù. Qǐng xuǎnzé qítā biāozhì; chuàngjiàn cāozuò bù néng fùgài tā."),
    CustomEndpointsAcknowledged("Hermes acknowledged the endpoint request.","Hermes 已确认端点请求。","Hermes yǐ quèrèn duāndiǎn qǐngqiú."),
    CustomEndpointsDifferent("The request was acknowledged, but the later route/ID differs or a removed ID is still reported. Inspect the host before another change.","请求已获确认，但后续路由或标识不同，或仍报告已移除标识。再次更改前请检查主机。","Qǐngqiú yǐ huò quèrèn, dàn hòuxù lùyóu huò biāozhì bùtóng, huò réng bàogào yǐ yíchú biāozhì. Zàicì gēnggǎi qián qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    CustomEndpointsUnsupported("This source, saved key or legacy identity is unsupported or ambiguous for these controls. Inspect its exact configuration on the Hermes host.","此来源、已存标识或旧版身份不受这些控件支持或存在歧义。请在 Hermes 主机上检查确切配置。","Cǐ láiyuán, yǐ cún biāozhì huò jiùbǎn shēnfèn bù shòu zhèxiē kòngjiàn zhīchí huò cúnzài qíyì. Qǐng zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng jiǎnchá quèqiè pèizhì."),
    CustomEndpointsPathUnavailable("This literal ID can be edited in the JSON body. Activation and removal cannot address it safely in the verified endpoint path; use supported Hermes configuration tools for those actions.","此字面标识可以在 JSON 请求体中编辑。已验证端点路径无法安全访问它以激活或移除；这些操作请使用受支持的 Hermes 配置工具。","Cǐ zìmiàn biāozhì kěyǐ zài JSON qǐngqiú tǐ zhōng biānjí. Yǐ yànzhèng duāndiǎn lùjìng wúfǎ ānquán fǎngwèn tā yǐ jīhuó huò yíchú; zhèxiē cāozuò qǐng shǐyòng shòu zhīchí de Hermes pèizhì gōngjù."),
    CustomEndpointsInputInvalid("Enter a name, model and valid HTTP(S) endpoint. New IDs use lowercase ASCII letters, digits, hyphens or underscores. Fresh keys cannot be previews or environment references; context limits must be positive.","请输入名称、模型及有效 HTTP(S) 端点。新标识使用小写 ASCII 字母、数字、连字符或下划线。新密钥不能是预览或环境引用；上下文上限必须为正数。","Qǐng shūrù míngchēng, móxíng jí yǒuxiào HTTP(S) duāndiǎn. Xīn biāozhì shǐyòng xiǎoxiě ASCII zìmǔ, shùzì, liánzìfú huò xiàhuàxiàn. Xīn mìyào bù néng shì yùlǎn huò huánjìng yǐnyòng; shàngxiàwén shàngxiàn bìxū wéi zhèng shù."),
    CustomEndpointsDetails("Review private endpoint details","审阅私有端点详情","Shěnyuè sīyǒu duāndiǎn xiángqíng"),
    CustomEndpointsCredentialPresent("Host reports a credential/reference present; value hidden","主机报告存在凭据或引用；值已隐藏","Zhǔjī bàogào cúnzài píngjù huò yǐnyòng; zhí yǐ yǐncáng"),
    CustomEndpointsReportedAuto("Host reports auto or an unrecognized stored mode","主机报告自动模式或无法识别的已存模式","Zhǔjī bàogào zìdòng móshì huò wúfǎ shíbié de yǐ cún móshì"),
    CustomEndpointsReceipt("Acknowledgment and later catalog state do not prove exact credential contents, cleanup, connectivity, revocation or running-agent adoption. Receipts retain action/choice/count flags and home binding, without endpoint IDs/names, URLs, models, secrets, private configuration or hashes of private values.","确认及后续目录状态不能证明确切凭据内容、清理、连接、撤销或运行中智能体的采用情况。回执保留操作、选择、计数标记及主目录绑定，不含端点标识或名称、地址、模型、密钥、私有配置或私有值哈希。","Quèrèn jí hòuxù mùlù zhuàngtài bù néng zhèngmíng quèqiè píngjù nèiróng, qīnglǐ, liánjiē, chèxiāo huò yùnxíng zhōng zhìnéng tǐ de cǎiyòng qíngkuàng. Huízhí bǎoliú cāozuò, xuǎnzé, jìshù biāojì jí zhǔ mùlù bǎngdìng, bù hán duāndiǎn biāozhì huò míngchēng, dìzhǐ, móxíng, mìyào, sīyǒu pèizhì huò sīyǒu zhí hāxī."),
    HostFallback("Fallback chains","回退链","Huítuì liàn"),
    HostFallbackRead("Read saved fallback chains","读取已保存的回退链","Dúqǔ yǐ bǎocún de huítuì liàn"),
    HostFallbackReadEffect("Hermes returns this profile’s saved configuration, which can contain inline secrets. Only the two fallback fields are retained in this open view, without saving them locally. Provider and model names may also be private.","Hermes 返回此配置已保存的设置，其中可能含内嵌密钥。此界面仅在内存中保留两个回退字段，不保存到本地。提供方及模型名称也可能属于私有信息。","Hermes fǎnhuí cǐ pèizhì yǐ bǎocún de shèzhì, qízhōng kěnéng hán nèiqiàn mìyào. Cǐ jièmiàn jǐn zài nèicún zhōng bǎoliú liǎng ge huítuì zìduàn, bù bǎocún dào běndì. Tígōng fāng jí móxíng míngchēng yě kěnéng shǔyú sīyǒu xìnxī."),
    HostFallbackPrimary("Primary fallback chain","主要回退链","Zhǔyào huítuì liàn"),
    HostFallbackLegacy("Legacy fallback chain","旧版回退链","Jiùbǎn huítuì liàn"),
    HostFallbackOrder("Hermes tries primary rows before legacy rows and deduplicates provider/model/endpoint routes, including provider aliases. Invalid rows are ignored by Hermes. This view shows the saved rows, not the effective runtime chain. Explicitly pinned jobs or delegates may use their own chain.","Hermes 先尝试主要条目，再尝试旧版条目，并按提供方、模型及端点去重（包括提供方别名）。Hermes 忽略无效条目。此处显示保存的条目，而非实际运行链。明确固定路由的作业或子智能体可能使用独立回退链。","Hermes xiān chángshì zhǔyào tiáomù, zài chángshì jiùbǎn tiáomù, bìng àn tígōng fāng, móxíng jí duāndiǎn qùchóng (bāokuò tígōng fāng biémíng). Hermes hūlüè wúxiào tiáomù. Cǐchù xiǎnshì bǎocún de tiáomù, ér fēi shíjì yùnxíng liàn. Míngquè gùdìng lùyóu de zuòyè huò zǐ zhìnéng tǐ kěnéng shǐyòng dúlì huítuì liàn."),
    HostFallbackPreserve("Untouched row fields, including credentials and unknown extensions, are retained exactly. An edited section is saved as a complete ordered array, including previously malformed rows. Removing a row removes its stored fields; edits are staged until the final save.","未更改的条目字段（包括凭据及未知扩展）会原样保留。编辑过的部分将保存为完整有序数组，包括原有格式错误的条目。移除条目会移除其存储字段；最终保存前的编辑仅暂存。","Wèi gēnggǎi de tiáomù zìduàn (bāokuò píngjù jí wèizhī kuòzhǎn) huì yuányàng bǎoliú. Biānjí guò de bùfen jiāng bǎocún wéi wánzhěng yǒuxù shùzǔ, bāokuò yuányǒu géshì cuòwù de tiáomù. Yíchú tiáomù huì yíchú qí cúnchǔ zìduàn; zuìzhōng bǎocún qián de biānjí jǐn zàncún."),
    HostFallbackClear("Stage clearing both chains","暂存清空两条链","Zàncún qīngkōng liǎng tiáo liàn"),
    HostFallbackAdd("Add a fallback row","添加回退条目","Tiānjiā huítuì tiáomù"),
    HostFallbackUp("Move up","上移","Shàngyí"),
    HostFallbackDown("Move down","下移","Xiàyí"),
    HostFallbackRemove("Stage row removal","暂存移除条目","Zàncún yíchú tiáomù"),
    HostFallbackDiscard("Discard staged edits","丢弃暂存编辑","Diūqì zàncún biānjí"),
    HostFallbackUnsupported("This saved row has unsupported or malformed fields. It can be retained, moved or removed; field editing is unavailable.","此保存条目含不支持或格式错误的字段。可以保留、移动或移除；无法编辑字段。","Cǐ bǎocún tiáomù hán bù zhīchí huò géshì cuòwù de zìduàn. Kěyǐ bǎoliú, yídòng huò yíchú; wúfǎ biānjí zìduàn."),
    HostFallbackEndpointPresent("Stored endpoint present; private details hidden","存在已存端点；私有详情已隐藏","Cúnzài yǐ cún duāndiǎn; sīyǒu xiángqíng yǐ yǐncáng"),
    HostFallbackInlinePresent("Inline credential present; never revealed from storage","存在内嵌凭据；不显示已存值","Cúnzài nèiqiàn píngjù; bù xiǎnshì yǐ cún zhí"),
    HostFallbackEnvironmentPresent("Credential environment reference present","存在凭据环境引用","Cúnzài píngjù huánjìng yǐnyòng"),
    HostFallbackExtensions("Preserved extension fields","保留的扩展字段数","Bǎoliú de kuòzhǎn zìduàn shù"),
    HostFallbackKeep("Keep stored credential fields","保留已存凭据字段","Bǎoliú yǐ cún píngjù zìduàn"),
    HostFallbackHost("Use host credential resolution","使用主机凭据解析","Shǐyòng zhǔjī píngjù jiěxī"),
    HostFallbackEnvironment("Use an environment reference","使用环境引用","Shǐyòng huánjìng yǐnyòng"),
    HostFallbackFresh("Store a fresh inline credential","保存新的内嵌凭据","Bǎocún xīn de nèiqiàn píngjù"),
    HostFallbackEnvironmentName("Host environment variable name","主机环境变量名","Zhǔjī huánjìng biànliàng míng"),
    HostFallbackPrivate("Reveal endpoint URLs and credential reference names only when needed; they may contain private data. Existing inline secrets remain hidden. Closing this screen discards the loaded fields and staged edits.","仅在需要时显示端点地址及凭据引用名称；其中可能包含私有数据。已存内嵌密钥仍隐藏。关闭此界面会丢弃已加载字段及暂存编辑。","Jǐn zài xūyào shí xiǎnshì duāndiǎn dìzhǐ jí píngjù yǐnyòng míngchēng; qízhōng kěnéng bāohán sīyǒu shùjù. Yǐ cún nèiqiàn mìyào réng yǐncáng. Guānbì cǐ jièmiàn huì diūqì yǐ jiāzài zìduàn jí zàncún biānjí."),
    HostFallbackEdit("Edit fallback row","编辑回退条目","Biānjí huítuì tiáomù"),
    HostFallbackUrl("Optional host-side endpoint URL","可选的主机端点地址","Kě xuǎn de zhǔjī duāndiǎn dìzhǐ"),
    HostFallbackKeepMode("Keep stored API mode / transport fields","保留已存 API 模式及传输字段","Bǎoliú yǐ cún API móshì jí chuánshū zìduàn"),
    HostFallbackMode("API mode","API 模式","API móshì"),
    HostFallbackAuto("Automatic API mode","自动 API 模式","Zìdòng API móshì"),
    HostFallbackAuth("Credential handling","凭据处理","Píngjù chǔlǐ"),
    HostFallbackAuthEffect("Inline credentials outrank environment references. Choosing host resolution removes this row’s credential fields; choosing an environment name or fresh key replaces them. The Hermes host may send credentials and prompts to the configured endpoint when fallback runs. A fresh inline key is saved in the host configuration.","内嵌凭据优先于环境引用。选择主机解析会移除此条目的凭据字段；选择环境名或新密钥会替换这些字段。执行回退时，Hermes 主机可能向配置端点发送凭据及提示词。新的内嵌密钥会保存到主机配置。","Nèiqiàn píngjù yōuxiān yú huánjìng yǐnyòng. Xuǎnzé zhǔjī jiěxī huì yíchú cǐ tiáomù de píngjù zìduàn; xuǎnzé huánjìng míng huò xīn mìyào huì tìhuàn zhèxiē zìduàn. Zhíxíng huítuì shí, Hermes zhǔjī kěnéng xiàng pèizhì duāndiǎn fāsòng píngjù jí tíshìcí. Xīn de nèiqiàn mìyào huì bǎocún dào zhǔjī pèizhì."),
    HostFallbackInputInvalid("Enter a provider and model, a valid optional HTTP(S) endpoint, and a valid environment name or fresh unmasked credential when selected.","请输入提供方、模型、有效的可选 HTTP(S) 端点，以及所选方式需要的有效环境名或未掩码新凭据。","Qǐng shūrù tígōng fāng, móxíng, yǒuxiào de kě xuǎn HTTP(S) duāndiǎn, yǐjí suǒ xuǎn fāngshì xūyào de yǒuxiào huánjìng míng huò wèi yǎnmǎ xīn píngjù."),
    HostFallbackStage("Stage this row","暂存此条目","Zàncún cǐ tiáomù"),
    HostFallbackSave("Save reviewed fallback chains","保存已审阅回退链","Bǎocún yǐ shěnyuè huítuì liàn"),
    HostFallbackSaveEffect("Saves only the changed fallback sections in this profile’s configuration. Clearing both writes empty arrays and disables this saved chain. This does not switch running agents, validate providers or revoke credentials.","仅保存此配置中更改过的回退部分。清空两者会写入空数组并禁用此保存链。此操作不会切换运行中的智能体、验证提供方或撤销凭据。","Jǐn bǎocún cǐ pèizhì zhōng gēnggǎi guò de huítuì bùfen. Qīngkōng liǎng zhě huì xiěrù kōng shùzǔ bìng jìnyòng cǐ bǎocún liàn. Cǐ cāozuò bú huì qiēhuàn yùnxíng zhōng de zhìnéng tǐ, yànzhèng tígōng fāng huò chèxiāo píngjù."),
    HostFallbackConcurrency("Both saved fields and the profile home are checked again before sending. Hermes offers no revision precondition here; another client can change a chain after that check and this save can overwrite it. Unknown outcomes require host inspection before another mutation.","发送前会再次检查两个已存字段及配置主目录。Hermes 此处没有版本前置条件；其他客户端仍可在检查后修改链，并被此次保存覆盖。结果未知时，再次变更前需要检查主机。","Fāsòng qián huì zàicì jiǎnchá liǎng ge yǐ cún zìduàn jí pèizhì zhǔ mùlù. Hermes cǐchù méiyǒu bǎnběn qiánzhì tiáojiàn; qítā kèhùduān réng kě zài jiǎnchá hòu xiūgǎi liàn, bìng bèi cǐ cì bǎocún fùgài. Jiéguǒ wèizhī shí, zàicì biàngēng qián xūyào jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    HostFallbackApprove("I reviewed both chains, endpoint destinations, credential handling, retained fields and the overwrite risk.","我已审阅两条链、端点目标、凭据处理、保留字段及覆盖风险。","Wǒ yǐ shěnyuè liǎng tiáo liàn, duāndiǎn mùbiāo, píngjù chǔlǐ, bǎoliú zìduàn jí fùgài fēngxiǎn."),
    HostFallbackReplaced("This section will be replaced by the reviewed array","此部分将由已审阅数组替换","Cǐ bùfen jiāng yóu yǐ shěnyuè shùzǔ tìhuàn"),
    HostFallbackUnchanged("This section is omitted from the save","保存请求省略此部分","Bǎocún qǐngqiú shěnglüè cǐ bùfen"),
    HostFallbackUnavailable("Saved fallback fields exceed supported bounds or cannot be read safely. Check the Hermes host.","已存回退字段超出支持范围或无法安全读取。请检查 Hermes 主机。","Yǐ cún huítuì zìduàn chāochū zhīchí fànwéi huò wúfǎ ānquán dúqǔ. Qǐng jiǎnchá Hermes zhǔjī."),
    HostFallbackAcknowledged("Hermes acknowledged the fallback configuration save.","Hermes 已确认回退配置保存。","Hermes yǐ quèrèn huítuì pèizhì bǎocún."),
    HostFallbackDifferent("Hermes acknowledged the save, but the later saved fields differ. Inspect the host before another change.","Hermes 已确认保存，但之后读取的已存字段不同。再次更改前请检查主机。","Hermes yǐ quèrèn bǎocún, dàn zhīhòu dúqǔ de yǐ cún zìduàn bùtóng. Zàicì gēnggǎi qián qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    HostFallbackReceipt("The acknowledgment proves only that Hermes accepted this request. Later saved fields are an observation, not proof of runtime adoption, credential health or exact effective fallback order. Receipts contain section names and row counts, without route values, endpoints, credential names, secrets, extension data or secret hashes.","确认仅证明 Hermes 接受了此请求。后续已存字段属于观察，不能证明运行时采用、凭据健康或确切有效回退顺序。回执仅含部分名称及条目数，不含路由值、端点、凭据名称、密钥、扩展数据或密钥哈希。","Quèrèn jǐn zhèngmíng Hermes jiēshòu le cǐ qǐngqiú. Hòuxù yǐ cún zìduàn shǔyú guānchá, bù néng zhèngmíng yùnxíng shí cǎiyòng, píngjù jiànkāng huò quèqiè yǒuxiào huítuì shùnxù. Huízhí jǐn hán bùfen míngchēng jí tiáomù shù, bù hán lùyóu zhí, duāndiǎn, píngjù míngchēng, mìyào, kuòzhǎn shùjù huò mìyào hāxī."),
    CredentialPoolDetails("Review host cleanup messages","审阅主机清理消息","Shěnyuè zhǔjī qīnglǐ xiāoxi"),
    CredentialPoolPrivateDetails("These original host messages may contain private file paths, errors or commands. Reveal only when needed. They are not saved in receipts or executed. Closing the pool screen, reading again, switching scope or signing out discards them; a later inventory read cannot recreate this response.","这些原始主机消息可能包含私有文件路径、错误或命令。仅在需要时显示。不会保存到回执或执行。关闭凭据池界面、重新读取、切换范围或退出登录会丢弃它们；之后读取目录无法重建此响应。","Zhèxiē yuánshǐ zhǔjī xiāoxi kěnéng bāohán sīyǒu wénjiàn lùjìng, cuòwù huò mìnglìng. Jǐn zài xūyào shí xiǎnshì. Bú huì bǎocún dào huízhí huò zhíxíng. Guānbì píngjù chí jièmiàn, chóngxīn dúqǔ, qiēhuàn fànwéi huò tuìchū dēnglù huì diūqì tāmen; zhīhòu dúqǔ mùlù wúfǎ chóngjiàn cǐ xiǎngyìng."),

    CredentialPoolOk("Host reports OK; not a health check","主机报告正常；并非健康检查","Zhǔjī bàogào zhèngcháng; bìng fēi jiànkāng jiǎnchá"),
    CredentialPoolSharedEffect("Borrowed single-use OAuth grants can be refreshed in the shared root store and affect other profiles. Adding can create a profile-owned pool that hides borrowed rows. Removal may leave shared root or other CLI credentials intact.","借用的一次性 OAuth 授权可能在共享根存储中刷新并影响其他配置。添加可能创建此配置所有的池并隐藏借用条目。移除可能保留共享根存储或其他命令行工具的凭据。","Jièyòng de yí cì xìng OAuth shòuquán kěnéng zài gòngxiǎng gēn cúnchǔ zhōng shuāxīn bìng yǐngxiǎng qítā pèizhì. Tiānjiā kěnéng chuàngjiàn cǐ pèizhì suǒyǒu de chí bìng yǐncáng jièyòng tiáomù. Yíchú kěnéng bǎoliú gòngxiǎng gēn cúnchǔ huò qítā mìnglìng háng gōngjù de píngjù."),

    CredentialPool("Credential pools","凭据池","Píngjù chí"),
    CredentialPoolRead("Read credential pools","读取凭据池","Dúqǔ píngjù chí"),
    CredentialPoolAdd("Add a fresh pool credential","添加新的池凭据","Tiānjiā xīn de chí píngjù"),
    CredentialPoolRemove("Remove the current pool index","移除当前池索引","Yíchú dāngqián chí suǒyǐn"),
    CredentialPoolProvider("Canonical provider / pool ID","规范提供方或池标识","Guīfàn tígōng fāng huò chí biāozhì"),
    CredentialPoolLabel("Optional new label","可选的新标签","Kě xuǎn de xīn biāoqiān"),
    CredentialPoolDefaultLabel("Host-generated label","主机生成的标签","Zhǔjī shēngchéng de biāoqiān"),
    CredentialPoolFresh("Fresh credential","新凭据","Xīn píngjù"),
    CredentialPoolReveal("Show this fresh credential","显示此新凭据","Xiǎnshì cǐ xīn píngjù"),
    CredentialPoolEntryCount("Reported entries","报告的条目数","Bàogào de tiáomù shù"),
    CredentialPoolIndex("Requested 1-based index","请求的索引（从一开始）","Qǐngqiú de suǒyǐn (cóng yī kāishǐ)"),
    CredentialPoolReviewedId("Reviewed entry ID","已审阅条目标识","Yǐ shěnyuè tiáomù biāozhì"),
    CredentialPoolRequests("Reported requests","报告的请求数","Bàogào de qǐngqiú shù"),
    CredentialPoolPriority("Reported priority","报告的优先级","Bàogào de yōuxiān jí"),
    CredentialPoolRefreshPresent("Refresh credential reported present","报告存在刷新凭据","Bàogào cúnzài shuāxīn píngjù"),
    CredentialPoolRefreshAbsent("No refresh credential reported","未报告刷新凭据","Wèi bàogào shuāxīn píngjù"),
    CredentialPoolManual("Manual source","手动来源","Shǒudòng láiyuán"),
    CredentialPoolEnvironment("Environment source","环境来源","Huánjìng láiyuán"),
    CredentialPoolConfiguration("Configuration source","配置来源","Pèizhì láiyuán"),
    CredentialPoolOAuth("Hermes OAuth source","Hermes OAuth 来源","Hermes OAuth láiyuán"),
    CredentialPoolExternal("External CLI source","外部命令行工具来源","Wàibù mìnglìng háng gōngjù láiyuán"),
    CredentialPoolHook("Provider or plugin source","提供方或插件来源","Tígōng fāng huò chājiàn láiyuán"),
    CredentialPoolUnreported("No exhaustion status reported","未报告耗尽状态","Wèi bàogào hàojìn zhuàngtài"),
    CredentialPoolExhausted("Reported exhausted","报告已耗尽","Bàogào yǐ hàojìn"),
    CredentialPoolDead("Reported unusable","报告不可用","Bàogào bù kěyòng"),
    CredentialPoolOtherStatus("Other host-reported status","其他主机报告状态","Qítā zhǔjī bàogào zhuàngtài"),
    CredentialPoolReadEffect("Reads this profile’s reported pool entries and order. Loading can seed, normalize, refresh or persist credentials, including shared OAuth grants. A provider that fails to load may be omitted. Credential previews and detailed source fields are omitted. Labels and IDs remain visible and may contain private information; counts and status do not prove credential health or completeness.","读取此配置报告的凭据池条目及顺序。加载可能填充、规范化、刷新或保存凭据，包括共享的 OAuth 授权。加载失败的提供方可能被省略。省略凭据预览及详细来源字段。标签和标识仍可见且可能包含私有信息；计数及状态不能证明凭据健康或信息完整。","Dúqǔ cǐ pèizhì bàogào de píngjù chí tiáomù jí shùnxù. Jiāzài kěnéng tiánchōng, guīfànhuà, shuāxīn huò bǎocún píngjù, bāokuò gòngxiǎng de OAuth shòuquán. Jiāzài shībài de tígōng fāng kěnéng bèi shěnglüè. Shěnglüè píngjù yùlǎn jí xiángxì láiyuán zìduàn. Biāoqiān hé biāozhì réng kějiàn qiě kěnéng bāohán sīyǒu xìnxī; jìshù jí zhuàngtài bù néng zhèngmíng píngjù jiànkāng huò xìnxī wánzhěng."),
    CredentialPoolAddEffect("Saves this fresh credential in the selected provider’s pool. Hermes may classify compatible tokens differently from API keys. Unless the pool ID starts with custom:, adding attempts to re-enable every suppressed source for this provider, so older credentials may return. No credential-health check or model assignment is requested.","将此新凭据保存到所选提供方的池。Hermes 可能将兼容令牌归类为不同于 API 密钥的类型。除非池标识以 custom: 开头，添加还会尝试重新启用此提供方的所有已抑制来源，因此旧凭据可能重新出现。不会请求凭据健康检查或模型分配。","Jiāng cǐ xīn píngjù bǎocún dào suǒ xuǎn tígōng fāng de chí. Hermes kěnéng jiāng jiānróng lìngpái guīlèi wéi bùtóng yú API mìyào de lèixíng. Chúfēi chí biāozhì yǐ custom: kāitóu, tiānjiā hái huì chángshì chóngxīn qǐyòng cǐ tígōng fāng de suǒyǒu yǐ yìzhì láiyuán, yīncǐ jiù píngjù kěnéng chóngxīn chūxiàn. Bú huì qǐngqiú píngjù jiànkāng jiǎnchá huò móxíng fēnpèi."),
    CredentialPoolRemoveEffect("Removes a pool entry and runs its host source cleanup. This may remove a shared environment key, Hermes OAuth file or provider tokens, invoke provider/plugin cleanup and suppress reseeding. Other CLI/configuration credentials can remain. It does not revoke provider tokens or stop running agents.","移除池条目并运行其主机来源清理。可能移除共享环境密钥、Hermes OAuth 文件或提供方令牌，调用提供方或插件清理并抑制重新填充。其他命令行工具或配置中的凭据可能保留。此操作不会撤销提供方令牌或停止运行中的智能体。","Yíchú chí tiáomù bìng yùnxíng qí zhǔjī láiyuán qīnglǐ. Kěnéng yíchú gòngxiǎng huánjìng mìyào, Hermes OAuth wénjiàn huò tígōng fāng lìngpái, diàoyòng tígōng fāng huò chājiàn qīnglǐ bìng yìzhì chóngxīn tiánchōng. Qítā mìnglìng háng gōngjù huò pèizhì zhōng de píngjù kěnéng bǎoliú. Cǐ cāozuò bú huì chèxiāo tígōng fāng lìngpái huò tíngzhǐ yùnxíng zhōng de zhìnéng tǐ."),
    CredentialPoolConcurrency("The visible structure is re-read before sending. Credential contents can change without appearing in this metadata. Other clients and pending sign-ins can still change or restore entries.","发送前会重新读取可见结构。凭据内容可能变化而不反映在此元数据中。其他客户端及待处理登录仍可能更改或恢复条目。","Fāsòng qián huì chóngxīn dúqǔ kějiàn jiégòu. Píngjù nèiróng kěnéng biànhuà ér bù fǎnyìng zài cǐ yuán shùjù zhōng. Qítā kèhùduān jí dài chǔlǐ dēnglù réng kěnéng gēnggǎi huò huīfù tiáomù."),
    CredentialPoolIndexEffect("Hermes deletes whichever entry occupies this index when the request runs. The reviewed ID and order are checked first, but concurrent reordering can select another entry. The response does not identify the credential actually removed.","Hermes 会删除请求执行时占据此索引的条目。会先检查已审阅标识及顺序，但并发重新排序可能选中其他条目。响应不会标识实际移除的凭据。","Hermes huì shānchú qǐngqiú zhíxíng shí zhànjù cǐ suǒyǐn de tiáomù. Huì xiān jiǎnchá yǐ shěnyuè biāozhì jí shùnxù, dàn bìngfā chóngxīn páixù kěnéng xuǎnzhòng qítā tiáomù. Xiǎngyìng bú huì biāozhì shíjì yíchú de píngjù."),
    CredentialPoolApprove("I reviewed the provider, profile, credential or current index, and these effects.","我已审阅提供方、配置、凭据或当前索引及这些影响。","Wǒ yǐ shěnyuè tígōng fāng, pèizhì, píngjù huò dāngqián suǒyǐn jí zhèxiē yǐngxiǎng."),
    CredentialPoolInputInvalid("Use the exact lowercase pool ID and a fresh unmasked credential. Labels are optional and cannot contain control characters.","请使用确切的小写池标识及未掩码的新凭据。标签可选且不能含控制字符。","Qǐng shǐyòng quèqiè de xiǎoxiě chí biāozhì jí wèi yǎnmǎ de xīn píngjù. Biāoqiān kě xuǎn qiě bù néng hán kòngzhì zìfú."),
    CredentialPoolProviderInvalid("This pool ID cannot be addressed safely by the verified endpoint. Check its canonical ID on the Hermes host.","此池标识无法通过已验证端点安全访问。请在 Hermes 主机上检查其规范标识。","Cǐ chí biāozhì wúfǎ tōngguò yǐ yànzhèng duāndiǎn ānquán fǎngwèn. Qǐng zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng jiǎnchá qí guīfàn biāozhì."),
    CredentialPoolCli("OAuth refresh-pair setup, reordering and exhaustion resets require the Hermes host’s supported tools; this pool endpoint exposes fresh credential addition and index removal.","OAuth 刷新凭据对设置、重新排序及耗尽状态重置需要 Hermes 主机支持的工具；此池端点提供新凭据添加及索引移除。","OAuth shuāxīn píngjù duì shèzhì, chóngxīn páixù jí hàojìn zhuàngtài chóngzhì xūyào Hermes zhǔjī zhīchí de gōngjù; cǐ chí duāndiǎn tígōng xīn píngjù tiānjiā jí suǒyǐn yíchú."),
    CredentialPoolUnavailable("The pool inventory is incomplete, inconsistent or outside supported bounds. Check Hermes and read again.","凭据池目录不完整、不一致或超出支持范围。请检查 Hermes 后重新读取。","Píngjù chí mùlù bù wánzhěng, bù yízhì huò chāochū zhīchí fànwéi. Qǐng jiǎnchá Hermes hòu chóngxīn dúqǔ."),
    CredentialPoolAcknowledged("Hermes acknowledged the pool request.","Hermes 已确认凭据池请求。","Hermes yǐ quèrèn píngjù chí qǐngqiú."),
    CredentialPoolIdStillReported("Hermes acknowledged the request, but the reviewed ID is still reported. Reseeding, concurrent changes or index movement may explain this; inspect the host before another change.","Hermes 已确认请求，但仍报告已审阅标识。可能由重新填充、并发更改或索引移动引起；再次更改前请检查主机。","Hermes yǐ quèrèn qǐngqiú, dàn réng bàogào yǐ shěnyuè biāozhì. Kěnéng yóu chóngxīn tiánchōng, bìngfā gēnggǎi huò suǒyǐn yídòng yǐnqǐ; zàicì gēnggǎi qián qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    CredentialPoolReportedCount("Host-reported count at acknowledgment","确认时主机报告的计数","Quèrèn shí zhǔjī bàogào de jìshù"),
    CredentialPoolIndexReceipt("This receipt records the requested index and reviewed ID; the host did not echo the identity actually removed.","此回执记录请求的索引及已审阅标识；主机未返回实际移除的身份。","Cǐ huízhí jìlù qǐngqiú de suǒyǐn jí yǐ shěnyuè biāozhì; zhǔjī wèi fǎnhuí shíjì yíchú de shēnfèn."),
    CredentialPoolCleanupMessages("Reported cleanup messages","报告的清理消息数","Bàogào de qīnglǐ xiāoxi shù"),
    CredentialPoolHints("Reported hint messages","报告的提示消息数","Bàogào de tíshì xiāoxi shù"),
    CredentialPoolCleanupUnavailable("Cleanup details were unavailable or malformed. The captured request acknowledgment remains.","清理详情不可用或格式错误。已收到的请求确认仍保留。","Qīnglǐ xiángqíng bù kěyòng huò géshì cuòwù. Yǐ shōudào de qǐngqiú quèrèn réng bǎoliú."),
    CredentialPoolReceipt("Counts, message totals and later presence/absence do not prove exact credential contents, source cleanup, revocation, completeness or running-agent adoption. Fresh values, labels, previews and raw cleanup text are not saved in receipts.","计数、消息总数及后续存在与否不能证明确切凭据内容、来源清理、撤销、完整性或运行中智能体的采用情况。新值、标签、预览及原始清理文本不会保存到回执。","Jìshù, xiāoxi zǒngshù jí hòuxù cúnzài yǔ fǒu bù néng zhèngmíng quèqiè píngjù nèiróng, láiyuán qīnglǐ, chèxiāo, wánzhěng xìng huò yùnxíng zhōng zhìnéng tǐ de cǎiyòng qíngkuàng. Xīn zhí, biāoqiān, yùlǎn jí yuánshǐ qīnglǐ wénběn bú huì bǎocún dào huízhí."),

    ProviderOAuthApprove("I reviewed this provider, profile, account and effect.","我已审阅此提供方、配置、账户及影响。","Wǒ yǐ shěnyuè cǐ tígōng fāng, pèizhì, zhànghù jí yǐngxiǎng."),
    ProviderAccounts("Provider accounts","提供方账户","Tígōng fāng zhànghù"),
    ProviderAccountsRead("Read account catalog","读取账户目录","Dúqǔ zhànghù mùlù"),
    ProviderOAuthPrivacy("Reads account status for this profile. Provider or plugin status hooks may probe or refresh credentials. Token previews, source paths, commands and private errors are omitted. Status is not a health test.","读取此配置的账户状态。提供方或插件状态钩子可能探测或刷新凭据。省略令牌预览、来源路径、命令及私有错误。状态不代表健康检查。","Dúqǔ cǐ pèizhì de zhànghù zhuàngtài. Tígōng fāng huò chājiàn zhuàngtài gōuzi kěnéng tàncè huò shuāxīn píngjù. Shěnglüè lìngpái yùlǎn, láiyuán lùjìng, mìnglìng jí sīyǒu cuòwù. Zhuàngtài bù dàibiǎo jiànkāng jiǎnchá."),
    ProviderOAuthStart("Start device-code sign-in","启动设备代码登录","Qǐdòng shèbèi dàimǎ dēnglù"),
    ProviderOAuthCancel("Cancel this host sign-in session","取消此主机登录会话","Qǔxiāo cǐ zhǔjī dēnglù huìhuà"),
    ProviderDisconnect("Disconnect stored provider credentials","断开存储的提供方凭据","Duànkāi cúnchǔ de tígōng fāng píngjù"),
    ProviderOAuthConnected("Reported signed in","报告已登录","Bàogào yǐ dēnglù"),
    ProviderOAuthNotConnected("Reported signed out","报告未登录","Bàogào wèi dēnglù"),
    ProviderOAuthExternal("Native device-code sign-in is unavailable for this flow. Configure it on the Hermes host using the provider’s supported setup.","此流程无法使用原生设备代码登录。请在 Hermes 主机上通过提供方支持的方式设置。","Cǐ liúchéng wúfǎ shǐyòng yuánshēng shèbèi dàimǎ dēnglù. Qǐng zài Hermes zhǔjī shàng tōngguò tígōng fāng zhīchí de fāngshì shèzhì."),
    ProviderOAuthExternalDisconnect("Hermes cannot disconnect this source here. Remove it with its owning CLI or the host key settings.","Hermes 无法在此断开此来源。请通过所属命令行工具或主机密钥设置移除。","Hermes wúfǎ zài cǐ duànkāi cǐ láiyuán. Qǐng tōngguò suǒshǔ mìnglìng háng gōngjù huò zhǔjī mìyào shèzhì yíchú."),
    ProviderOAuthStartEffect("Starts one sign-in worker on this Hermes profile. It continues when this phone closes or stops waiting. Approval can save or replace credentials and affect account pools, provider selection, default models or Nous app handoff. Provider plugins can run their own login hooks. Inspect the account and destination before authorizing. A lost start reply will not be retried automatically.","在此 Hermes 配置上启动一个登录工作线程。手机关闭或停止等待后仍会继续。批准可能保存或替换凭据，并影响账户池、提供方选择、默认模型或 Nous 应用交接。提供方插件可以运行自己的登录钩子。授权前请检查账户及目标地址。启动响应丢失后不会自动重试。","Zài cǐ Hermes pèizhì shàng qǐdòng yí gè dēnglù gōngzuò xiànchéng. Shǒujī guānbì huò tíngzhǐ děngdài hòu réng huì jìxù. Pīzhǔn kěnéng bǎocún huò tìhuàn píngjù, bìng yǐngxiǎng zhànghù chí, tígōng fāng xuǎnzé, mòrèn móxíng huò Nous yìngyòng jiāojiē. Tígōng fāng chājiàn kěyǐ yùnxíng zìjǐ de dēnglù gōuzi. Shòuquán qián qǐng jiǎnchá zhànghù jí mùbiāo dìzhǐ. Qǐdòng xiǎngyìng diūshī hòu bú huì zìdòng chóngshì."),
    ProviderOAuthCancelEffect("Asks Hermes to cancel and forget this exact sign-in session after checking its provider and profile. Credentials may already have been saved. This does not disconnect, revoke tokens, undo handoff or stop running agents. Closing this screen only stops the phone’s wait.","检查提供方及配置后，请求 Hermes 取消并忘记此确切登录会话。凭据可能已经保存。此操作不会断开账户、撤销令牌、撤回交接或停止运行中的智能体。关闭此界面仅停止手机等待。","Jiǎnchá tígōng fāng jí pèizhì hòu, qǐngqiú Hermes qǔxiāo bìng wàngjì cǐ quèqiè dēnglù huìhuà. Píngjù kěnéng yǐjīng bǎocún. Cǐ cāozuò bú huì duànkāi zhànghù, chèxiāo lìngpái, chèhuí jiāojiē huò tíngzhǐ yùnxíng zhōng de zhìnéng tǐ. Guānbì cǐ jièmiàn jǐn tíngzhǐ shǒujī děngdài."),
    ProviderDisconnectEffect("Removes this provider’s stored Hermes auth and credential-pool entries and clears its active-provider marker. Anthropic also removes the Hermes-owned OAuth file. Environment keys and credentials owned by other CLIs remain. This does not revoke provider tokens, cancel pending sign-ins or prove that running agents changed accounts. Pending sign-ins or external sources may restore credentials.","移除此提供方存储的 Hermes 认证及凭据池条目，并清除其活动提供方标记。Anthropic 还会移除 Hermes 所有的 OAuth 文件。环境密钥和其他命令行工具所有的凭据会保留。此操作不会撤销提供方令牌、取消待处理登录，也不能证明运行中的智能体已更换账户。待处理登录或外部来源可能恢复凭据。","Yíchú cǐ tígōng fāng cúnchǔ de Hermes rènzhèng jí píngjù chí tiáomù, bìng qīngchú qí huódòng tígōng fāng biāojì. Anthropic hái huì yíchú Hermes suǒyǒu de OAuth wénjiàn. Huánjìng mìyào hé qítā mìnglìng háng gōngjù suǒyǒu de píngjù huì bǎoliú. Cǐ cāozuò bú huì chèxiāo tígōng fāng lìngpái, qǔxiāo dài chǔlǐ dēnglù, yě bù néng zhèngmíng yùnxíng zhōng de zhìnéng tǐ yǐ gēnghuàn zhànghù. Dài chǔlǐ dēnglù huò wàibù láiyuán kěnéng huīfù píngjù."),
    ProviderOAuthAcknowledged("Hermes acknowledged the request. Sign-in approval and account health are separate observations.","Hermes 已确认请求。登录批准及账户健康状态是独立观察结果。","Hermes yǐ quèrèn qǐngqiú. Dēnglù pīzhǔn jí zhànghù jiànkāng zhuàngtài shì dúlì guānchá jiéguǒ."),
    ProviderOAuthLifecycle("The host keeps polling independently. Refresh status after returning from the browser. Only the original host, profile, account and start receipt can inspect this flow. A missing or expired session does not prove that credentials were removed.","主机会独立继续轮询。从浏览器返回后请刷新状态。仅原始主机、配置、账户及启动回执可以检查此流程。会话缺失或过期并不证明凭据已移除。","Zhǔjī huì dúlì jìxù lúnxún. Cóng liúlǎnqì fǎnhuí hòu qǐng shuāxīn zhuàngtài. Jǐn yuánshǐ zhǔjī, pèizhì, zhànghù jí qǐdòng huízhí kěyǐ jiǎnchá cǐ liúchéng. Huìhuà quēshī huò guòqī bìng bù zhèngmíng píngjù yǐ yíchú."),
    ProviderOAuthInspect("Inspect owned sign-in session","检查所属登录会话","Jiǎnchá suǒshǔ dēnglù huìhuà"),
    ProviderOAuthStatus("Refresh sign-in status","刷新登录状态","Shuāxīn dēnglù zhuàngtài"),
    ProviderOAuthShowCode("Show one-time device code","显示一次性设备代码","Xiǎnshì yí cì xìng shèbèi dàimǎ"),
    ProviderOAuthNoCode("No usable unexpired code is available on this phone. Status checks can still inspect an acknowledged flow.","此手机没有可用且未过期的代码。状态检查仍可查看已确认的流程。","Cǐ shǒujī méiyǒu kěyòng qiě wèi guòqī de dàimǎ. Zhuàngtài jiǎnchá réng kě chá kàn yǐ quèrèn de liúchéng."),
    ProviderOAuthUnavailable("The catalog or owned session is unavailable, missing, inconsistent or outside supported bounds. Check Hermes; do not assume sign-in was undone.","目录或所属会话不可用、缺失、不一致或超出支持范围。请检查 Hermes；不要假定登录已撤销。","Mùlù huò suǒshǔ huìhuà bù kěyòng, quēshī, bù yízhì huò chāochū zhīchí fànwéi. Qǐng jiǎnchá Hermes; bú yào jiǎdìng dēnglù yǐ chèxiāo."),
    ProviderOAuthBrowser("Opens the host-reported HTTPS destination in your browser after a fresh ownership and status check. A one-time code may be in the link. Verify the browser address and provider account before approving. The code and full link are encrypted locally and never written to receipts. Recovery expires within 15 minutes; expired vault entries are deleted on the next access.","重新检查所属关系及状态后，在浏览器中打开主机报告的 HTTPS 目标。链接可能包含一次性代码。批准前请核实浏览器地址及提供方账户。代码及完整链接在本地加密存储，绝不写入回执。恢复功能在十五分钟内过期；过期的加密条目会在下次访问时删除。","Chóngxīn jiǎnchá suǒshǔ guānxì jí zhuàngtài hòu, zài liúlǎnqì zhōng dǎkāi zhǔjī bàogào de HTTPS mùbiāo. Liànjiē kěnéng bāohán yí cì xìng dàimǎ. Pīzhǔn qián qǐng héshí liúlǎnqì dìzhǐ jí tígōng fāng zhànghù. Dàimǎ jí wánzhěng liànjiē zài běndì jiāmì cúnchǔ, jué bù xiěrù huízhí. Huīfù gōngnéng zài shíwǔ fēnzhōng nèi guòqī; guòqī de jiāmì tiáomù huì zài xià cì fǎngwèn shí shānchú."),
    ProviderOAuthPending("Host reports pending approval","主机报告等待批准","Zhǔjī bàogào děngdài pīzhǔn"),
    ProviderOAuthDenied("Host reports denied","主机报告已拒绝","Zhǔjī bàogào yǐ jùjué"),
    ProviderOAuthCancelled("Session cancellation was acknowledged; saved credentials may remain.","会话取消已确认；已保存的凭据可能仍然存在。","Huìhuà qǔxiāo yǐ quèrèn; yǐ bǎocún de píngjù kěnéng réngrán cúnzài."),

    HostMoa("Mixture-of-Agents presets","多智能体混合预设","Duō zhìnéng tǐ hùnhé yùshè"),
    HostMoaRead("Read presets and model catalogs","读取预设及模型目录","Dúqǔ yùshè jí móxíng mùlù"),
    HostMoaReadEffect("Reads this profile’s normalized named presets, selectors and privacy-filter mode, together with the main/auxiliary configuration and provider catalogs. Reported defaults may replace invalid stored values. No model inference is requested.","读取此配置规范化后的命名预设、选择项和隐私过滤模式，以及主模型、辅助任务配置和提供方目录。报告的默认值可能替代无效的存储值。不会请求模型推理。","Dúqǔ cǐ pèizhì guīfànhuà hòu de mìngmíng yùshè, xuǎnzé xiàng hé yǐnsī guòlǜ móshì, yǐjí zhǔ móxíng, fǔzhù rènwù pèizhì hé tígōng fāng mùlù. Bàogào de mòrèn zhí kěnéng tìdài wúxiào de cúnchǔ zhí. Bú huì qǐngqiú móxíng tuīlǐ."),
    HostMoaUnavailable("The MoA configuration is incomplete, inconsistent or outside supported bounds. Read it again after checking Hermes.","MoA 配置不完整、不一致或超出支持范围。请检查 Hermes 后重新读取。","MoA pèizhì bù wánzhěng, bù yízhì huò chāochū zhīchí fànwéi. Qǐng jiǎnchá Hermes hòu chóngxīn dúqǔ."),
    HostMoaDraft("Edits stay on this phone until a separate full-map review and confirmation. Closing discards the draft.","编辑保留在手机上，直到单独审阅并确认完整预设映射。关闭会丢弃草稿。","Biānjí bǎoliú zài shǒujī shàng, zhídào dāndú shěnyuè bìng quèrèn wánzhěng yùshè yìngshè. Guānbì huì diūqì cǎogǎo."),
    HostMoaDefault("Configured default preset","配置的默认预设","Pèizhì de mòrèn yùshè"),
    HostMoaActive("Configured active preset","配置的活动预设","Pèizhì de huódòng yùshè"),
    HostMoaInactive("No configured active preset","未配置活动预设","Wèi pèizhì huódòng yùshè"),
    HostMoaPrivacy("Reported privacy-filter mode (read-only here)","报告的隐私过滤模式（此处只读）","Bàogào de yǐnsī guòlǜ móshì (cǐ chù zhǐ dú)"),
    HostMoaPrivacyEffect("This endpoint preserves the host’s stored privacy-filter policy and cannot edit it.","此端点保留主机存储的隐私过滤策略，无法编辑它。","Cǐ duāndiǎn bǎoliú zhǔjī cúnchǔ de yǐnsī guòlǜ cèlüè, wúfǎ biānjí tā."),
    HostMoaNewName("New preset name","新预设名称","Xīn yùshè míngchēng"),
    HostMoaDuplicate("Duplicate reported preset","复制报告的预设","Fùzhì bàogào de yùshè"),
    HostMoaRemove("Remove preset from draft","从草稿移除预设","Cóng cǎogǎo yíchú yùshè"),
    HostMoaAtLeastOne("At least one preset and one reference must remain.","必须至少保留一个预设和一个参考模型。","Bìxū zhìshǎo bǎoliú yí gè yùshè hé yí gè cānkǎo móxíng."),
    HostMoaEdit("Edit preset","编辑预设","Biānjí yùshè"),
    HostMoaReferences("Reference models (ordered)","参考模型（有序）","Cānkǎo móxíng (yǒuxù)"),
    HostMoaAggregator("Aggregator model","聚合模型","Jùhé móxíng"),
    HostMoaAddReference("Add reference model","添加参考模型","Tiānjiā cānkǎo móxíng"),
    HostMoaCopyReference("Duplicate reference","复制参考模型","Fùzhì cānkǎo móxíng"),
    HostMoaRemoveReference("Remove reference","移除参考模型","Yíchú cānkǎo móxíng"),
    HostMoaMoveUp("Move earlier","向前移动","Xiàng qián yídòng"),
    HostMoaMoveDown("Move later","向后移动","Xiàng hòu yídòng"),
    HostMoaReferenceTemperature("Reference temperature (blank = provider default)","参考模型温度（空白为提供方默认值）","Cānkǎo móxíng wēndù (kòngbái wéi tígōng fāng mòrèn zhí)"),
    HostMoaAggregatorTemperature("Aggregator temperature (blank = provider default)","聚合模型温度（空白为提供方默认值）","Jùhé móxíng wēndù (kòngbái wéi tígōng fāng mòrèn zhí)"),
    HostMoaTimeout("Reference timeout seconds (blank = host inheritance)","参考模型超时秒数（空白为继承主机设置）","Cānkǎo móxíng chāoshí miǎo shù (kòngbái wéi jìchéng zhǔjī shèzhì)"),
    HostMoaCadence("Reference call cadence","参考模型调用频率","Cānkǎo móxíng diàoyòng pínlǜ"),
    HostMoaPerTurn("Once per user turn","每次用户回合一次","Měi cì yònghù huíhé yí cì"),
    HostMoaPerIteration("Each tool iteration","每次工具迭代","Měi cì gōngjù diédài"),
    HostMoaEveryN("Every N iterations (N ≥ 2)","每 N 次迭代（N ≥ 2）","Měi N cì diédài (N ≥ 2)"),
    HostMoaFailurePolicy("Failed-reference disclosure","参考模型失败的披露","Cānkǎo móxíng shībài de pīlù"),
    HostMoaLoud("Disclose failed references","披露失败的参考模型","Pīlù shībài de cānkǎo móxíng"),
    HostMoaSilent("Suppress failed-reference disclosure","不披露参考模型失败","Bù pīlù cānkǎo móxíng shībài"),
    HostMoaReasoningDefault("No preset reasoning override","无预设推理覆盖值","Wú yùshè tuīlǐ fùgài zhí"),
    HostMoaAggClearUnsupported("Hermes merges surviving aggregator fields and cannot clear an existing reasoning override through this endpoint. Choose a canonical level or edit it in Hermes.","Hermes 会合并保留的聚合模型字段，此端点无法清除现有推理覆盖值。请选择标准级别，或在 Hermes 中编辑。","Hermes huì hébìng bǎoliú de jùhé móxíng zìduàn, cǐ duāndiǎn wúfǎ qīngchú xiànyǒu tuīlǐ fùgài zhí. Qǐng xuǎnzé biāozhǔn jíbié, huò zài Hermes zhōng biānjí."),
    HostMoaUnrepresentable("A reported reasoning value cannot round-trip through this API. Editing is disabled to preserve it; correct it in Hermes and read again.","报告的推理值无法通过此 API 原样往返。为保留它，已禁用编辑；请在 Hermes 中修正后重新读取。","Bàogào de tuīlǐ zhí wúfǎ tōngguò cǐ API yuányàng wǎngfǎn. Wèi bǎoliú tā, yǐ jìnyòng biānjí; qǐng zài Hermes zhōng xiūzhèng hòu chóngxīn dúqǔ."),
    HostMoaRecursive("MoA cannot be nested inside a preset.","预设内不能嵌套 MoA。","Yùshè nèi bù néng qiàntào MoA."),
    HostMoaLimit("The supported preset/reference limit has been reached.","已达到支持的预设或参考模型数量上限。","Yǐ dádào zhīchí de yùshè huò cānkǎo móxíng shùliàng shàngxiàn."),
    HostMoaReview("Review full preset-map replacement","审阅完整预设映射替换","Shěnyuè wánzhěng yùshè yìngshè tìhuàn"),
    HostMoaAdded("Added preset names","新增预设名称","Xīnzēng yùshè míngchēng"),
    HostMoaRemoved("Removed preset names","移除的预设名称","Yíchú de yùshè míngchēng"),
    HostMoaChanged("Changed preset names","更改的预设名称","Gēnggǎi de yùshè míngchēng"),
    HostMoaEffect("Replaces the complete named preset map for this profile: omitted names are deleted. Saving may persist reported defaults that repaired invalid stored values. Hermes merges surviving preset and aggregator dictionaries but replaces reference lists; hidden reference-slot extensions can be lost. A duplicate contains only reported supported fields. More references, frequent cadence, timeout and reasoning choices can increase provider calls, cost and data sharing. This save has no model-selection warning guard or inference/credential test.","替换此配置的完整命名预设映射：省略的名称会被删除。保存可能写入修复无效存储值后报告的默认值。Hermes 会合并保留的预设和聚合模型字典，但会替换参考模型列表；隐藏的参考槽位扩展可能丢失。副本只包含报告的受支持字段。更多参考模型、更频繁的调用、超时及推理选择可能增加提供方调用、费用和数据共享。此保存没有模型选择警告防护，也不测试推理或凭据。","Tìhuàn cǐ pèizhì de wánzhěng mìngmíng yùshè yìngshè: shěnglüè de míngchēng huì bèi shānchú. Bǎocún kěnéng xiěrù xiūfù wúxiào cúnchǔ zhí hòu bàogào de mòrèn zhí. Hermes huì hébìng bǎoliú de yùshè hé jùhé móxíng zìdiǎn, dàn huì tìhuàn cānkǎo móxíng lièbiǎo; yǐncáng de cānkǎo cáowèi kuòzhǎn kěnéng diūshī. Fùběn zhǐ bāohán bàogào de shòu zhīchí zìduàn. Gèng duō cānkǎo móxíng, gèng pínfán de diàoyòng, chāoshí jí tuīlǐ xuǎnzé kěnéng zēngjiā tígōng fāng diàoyòng, fèiyòng hé shùjù gòngxiǎng. Cǐ bǎocún méiyǒu móxíng xuǎnzé jǐnggào fánghù, yě bù cèshì tuīlǐ huò píngjù."),
    HostMoaConcurrency("Fresh reads check the normalized map and selected public catalog metadata. Hidden credentials/endpoints, raw-file repairs, host policy and later concurrent writers remain unverified; there is no revision guard. Null timeout inherits an uninspected host MoA-reference timeout. Running sessions and phone model choices are separate. Cancelling the phone wait cannot undo host work.","重新读取会检查规范化映射及所选目录的公开元数据。隐藏的凭据、端点、原始文件修复、主机策略和随后并发写入者仍未验证；没有修订版本防护。空超时值继承未检查的主机 MoA 参考模型超时。运行中的会话及手机模型选择是独立的。取消手机等待无法撤销主机工作。","Chóngxīn dúqǔ huì jiǎnchá guīfànhuà yìngshè jí suǒ xuǎn mùlù de gōngkāi yuán shùjù. Yǐncáng de píngjù, duāndiǎn, yuánshǐ wénjiàn xiūfù, zhǔjī cèlüè hé suíhòu bìngfā xiěrù zhě réng wèi yànzhèng; méiyǒu xiūdìng bǎnběn fánghù. Kōng chāoshí zhí jìchéng wèi jiǎnchá de zhǔjī MoA cānkǎo móxíng chāoshí. Yùnxíng zhōng de huìhuà jí shǒujī móxíng xuǎnzé shì dúlì de. Qǔxiāo shǒujī děngdài wúfǎ chèxiāo zhǔjī gōngzuò."),
    HostMoaApprove("I approve this complete preset map, deletions and the effects above","我批准此完整预设映射、删除及上述影响","Wǒ pīzhǔn cǐ wánzhěng yùshè yìngshè, shānchú jí shàngshù yǐngxiǎng"),
    HostMoaAcknowledged("Preset-map save acknowledged. Current configuration is shown separately from runtime adoption.","预设映射保存已确认。当前配置与运行时采用情况单独显示。","Yùshè yìngshè bǎocún yǐ quèrèn. Dāngqián pèizhì yǔ yùnxíng shí cǎiyòng qíngkuàng dāndú xiǎnshì."),
    HostMoaNormalized("Hermes acknowledged a different normalized preset map. Review the reported configuration before using it.","Hermes 确认了不同的规范化预设映射。使用前请审阅报告的配置。","Hermes quèrèn le bùtóng de guīfànhuà yùshè yìngshè. Shǐyòng qián qǐng shěnyuè bàogào de pèizhì."),
    HostMoaRequestedHash("Requested public configuration fingerprint","请求的公开配置指纹","Qǐngqiú de gōngkāi pèizhì zhǐwén"),
    HostMoaReportedHash("Host-reported public configuration fingerprint","主机报告的公开配置指纹","Zhǔjī bàogào de gōngkāi pèizhì zhǐwén"),
    HostMoaReceipt("Receipts retain public configuration fingerprints, selectors and changed-name lists, not full maps or private metadata. Acknowledgement/readback does not prove exact disk contents, preservation of unknown fields, causality, provider health or running-session adoption. Observe through a new preset read review; unknown saves are never replayed automatically.","回执保留公开配置指纹、选择项及更改名称列表，不保留完整映射或私密元数据。确认或回读不证明确切磁盘内容、未知字段的保留、因果关系、提供方健康状况或运行中会话的采用情况。请通过新的预设读取审阅查看；结果未知的保存不会自动重放。","Huízhí bǎoliú gōngkāi pèizhì zhǐwén, xuǎnzé xiàng jí gēnggǎi míngchēng lièbiǎo, bù bǎoliú wánzhěng yìngshè huò sīmì yuán shùjù. Quèrèn huò huídú bù zhèngmíng quèqiè cípán nèiróng, wèizhī zìduàn de bǎoliú, yīnguǒ guānxì, tígōng fāng jiànkāng zhuàngkuàng huò yùnxíng zhōng huìhuà de cǎiyòng qíngkuàng. Qǐng tōngguò xīn de yùshè dúqǔ shěnyuè chákàn; jiéguǒ wèizhī de bǎocún bú huì zìdòng chóngfàng."),
    HostAuxMinimal("Minimal","最低","Zuì dī"),
    HostAuxLow("Low","低","Dī"),
    HostAuxMedium("Medium","中","Zhōng"),
    HostAuxHigh("High","高","Gāo"),
    HostAuxXhigh("Extra high","很高","Hěn gāo"),
    HostAuxMax("Maximum","最大","Zuì dà"),
    HostAuxUltra("Ultra","超高","Chāo gāo"),
    HostAuxEdit("Edit auxiliary assignment","编辑辅助任务分配","Biānjí fǔzhù rènwù fēnpèi"),
    HostAuxReview("Review auxiliary assignment","审阅辅助任务分配","Shěnyuè fǔzhù rènwù fēnpèi"),
    HostAuxAll("Assign all current auxiliary slots","分配所有当前辅助任务槽位","Fēnpèi suǒyǒu dāngqián fǔzhù rènwù cáowèi"),
    HostAuxReset("Reset all auxiliary assignments","重置所有辅助任务分配","Chóngzhì suǒyǒu fǔzhù rènwù fēnpèi"),
    HostAuxAuto("Use auto routing","使用自动路由","Shǐyòng zìdòng lùyóu"),
    HostAuxKeep("Keep reasoning unchanged","保持推理设置不变","Bǎochí tuīlǐ shèzhì bú biàn"),
    HostAuxInherit("Clear reasoning override / inherit","清除推理覆盖值／继承","Qīngchú tuīlǐ fùgài zhí / jìchéng"),
    HostAuxNone("Disable reasoning (none)","禁用推理（none）","Jìnyòng tuīlǐ (none)"),
    HostAuxRouteEffect("Saves provider/model settings for the selected slots. Keeping the same provider, or selecting bare custom, can retain existing endpoint and credential overrides. Switching to another provider clears those overrides. Auto routing alone is not a complete reset. No endpoint address or secret is sent by the phone. Hermes may contact metadata services for selection warnings.","保存所选槽位的提供方和模型设置。保持同一提供方或选择裸 custom 值可能保留现有端点及凭据覆盖值。切换到其他提供方会清除这些覆盖值。仅自动路由并非完整重置。手机不会发送端点地址或密钥。Hermes 可能联系元数据服务以获取选择警告。","Bǎocún suǒ xuǎn cáowèi de tígōng fāng hé móxíng shèzhì. Bǎochí tóng yī tígōng fāng huò xuǎnzé luǒ custom zhí kěnéng bǎoliú xiànyǒu duāndiǎn jí píngjù fùgài zhí. Qiēhuàn dào qítā tígōng fāng huì qīngchú zhèxiē fùgài zhí. Jǐn zìdòng lùyóu bìng fēi wánzhěng chóngzhì. Shǒujī bú huì fāsòng duāndiǎn dìzhǐ huò mìyuè. Hermes kěnéng liánxì yuán shùjù fúwù yǐ huòqǔ xuǎnzé jǐnggào."),
    HostAuxReasoningEffect("Keep omits reasoning from the request. Inherit explicitly clears the override; disabling sends none. Reset restores shipped defaults, including voice reasoning disabled. Provider support and plugin inheritance can change the effective behavior.","保持不变会在请求中省略推理字段。继承会明确清除覆盖值；禁用会发送 none。重置会恢复内置默认值，包括禁用语音推理。提供方支持及插件继承可能改变实际行为。","Bǎochí bú biàn huì zài qǐngqiú zhōng shěnglüè tuīlǐ zìduàn. Jìchéng huì míngquè qīngchú fùgài zhí; jìnyòng huì fāsòng none. Chóngzhì huì huīfù nèizhì mòrèn zhí, bāokuò jìnyòng yǔyīn tuīlǐ. Tígōng fāng zhīchí jí chājiàn jìchéng kěnéng gǎibiàn shíjì xíngwéi."),
    HostAuxResetEffect("Resets every current dashboard auxiliary slot to auto with an empty model; removes reasoning, endpoint, inline credentials, credential-variable pointers and API-mode overrides. Other task settings remain. Built-in defaults and plugin inheritance can take effect again.","将所有当前仪表板辅助任务槽位重置为 auto 和空模型；移除推理、端点、内联凭据、凭据变量引用及 API 模式覆盖值。其他任务设置保留。内置默认值和插件继承可能再次生效。","Jiāng suǒyǒu dāngqián yíbiǎobǎn fǔzhù rènwù cáowèi chóngzhì wéi auto hé kōng móxíng; yíchú tuīlǐ, duāndiǎn, nèilián píngjù, píngjù biànliàng yǐnyòng jí API móshì fùgài zhí. Qítā rènwù shèzhì bǎoliú. Nèizhì mòrèn zhí hé chājiàn jìchéng kěnéng zàicì shēngxiào."),
    HostAuxBulkEffect("All-slot operations include the host current registered slots, including plugins added after this review. The displayed list is a snapshot. Slots outside the dashboard assignment API are unaffected.","所有槽位操作涵盖主机当前注册的槽位，包括此次审阅后添加的插件。此列表是快照。仪表板分配 API 之外的槽位不受影响。","Suǒyǒu cáowèi cāozuò hángài zhǔjī dāngqián zhùcè de cáowèi, bāokuò cǐ cì shěnyuè hòu tiānjiā de chājiàn. Cǐ lièbiǎo shì kuàizhào. Yíbiǎobǎn fēnpèi API zhīwài de cáowèi bú shòu yǐngxiǎng."),
    HostAuxConcurrency("Preflight and readback can probe the current custom endpoint, contact provider metadata or usage services, warm caches and persist discovered model lists. Visible configuration is checked, but hidden endpoint/credential changes and concurrent writers can remain undetected. Host policy can override saved settings. Running calls may keep a frozen configuration. Cancelling the phone wait cannot undo host saves, probes or cache work.","预检和回读可能探测当前自定义端点、联系提供方元数据或用量服务、预热缓存并保存发现的模型列表。会检查可见配置，但隐藏的端点或凭据变更及并发写入者可能无法发现。主机策略可能覆盖保存的设置。运行中的调用可能保留冻结配置。取消手机等待无法撤销主机保存、探测或缓存工作。","Yùjiǎn hé huídú kěnéng tàncè dāngqián zìdìngyì duāndiǎn, liánxì tígōng fāng yuán shùjù huò yòngliàng fúwù, yùrè huǎncún bìng bǎocún fāxiàn de móxíng lièbiǎo. Huì jiǎnchá kějiàn pèizhì, dàn yǐncáng de duāndiǎn huò píngjù biàngēng jí bìngfā xiěrù zhě kěnéng wúfǎ fāxiàn. Zhǔjī cèlüè kěnéng fùgài bǎocún de shèzhì. Yùnxíng zhōng de diàoyòng kěnéng bǎoliú dòngjié pèizhì. Qǔxiāo shǒujī děngdài wúfǎ chèxiāo zhǔjī bǎocún, tàncè huò huǎncún gōngzuò."),
    HostAuxApprove("I approve these auxiliary changes and the effects above","我批准这些辅助任务更改及上述影响","Wǒ pīzhǔn zhèxiē fǔzhù rènwù gēnggǎi jí shàngshù yǐngxiǎng"),
    HostAuxAcknowledged("Auxiliary assignment acknowledged. Current reported configuration is separate from runtime adoption and credential health.","辅助任务分配已确认。当前报告的配置与运行时采用及凭据健康状况是独立的。","Fǔzhù rènwù fēnpèi yǐ quèrèn. Dāngqián bàogào de pèizhì yǔ yùnxíng shí cǎiyòng jí píngjù jiànkāng zhuàngkuàng shì dúlì de."),
    HostAuxReportedTasks("Host-reported affected slots","主机报告的受影响槽位","Zhǔjī bàogào de shòu yǐngxiǎng cáowèi"),
    HostAuxReceipt("The receipt records the reviewed request and typed host acknowledgement or warning refusal. Reset does not report an exact affected list. Matching readback does not prove exact saved contents, secret removal, inheritance, causality or running-call adoption. Observe through a fresh model read review.","回执记录已审阅的请求及类型正确的主机确认或警告拒绝。重置不会报告确切受影响列表。匹配的回读不证明确切保存内容、密钥移除、继承、因果关系或运行中调用的采用情况。请通过新的模型读取审阅查看。","Huízhí jìlù yǐ shěnyuè de qǐngqiú jí lèixíng zhèngquè de zhǔjī quèrèn huò jǐnggào jùjué. Chóngzhì bú huì bàogào quèqiè shòu yǐngxiǎng lièbiǎo. Pǐpèi de huídú bù zhèngmíng quèqiè bǎocún nèiróng, mìyuè yíchú, jìchéng, yīnguǒ guānxì huò yùnxíng zhōng diàoyòng de cǎiyòng qíngkuàng. Qǐng tōngguò xīn de móxíng dúqǔ shěnyuè chákàn."),
    HostMainNormalized("Hermes reported a different normalized provider/model pair. Review the configured pair before using it for new sessions.","Hermes 报告了不同的规范化提供方与模型组合。用于新会话前，请审阅配置的组合。","Hermes bàogào le bùtóng de guīfànhuà tígōng fāng yǔ móxíng zǔhé. Yòng yú xīn huìhuà qián, qǐng shěnyuè pèizhì de zǔhé."),
    HostMainRequested("Requested selection","请求的选择","Qǐngqiú de xuǎnzé"),
    HostMainReported("Host-reported selection","主机报告的选择","Zhǔjī bàogào de xuǎnzé"),
    HostMainSet("Use as host main model","用作主机主模型","Yòng zuò zhǔjī zhǔ móxíng"),
    HostMainReview("Review main model assignment","审阅主模型分配","Shěnyuè zhǔ móxíng fēnpèi"),
    HostMainEffect("Changes this profile default for new sessions. Hermes can validate credentials, contact providers and start a managed local model runtime. It can normalize model/provider names, replace route and credential references, and clear a route-specific context pin. Selecting Nous can route unconfigured tools through its gateway. Existing auxiliary pins can remain.","更改此配置中新会话的默认模型。Hermes 可能验证凭据、联系提供方并启动托管的本地模型运行时。它可能规范化模型或提供方名称、替换路由及凭据引用，并清除特定路由的上下文固定值。选择 Nous 可能将未配置的工具路由到其网关。现有辅助任务固定值可能保留。","Gēnggǎi cǐ pèizhì zhōng xīn huìhuà de mòrèn móxíng. Hermes kěnéng yànzhèng píngjù, liánxì tígōng fāng bìng qǐdòng tuōguǎn de běndì móxíng yùnxíng shí. Tā kěnéng guīfànhuà móxíng huò tígōng fāng míngchēng, tìhuàn lùyóu jí píngjù yǐnyòng, bìng qīngchú tèdìng lùyóu de shàngxiàwén gùdìng zhí. Xuǎnzé Nous kěnéng jiāng wèi pèizhì de gōngjù lùyóu dào qí wǎngguān. Xiànyǒu fǔzhù rènwù gùdìng zhí kěnéng bǎoliú."),
    HostMainConcurrency("Preflight checks visible metadata. Endpoint or credential changes behind the same names can remain undetected, and other writers can race this save. Running sessions keep their separate runtime choices. Cancelling the phone wait cannot undo host work.","预检会检查可见元数据。同名背后的端点或凭据变更可能无法发现，其他写入者可能与此次保存并发。运行中的会话保留各自的运行时选择。取消手机等待无法撤销主机工作。","Yùjiǎn huì jiǎnchá kějiàn yuán shùjù. Tóngmíng bèihòu de duāndiǎn huò píngjù biàngēng kěnéng wúfǎ fāxiàn, qítā xiěrù zhě kěnéng yǔ cǐ cì bǎocún bìngfā. Yùnxíng zhōng de huìhuà bǎoliú gèzì de yùnxíng shí xuǎnzé. Qǔxiāo shǒujī děngdài wúfǎ chèxiāo zhǔjī gōngzuò."),
    HostMainApprove("I approve this profile assignment and the effects above","我批准此配置分配及上述影响","Wǒ pīzhǔn cǐ pèizhì fēnpèi jí shàngshù yǐngxiǎng"),
    HostMainWarningTitle("Review host selection warning","审阅主机选择警告","Shěnyuè zhǔjī xuǎnzé jǐnggào"),
    HostMainWarningRequired("The host requested selection-warning approval before applying this assignment.","主机要求在应用此分配前批准选择警告。","Zhǔjī yāoqiú zài yìngyòng cǐ fēnpèi qián pīzhǔn xuǎnzé jǐnggào."),
    HostMainWarningEffect("This report can cover price or data-training terms. Confirming approves the displayed warning and sends one new, explicitly reviewed assignment with the selection-warning override. Hermes does not bind that override to a warning revision; changed terms may need another review.","此报告可能涉及价格或数据训练条款。确认即批准显示的警告，并发送一次明确审阅的新分配，覆盖选择警告。Hermes 不会将此覆盖绑定到警告修订版本；条款变化可能需要重新审阅。","Cǐ bàogào kěnéng shèjí jiàgé huò shùjù xùnliàn tiáokuǎn. Quèrèn jí pīzhǔn xiǎnshì de jǐnggào, bìng fāsòng yí cì míngquè shěnyuè de xīn fēnpèi, fùgài xuǎnzé jǐnggào. Hermes bú huì jiāng cǐ fùgài bǎngdìng dào jǐnggào xiūdìng bǎnběn; tiáokuǎn biànhuà kěnéng xūyào chóngxīn shěnyuè."),
    HostMainWarningApprove("I approve the displayed host warning and the assignment effects above","我批准显示的主机警告及上述分配影响","Wǒ pīzhǔn xiǎnshì de zhǔjī jǐnggào jí shàngshù fēnpèi yǐngxiǎng"),
    HostMainAcknowledged("Host assignment acknowledged. Current reported configuration is shown separately; runtime and credential health remain unverified.","主机已确认分配。当前报告的配置单独显示；运行时与凭据健康状况仍未验证。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn fēnpèi. Dāngqián bàogào de pèizhì dāndú xiǎnshì; yùnxíng shí yǔ píngjù jiànkāng zhuàngkuàng réng wèi yànzhèng."),
    HostMainProviderUnready("This provider is not reported authenticated. Configure it in Hermes and read the catalog again.","此提供方未报告已认证。请在 Hermes 中配置后重新读取目录。","Cǐ tígōng fāng wèi bàogào yǐ rènzhèng. Qǐng zài Hermes zhōng pèizhì hòu chóngxīn dúqǔ mùlù."),
    HostMainHostNotice("Host post-assignment notice","主机分配后的提示","Zhǔjī fēnpèi hòu de tíshì"),
    HostMainReceipt("The receipt records the requested and host-normalized pair, or a known warning refusal. It does not verify endpoint identity, credential validity, exact saved contents, causality or running-session adoption. Observe current configuration through a fresh read review.","回执记录请求及主机规范化后的组合，或已知警告拒绝。它不验证端点身份、凭据有效性、确切保存内容、因果关系或运行中会话的采用情况。请通过新的读取审阅查看当前配置。","Huízhí jìlù qǐngqiú jí zhǔjī guīfànhuà hòu de zǔhé, huò yǐzhī jǐnggào jùjué. Tā bù yànzhèng duāndiǎn shēnfèn, píngjù yǒuxiào xìng, quèqiè bǎocún nèiróng, yīnguǒ guānxì huò yùnxíng zhōng huìhuà de cǎiyòng qíngkuàng. Qǐng tōngguò xīn de dúqǔ shěnyuè chákàn dāngqián pèizhì."),
    HostModels("Host models and providers","主机模型与提供方","Zhǔjī móxíng yǔ tígōng fāng"),
    HostModelsRead("Read model configuration","读取模型配置","Dúqǔ móxíng pèizhì"),
    HostModelsRefresh("Refresh provider catalogs","刷新提供方目录","Shuāxīn tígōng fāng mùlù"),
    HostModelsBoundary("Host defaults and auxiliary tasks belong to this management profile. Phone chat selections and running sessions are separate.","主机默认模型和辅助任务属于此管理配置。手机聊天选择和运行中的会话是独立的。","Zhǔjī mòrèn móxíng hé fǔzhù rènwù shǔyú cǐ guǎnlǐ pèizhì. Shǒujī liáotiān xuǎnzé hé yùnxíng zhōng de huìhuà shì dúlì de."),
    HostModelsReadEffect("Reads reported main and auxiliary assignments, plugin task inheritance and provider catalogs for this profile. Hermes can probe the current custom endpoint, contact provider metadata or usage services, warm caches and persist discovered model lists. Secret values, endpoint addresses and raw warnings are discarded. Cancelling the phone wait cannot undo host probes or cache work. This does not test model execution or change assignments.","读取此配置报告的主模型、辅助任务、插件任务继承及提供方目录。Hermes 可能探测当前自定义端点，联系提供方元数据或用量服务，预热缓存并保存发现的模型列表。密钥值、端点地址和原始警告会被丢弃。取消手机等待无法撤销主机探测或缓存工作。这不会测试模型执行或更改分配。","Dúqǔ cǐ pèizhì bàogào de zhǔ móxíng, fǔzhù rènwù, chājiàn rènwù jìchéng jí tígōng fāng mùlù. Hermes kěnéng tàncè dāngqián zìdìngyì duāndiǎn, liánxì tígōng fāng yuán shùjù huò yòngliàng fúwù, yùrè huǎncún bìng bǎocún fāxiàn de móxíng lièbiǎo. Mìyuè zhí, duāndiǎn dìzhǐ hé yuánshǐ jǐnggào huì bèi diūqì. Qǔxiāo shǒujī děngdài wúfǎ chèxiāo zhǔjī tàncè huò huǎncún gōngzuò. Zhè bú huì cèshì móxíng zhíxíng huò gēnggǎi fēnpèi."),
    HostModelsRefreshEffect("Explicit refresh also clears model-list caches and can probe all saved custom endpoints. Provider failures may produce fallback catalog entries. Cancelling the phone wait cannot undo host probes or cache work.","明确刷新还会清除模型列表缓存，并可能探测所有保存的自定义端点。提供方失败时可能返回备用目录条目。取消手机等待无法撤销主机探测或缓存工作。","Míngquè shuāxīn hái huì qīngchú móxíng lièbiǎo huǎncún, bìng kěnéng tàncè suǒyǒu bǎocún de zìdìngyì duāndiǎn. Tígōng fāng shībài shí kěnéng fǎnhuí bèiyòng mùlù tiáomù. Qǔxiāo shǒujī děngdài wúfǎ chèxiāo zhǔjī tàncè huò huǎncún gōngzuò."),
    HostModelsSnapshot("Reported configuration and catalog snapshot; availability, authentication, price and runtime adoption remain unverified.","报告的配置与目录快照；可用性、认证、价格及运行时采用情况仍未验证。","Bàogào de pèizhì yǔ mùlù kuàizhào; kěyòng xìng, rènzhèng, jiàgé jí yùnxíng shí cǎiyòng qíngkuàng réng wèi yànzhèng."),
    HostModelsUnavailable("Model configuration is incomplete, inconsistent or unsupported. Review and read it again.","模型配置不完整、不一致或不受支持。请重新审阅并读取。","Móxíng pèizhì bù wánzhěng, bù yízhì huò bù shòu zhīchí. Qǐng chóngxīn shěnyuè bìng dúqǔ."),
    HostModelsMain("Configured main assignment","配置的主模型分配","Pèizhì de zhǔ móxíng fēnpèi"),
    HostModelsAuxiliary("Auxiliary task assignments","辅助任务分配","Fǔzhù rènwù fēnpèi"),
    HostModelsProviders("Reported providers","报告的提供方","Bàogào de tígōng fāng"),
    HostModelsFilter("Filter providers, models or tasks","筛选提供方、模型或任务","Shāixuǎn tígōng fāng, móxíng huò rènwù"),
    HostModelsReasoning("Reported reasoning effort","报告的推理强度","Bàogào de tuīlǐ qiángdù"),
    HostModelsInherited("Not reported; may inherit","未报告；可能继承","Wèi bàogào; kěnéng jìchéng"),
    HostModelsEndpoint("Custom endpoint configured; address hidden","已配置自定义端点；地址隐藏","Yǐ pèizhì zìdìngyì duāndiǎn; dìzhǐ yǐncáng"),
    HostModelsNoEndpoint("No reported endpoint override","未报告端点覆盖值","Wèi bàogào duāndiǎn fùgài zhí"),
    HostModelsLocal("Host reports a local endpoint","主机报告本地端点","Zhǔjī bàogào běndì duāndiǎn"),
    HostModelsInheritFrom("Inherits from task","继承自任务","Jìchéng zì rènwù"),
    HostModelsEffective("Reported effective inherited route","报告的有效继承路由","Bàogào de yǒuxiào jìchéng lùyóu"),
    HostModelsReportedAuth("Host authentication flag","主机认证标志","Zhǔjī rènzhèng biāozhì"),
    HostModelsAuthYes("Reported authenticated","报告已认证","Bàogào yǐ rènzhèng"),
    HostModelsAuthNo("Reported unauthenticated","报告未认证","Bàogào wèi rènzhèng"),
    HostModelsAuthUnknown("Not reported","未报告","Wèi bàogào"),
    HostModelsWarning("Host reported a warning; raw details are hidden","主机报告警告；原始详情隐藏","Zhǔjī bàogào jǐnggào; yuánshǐ xiángqíng yǐncáng"),
    HostModelsCatalog("Browse reported model IDs","浏览报告的模型标识","Liúlǎn bàogào de móxíng biāozhì"),
    HostModelsUnspecified("Not explicitly set","未明确设置","Wèi míngquè shèzhì"),
    HostEnvEmpty("Save an empty value","保存空值","Bǎocún kōng zhí"),
    HostEnvEmptyIntent("Explicitly store an empty string and keep this environment key","明确存储空字符串并保留此环境键","Míngquè cúnchǔ kōng zìfúchuàn bìng bǎoliú cǐ huánjìng jiàn"),
    HostEnvEmptyValue("Empty string: \"\"","空字符串：\"\"","Kōng zìfúchuàn: \"\""),
    HostEnvEmptyEffect("Stores an empty string in this profile environment and keeps the key. This route does not clear old value-matched credential mirrors for an empty replacement; existing pool credentials can remain, and environment-source suppression can be lifted. This is not credential removal or provider-side revocation. Reported absence cannot verify the exact empty value or runtime behavior.","在此配置环境中存储空字符串并保留键。空值替换时，此接口不会清除匹配旧值的凭据副本；现有凭据池条目可能保留，并可能解除环境来源的禁用。这不是凭据移除或提供方撤销。报告不存在无法验证确切空值或运行时行为。","Zài cǐ pèizhì huánjìng zhōng cúnchǔ kōng zìfúchuàn bìng bǎoliú jiàn. Kōng zhí tìhuàn shí, cǐ jiēkǒu bú huì qīngchú pǐpèi jiù zhí de píngjù fùběn; xiànyǒu píngjù chí tiáomù kěnéng bǎoliú, bìng kěnéng jiěchú huánjìng láiyuán de jìnyòng. Zhè bú shì píngjù yíchú huò tígōng fāng chèxiāo. Bàogào bù cúnzài wúfǎ yànzhèng quèqiè kōng zhí huò yùnxíng shí xíngwéi."),
    ChannelsReceiptAck("The host acknowledged this save. The receipt alone does not prove readback or a working connection.","主机已确认此次保存。仅凭此记录不能证明回读成功或连接可用。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn cǐ cì bǎocún. Jǐn píng cǐ jìlù bùnéng zhèngmíng huídú chénggōng huò liánjiē kěyòng."),
    ChannelsDocsFailed("No browser could open these docs.","没有浏览器能够打开此文档。","Méiyǒu liúlǎnqì nénggòu dǎkāi cǐ wéndàng."),
    ChannelsHomePlatform("Platform","平台","Píngtái"),
    ChannelsHomeChat("Chat or channel ID","聊天或频道标识","Liáotiān huò píndào biāozhì"),
    ChannelsHomeName("Destination name","目的地名称","Mùdìdì míngchēng"),
    ChannelsHomeThread("Thread or topic ID","讨论串或话题标识","Tǎolùn chuàn huò huàtí biāozhì"),
    ChannelsHomeUser("User identity","用户身份","Yònghù shēnfèn"),
    ChannelsHomeScope("Account scope","账户范围","Zhànghù fànwéi"),
    Channels("Channels","消息渠道","Xiāoxi qúdào"),
    ChannelsRead("Read channel settings","读取渠道设置","Dúqǔ qúdào shèzhì"),
    ChannelsPrivacy("Read the selected profile’s channel catalog, setup metadata, private allowlists and reported gateway state. Host plugins and credential sources may be consulted. Stored secrets, host paths and commands are discarded.","读取所选配置的渠道目录、设置元数据、私密允许列表和网关报告状态。主机可能查询插件和凭据源。应用丢弃已有密钥、主机路径和命令。","Dúqǔ suǒ xuǎn pèizhì de qúdào mùlù, shèzhì yuán shùjù, sīmì yǔnxǔ lièbiǎo hé wǎngguān bàogào zhuàngtài. Zhǔjī kěnéng cháxún chājiàn hé píngjù yuán. Yìngyòng diūqì yǐyǒu mìyuè, zhǔjī lùjìng hé mìnglìng."),
    ChannelsUnavailable("This host did not provide a complete supported channel catalog.","此主机未提供完整且受支持的渠道目录。","Cǐ zhǔjī wèi tígōng wánzhěng qiě shòu zhīchí de qúdào mùlù."),
    ChannelsEdit("Edit channel settings","编辑渠道设置","Biānjí qúdào shèzhì"),
    ChannelsSave("Save channel settings","保存渠道设置","Bǎocún qúdào shèzhì"),
    ChannelsSaveEffect("Save only the reviewed fields and enablement choice. Changes can alter who can reach the agent and interrupt connected clients. Clearing removes the host environment entry; other secret sources can remain. Shared variables can affect other consumers. The host may rebuild live channel adapters. This does not revoke vendor credentials or stop running work.","仅保存已审阅的字段和启用选项。修改可能改变谁能访问代理，并中断已连接的客户端。清除会删除主机环境条目，其他密钥源可能仍存在。共享变量可影响其他使用方。主机可能重建运行中的渠道适配器。这不会撤销服务商凭据或停止正在运行的任务。","Jǐn bǎocún yǐ shěnyuè de zìduàn hé qǐyòng xuǎnxiàng. Xiūgǎi kěnéng gǎibiàn shéi néng fǎngwèn dàilǐ, bìng zhōngduàn yǐ liánjiē de kèhùduān. Qīngchú huì shānchú zhǔjī huánjìng tiáomù, qítā mìyuè yuán kěnéng réng cúnzài. Gòngxiǎng biànliàng kě yǐngxiǎng qítā shǐyòng fāng. Zhǔjī kěnéng chóngjiàn yùnxíng zhōng de qúdào shìpèiqì. Zhè bú huì chèxiāo fúwùshāng píngjù huò tíngzhǐ zhèngzài yùnxíng de rènwù."),
    ChannelsPosture("Check reported connection and access","检查报告的连接与访问状态","Jiǎnchá bàogào de liánjiē yǔ fǎngwèn zhuàngtài"),
    ChannelsPostureEffect("Ask the host for its current setup, gateway and authorization report. This does not make a new vendor connection or send a message. A positive report does not prove delivery or access for a particular account.","向主机查询当前设置、网关和授权报告。此操作不会新建服务商连接或发送消息。正面报告并不证明能送达消息或某个账户拥有访问权限。","Xiàng zhǔjī cháxún dāngqián shèzhì, wǎngguān hé shòuquán bàogào. Cǐ cāozuò bú huì xīnjiàn fúwùshāng liánjiē huò fāsòng xiāoxi. Zhèngmiàn bàogào bìng bù zhèngmíng néng sòngdá xiāoxi huò mǒu gè zhànghù yōngyǒu fǎngwèn quánxiàn."),
    ChannelsReported("Host report acknowledged","已确认主机报告","Yǐ quèrèn zhǔjī bàogào"),
    ChannelsAcknowledged("Channel save acknowledged; reported settings observed. Exact credential values and live operation remain unverified.","渠道保存已确认，并已观察报告的设置。具体凭据值和实时运行情况仍未验证。","Qúdào bǎocún yǐ quèrèn, bìng yǐ guānchá bàogào de shèzhì. Jùtǐ píngjù zhí hé shíshí yùnxíng qíngkuàng réng wèi yànzhèng."),
    ChannelsDifferent("The host acknowledged the save, but its reported settings differ. Review the host before making another change.","主机已确认保存，但报告的设置不同。再次修改前请检查主机。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn bǎocún, dàn bàogào de shèzhì bùtóng. Zàicì xiūgǎi qián qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    ChannelsHotServed("The host reports that a running multiplexer was notified to rebuild adapters. This does not prove a working connection.","主机报告已通知运行中的多路复用网关重建适配器。这并不证明连接可用。","Zhǔjī bàogào yǐ tōngzhī yùnxíng zhōng de duōlù fùyòng wǎngguān chóngjiàn shìpèiqì. Zhè bìng bù zhèngmíng liánjiē kěyòng."),
    ChannelsConcurrency("Preflight compares the profile home, declared fields, presence and visible allowlists. It cannot detect a hidden secret rotation or prevent a change after the check. Accepted saves remain acknowledged if later readback fails.","预检比较配置主目录、声明的字段、是否已设置及可见允许列表。它无法检测隐藏密钥轮换，也无法阻止检查后的修改。之后读取失败时，已接受的保存仍保留确认状态。","Yùjiǎn bǐjiào pèizhì zhǔ mùlù, shēngmíng de zìduàn, shìfǒu yǐ shèzhì jí kějiàn yǔnxǔ lièbiǎo. Tā wúfǎ jiǎncè yǐncáng mìyuè lúnhuàn, yě wúfǎ zǔzhǐ jiǎnchá hòu de xiūgǎi. Zhīhòu dúqǔ shībài shí, yǐ jiēshòu de bǎocún réng bǎoliú quèrèn zhuàngtài."),
    ChannelsPrivate("Channel identifiers, allowlists and entered values are private. Reveal them to review; stored credentials are never prefilled.","渠道标识、允许列表及输入值属于私密信息。显示后方可审阅；不会预填已有凭据。","Qúdào biāozhì, yǔnxǔ lièbiǎo jí shūrù zhí shǔyú sīmì xìnxī. Xiǎnshì hòu fāng kě shěnyuè; bú huì yù tián yǐyǒu píngjù."),
    ChannelsKeep("Keep","保留","Bǎoliú"),
    ChannelsReplace("Replace","替换","Tìhuàn"),
    ChannelsClear("Clear","清除","Qīngchú"),
    ChannelsEnableChoice("Channel enablement","渠道启用选项","Qúdào qǐyòng xuǎnxiàng"),
    ChannelsRequired("Required by this channel","此渠道要求填写","Cǐ qúdào yāoqiú tiánxiě"),
    ChannelsLimits("Changes stay in this draft until separately reviewed and approved. Replacement values must be nonblank and single line; use Clear to remove an entry.","在单独审阅并批准之前，修改仅保留在草稿中。替换值必须非空且为单行；删除条目请选择清除。","Zài dāndú shěnyuè bìng pīzhǔn zhīqián, xiūgǎi jǐn bǎoliú zài cǎogǎo zhōng. Tìhuàn zhí bìxū fēi kōng qiě wéi dān háng; shānchú tiáomù qǐng xuǎnzé qīngchú."),
    ChannelsInvalid("Choose a supported change and enter valid values. An unchanged enablement choice alone does not need a save.","请选择受支持的修改并输入有效值。仅选择未改变的启用状态无需保存。","Qǐng xuǎnzé shòu zhīchí de xiūgǎi bìng shūrù yǒuxiào zhí. Jǐn xuǎnzé wèi gǎibiàn de qǐyòng zhuàngtài wúxū bǎocún."),
    ChannelsUnsupported("This identifier, field or link cannot be used safely by this client.","此客户端无法安全使用此标识、字段或链接。","Cǐ kèhùduān wúfǎ ānquán shǐyòng cǐ biāozhì, zìduàn huò liànjiē."),
    ChannelsApprove("I approve this exact channel operation.","我批准此次具体渠道操作。","Wǒ pīzhǔn cǐ cì jùtǐ qúdào cāozuò."),
    ChannelsRelay("This host reports Team Gateway/shared-bot routing. Direct adapter enablement can be overridden at startup; account linking has a separate instance scope.","主机报告使用团队网关或共享机器人路由。直接适配器的启用设置可能在启动时被覆盖；账户关联属于独立的实例范围。","Zhǔjī bàogào shǐyòng tuánduì wǎngguān huò gòngxiǎng jīqìrén lùyóu. Zhíjiē shìpèiqì de qǐyòng shèzhì kěnéng zài qǐdòng shí bèi fùgài; zhànghù guānlián shǔyú dúlì de shílì fànwéi."),
    ChannelsHome("Reported default destination","报告的默认目的地","Bàogào de mòrèn mùdìdì"),
    ChannelsIngress("Reported incoming callback address","报告的传入回调地址","Bàogào de chuánrù huídiào dìzhǐ"),
    ChannelsDocs("Open these channel docs in the browser","在浏览器中打开此渠道文档","Zài liúlǎnqì zhōng dǎkāi cǐ qúdào wéndàng"),
    ChannelsReport("View private host report","查看私密主机报告","Chákàn sīmì zhǔjī bàogào"),
    ChannelsDetailsUnavailable("Optional private report details are unavailable; the host acknowledgement is retained.","可选私密报告详情不可用；主机确认仍被保留。","Kě xuǎn sīmì bàogào xiángqíng bù kěyòng; zhǔjī quèrèn réng bèi bǎoliú."),
    ChannelsHostPositive("The host reports a positive result.","主机报告正面结果。","Zhǔjī bàogào zhèngmiàn jiéguǒ."),
    ChannelsHostNegative("The host reports an incomplete or negative result.","主机报告未完成或负面结果。","Zhǔjī bàogào wèi wánchéng huò fùmiàn jiéguǒ."),
    ChannelsConnected("Host reports connected","主机报告已连接","Zhǔjī bàogào yǐ liánjiē"),
    ChannelsConfigured("Host reports setup complete","主机报告设置完整","Zhǔjī bàogào shèzhì wánzhěng"),
    ChannelsNeedsSetup("Setup needed","需要设置","Xūyào shèzhì"),
    ChannelsRestart("Host reports a restart is needed","主机报告需要重启","Zhǔjī bàogào xūyào chóngqǐ"),
    ChannelsStopped("Gateway reported stopped","网关报告已停止","Wǎngguān bàogào yǐ tíngzhǐ"),
    ChannelsFailed("Host reports a channel failure","主机报告渠道失败","Zhǔjī bàogào qúdào shībài"),
    ChannelsOtherState("Other host-reported state; reveal details","其他主机报告状态；请显示详情","Qítā zhǔjī bàogào zhuàngtài; qǐng xiǎnshì xiángqíng"),
    ChannelsErrorPresent("The host reported an error; raw error text is omitted.","主机报告了错误；原始错误文本已省略。","Zhǔjī bàogào le cuòwù; yuánshǐ cuòwù wénběn yǐ shěnglüè."),
    ChannelsGatewayRunning("Gateway reported running","网关报告正在运行","Wǎngguān bàogào zhèngzài yùnxíng"),
    HostEnvironment("Host keys and environment","主机密钥与环境","Zhǔjī mìyuè yǔ huánjìng"),
    HostEnvRead("Read key metadata","读取密钥元数据","Dúqǔ mìyuè yuán shùjù"),
    HostEnvPrivacy("Reads variable names, reported presence and provider/tool metadata for this profile. Existing values and masked previews are discarded; no secret reveal or provider probe is requested. Typed replacements are temporary and never saved in receipts.","读取此配置的变量名、报告的存在状态及提供方和工具元数据。现有值与掩码预览会被丢弃，不请求密钥显示或提供方探测。输入的替换值仅临时保存，绝不写入回执。","Dúqǔ cǐ pèizhì de biànliàng míng, bàogào de cúnzài zhuàngtài jí tígōng fāng hé gōngjù yuán shùjù. Xiànyǒu zhí yǔ yǎnmǎ yùlǎn huì bèi diūqì, bù qǐngqiú mìyuè xiǎnshì huò tígōng fāng tàncè. Shūrù de tìhuàn zhí jǐn línshí bǎocún, jué bù xiěrù huízhí."),
    HostEnvFilter("Filter names or providers","筛选名称或提供方","Shāixuǎn míngchēng huò tígōng fāng"),
    HostEnvAdd("Add a key","添加密钥","Tiānjiā mìyuè"),
    HostEnvKey("Environment variable name","环境变量名","Huánjìng biànliàng míng"),
    HostEnvSet("Reported present in profile environment","报告在配置环境中存在","Bàogào zài pèizhì huánjìng zhōng cúnzài"),
    HostEnvUnset("Not reported present in profile environment","未报告在配置环境中存在","Wèi bàogào zài pèizhì huánjìng zhōng cúnzài"),
    HostEnvSave("Save or replace value","保存或替换值","Bǎocún huò tìhuàn zhí"),
    HostEnvRemove("Remove credential references","移除凭据引用","Yíchú píngjù yǐnyòng"),
    HostEnvFreshValue("Enter the complete new ASCII value. Nothing is prefilled. Hermes strips non-ASCII characters and line breaks, so the phone refuses them before sending.","请输入完整的 ASCII 新值，不会预填。Hermes 会剥除非 ASCII 字符和换行，因此手机会在发送前拒绝这些内容。","Qǐng shūrù wánzhěng de ASCII xīn zhí, bú huì yù tián. Hermes huì bōchú fēi ASCII zìfú hé huànháng, yīncǐ shǒujī huì zài fāsòng qián jùjué zhèxiē nèiróng."),
    HostEnvInvalid("Use a valid variable name and a nonempty printable ASCII value up to 16384 characters. Known execution/policy names and display-only masks cannot be saved. The host also enforces its current managed and dynamic launch policy.","请使用有效变量名及不超过 16384 字符的非空可打印 ASCII 值。不能保存已知执行和策略变量名或仅供显示的掩码。主机还会执行当前受管理策略和动态启动策略。","Qǐng shǐyòng yǒuxiào biànliàng míng jí bù chāoguò 16384 zìfú de fēi kōng kě dǎyìn ASCII zhí. Bù néng bǎocún yǐ zhī zhíxíng hé cèlüè biànliàng míng huò jǐn gōng xiǎnshì de yǎnmǎ. Zhǔjī hái huì zhíxíng dāngqián shòu guǎnlǐ cèlüè hé dòngtài qǐdòng cèlüè."),
    HostEnvProtected("This name is not writable through this editor. Existing keys can be reviewed for removal; host policy still applies.","此编辑器不可写入该名称。可以检查移除已有键，仍须遵守主机策略。","Cǐ biānjíqì bù kě xiěrù gāi míngchēng. Kěyǐ jiǎnchá yíchú yǐ yǒu jiàn, réng xū zūnshǒu zhǔjī cèlüè."),
    HostEnvChannel("Channel-managed variable: shared channel setup may need additional configuration.","通道管理的变量：共享通道设置可能还需其他配置。","Tōngdào guǎnlǐ de biànliàng: gòngxiǎng tōngdào shèzhì kěnéng hái xū qítā pèizhì."),
    HostEnvReview("Review environment change","检查环境更改","Jiǎnchá huánjìng gēnggǎi"),
    HostEnvSaveEffect("Writes this profile environment value, reconciles value-matched configuration credential mirrors and may re-enable/materialize environment-backed credential pools. Every plugin, provider or channel using this variable can be affected. No provider validation or plugin reconnect is requested.","写入此配置的环境值，协调值匹配的配置凭据副本，并可能重新启用或生成环境凭据池。使用此变量的所有插件、提供方或通道都可能受影响。不请求提供方验证或插件重连。","Xiěrù cǐ pèizhì de huánjìng zhí, xiétiáo zhí pǐpèi de pèizhì píngjù fùběn, bìng kěnéng chóngxīn qǐyòng huò shēngchéng huánjìng píngjù chí. Shǐyòng cǐ biànliàng de suǒyǒu chājiàn, tígōng fāng huò tōngdào dōu kěnéng shòu yǐngxiǎng. Bù qǐngqiú tígōng fāng yànzhèng huò chājiàn chónglián."),
    HostEnvRemoveEffect("Removes the environment entry and its environment-backed pool/model-cache references and value-matched configuration mirrors. Other OAuth/device/manual credentials can remain. This does not revoke credentials at the provider or stop active work. Missing environment presence does not exclude other references.","移除环境条目、环境凭据池和模型缓存引用，以及值匹配的配置副本。其他 OAuth、设备和手动凭据可能保留。这不会撤销提供方凭据或停止正在进行的工作。环境中未显示存在不代表没有其他引用。","Yíchú huánjìng tiáomù, huánjìng píngjù chí hé móxíng huǎncún yǐnyòng, yǐjí zhí pǐpèi de pèizhì fùběn. Qítā OAuth, shèbèi hé shǒudòng píngjù kěnéng bǎoliú. Zhè bú huì chèxiāo tígōng fāng píngjù huò tíngzhǐ zhèngzài jìnxíng de gōngzuò. Huánjìng zhōng wèi xiǎnshì cúnzài bù dàibiǎo méiyǒu qítā yǐnyòng."),
    HostEnvConcurrency("Fresh identity, profile home and reported metadata are checked before one send. The server has no revision guard and presence cannot detect a concurrent secret rotation. A lost or interrupted reply is uncertain and is never automatically repeated.","单次发送前会检查最新身份、配置目录和报告的元数据。服务器没有版本保护，存在状态也无法检测并发密钥轮换。丢失或中断回复的结果不确定，绝不会自动重复。","Dāncì fāsòng qián huì jiǎnchá zuìxīn shēnfèn, pèizhì mùlù hé bàogào de yuán shùjù. Fúwùqì méiyǒu bǎnběn bǎohù, cúnzài zhuàngtài yě wúfǎ jiǎncè bìngfā mìyuè lúnhuàn. Diūshī huò zhōngduàn huífù de jiéguǒ bù quèdìng, jué bú huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    HostEnvApprove("Approve this one environment change","批准此次环境更改","Pīzhǔn cǐ cì huánjìng gēnggǎi"),
    HostEnvAcknowledged("Host acknowledged the environment change. Presence readback does not verify its exact value, provider validity, mirror cleanup or runtime adoption.","主机已确认环境更改。存在状态回读无法验证确切值、提供方有效性、副本清理或运行时采用。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn huánjìng gēnggǎi. Cúnzài zhuàngtài huídú wúfǎ yànzhèng quèqiè zhí, tígōng fāng yǒuxiàoxìng, fùběn qīnglǐ huò yùnxíng shí cǎiyòng."),
    HostEnvReceipt("Receipts retain the variable name, operation, prior presence and public outcome counts. Values, masks, value hashes and mirror paths are never retained. Observation opens a new metadata-read review without mutation or secret reveal.","回执保留变量名、操作、之前的存在状态及公开结果计数。绝不保留值、掩码、值哈希或副本路径。观察会打开新的元数据读取检查，不进行更改或显示密钥。","Huízhí bǎoliú biànliàng míng, cāozuò, zhīqián de cúnzài zhuàngtài jí gōngkāi jiéguǒ jìshù. Jué bù bǎoliú zhí, yǎnmǎ, zhí hāxī huò fùběn lùjìng. Guānchá huì dǎkāi xīn de yuán shùjù dúqǔ jiǎnchá, bù jìnxíng gēnggǎi huò xiǎnshì mìyuè."),
    HostEnvUnavailable("Host environment metadata or verified profile-home support is unavailable. Refresh management or inspect the host.","主机环境元数据或已验证的配置目录支持不可用。请刷新管理或检查主机。","Zhǔjī huánjìng yuán shùjù huò yǐ yànzhèng de pèizhì mùlù zhīchí bù kěyòng. Qǐng shuāxīn guǎnlǐ huò jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    PluginSettings("Plugin settings","插件设置","Chājiàn shèzhì"),
    PluginSettingsRead("Read plugin settings","读取插件设置","Dúqǔ chājiàn shèzhì"),
    PluginSettingsPrivacy("This reads private host-reported setting values into temporary app memory. Details are hidden until shown. Closing or changing context clears them. Declared secrets have presence only.","这会将主机报告的私有设置值读取到应用临时内存中。详情默认隐藏，关闭或切换上下文后清除。声明的密钥仅显示是否存在。","Zhè huì jiāng zhǔjī bàogào de sīyǒu shèzhì zhí dúqǔ dào yìngyòng línshí nèicún zhōng. Xiángqíng mòrèn yǐncáng, guānbì huò qiēhuàn shàngxiàwén hòu qīngchú. Shēngmíng de mìyuè jǐn xiǎnshì shìfǒu cúnzài."),
    PluginSettingsUnavailable("Settings are unavailable without a supported canonical plugin, bounded declared fields and verified profile home. Refresh or inspect the host.","没有受支持的规范插件、大小受限的声明字段和已验证的配置目录时，设置不可用。请刷新或检查主机。","Méiyǒu shòu zhīchí de guīfàn chājiàn, dàxiǎo shòu xiàn de shēngmíng zìduàn hé yǐ yànzhèng de pèizhì mùlù shí, shèzhì bù kěyòng. Qǐng shuāxīn huò jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    PluginSettingsEmpty("The host reports no declared settings.","主机未报告声明的设置。","Zhǔjī wèi bàogào shēngmíng de shèzhì."),
    PluginSettingsReported("Host-reported value","主机报告值","Zhǔjī bàogào zhí"),
    PluginSettingsDefault("Declared default","声明的默认值","Shēngmíng de mòrèn zhí"),
    PluginSettingsSecret("Declared secrets use the separate Host keys and environment review. They are never written as plugin settings.","声明的密钥使用单独的主机密钥与环境检查，绝不作为插件设置写入。","Shēngmíng de mìyuè shǐyòng dāndú de zhǔjī mìyuè yǔ huánjìng jiǎnchá, jué bù zuòwéi chājiàn shèzhì xiěrù."),
    PluginSettingsNested("This dotted key is written as a nested setting. The current host listing can report its default instead of its stored nested value, so the app cannot verify it by readback.","此点分键会写入嵌套设置。当前主机列表可能返回默认值而非已存储的嵌套值，因此应用无法通过回读验证。","Cǐ diǎn fēn jiàn huì xiěrù qiàntào shèzhì. Dāngqián zhǔjī lièbiǎo kěnéng fǎnhuí mòrèn zhí ér fēi yǐ cúnchǔ de qiàntào zhí, yīncǐ yìngyòng wúfǎ tōngguò huídú yànzhèng."),
    PluginSettingsEdit("Edit setting","编辑设置","Biānjí shèzhì"),
    PluginSettingsValue("New value","新值","Xīn zhí"),
    PluginSettingsRequired("Declared required by this plugin","此插件声明为必填项","Cǐ chājiàn shēngmíng wéi bì tián xiàng"),
    PluginSettingsInvalid("Enter the declared type: text, a finite number, true/false, a listed choice, or a JSON object/array. Null and secret values cannot be saved here.","请输入声明的类型：文本、有限数字、true/false、列出的选项或 JSON 对象/数组。此处不能保存 null 或密钥值。","Qǐng shūrù shēngmíng de lèixíng: wénběn, yǒuxiàn shùzì, true/false, liè chū de xuǎnxiàng huò JSON duìxiàng/shùzǔ. Cǐchù bù néng bǎocún null huò mìyuè zhí."),
    PluginSettingsReview("Review setting change","检查设置更改","Jiǎnchá shèzhì gēnggǎi"),
    PluginSettingsEffect("Saves one declared non-secret value on this host profile. Hermes enforces managed-key policy, notifies plugin listeners and may reconnect affected MCP servers or start their processes. A save does not prove runtime adoption or health.","在此主机配置中保存一个声明的非密钥值。Hermes 会执行受管理键策略、通知插件监听器，并可能重连受影响的 MCP 服务或启动其进程。保存不代表运行时已采用或健康。","Zài cǐ zhǔjī pèizhì zhōng bǎocún yí gè shēngmíng de fēi mìyuè zhí. Hermes huì zhíxíng shòu guǎnlǐ jiàn cèlüè, tōngzhī chājiàn jiāntīngqì, bìng kěnéng chónglián shòu yǐngxiǎng de MCP fúwù huò qǐdòng qí jìnchéng. Bǎocún bù dàibiǎo yùnxíng shí yǐ cǎiyòng huò jiànkāng."),
    PluginSettingsLimit("The app checks fresh metadata and reported settings before sending once. The server has no revision guard; concurrent host edits can still change the target or overwrite this value. A lost reply is uncertain and is never automatically repeated.","应用会在单次发送前检查最新元数据和报告的设置。服务器没有版本保护，并发主机编辑仍可能改变目标或覆盖此值。丢失回复的结果不确定，绝不会自动重复。","Yìngyòng huì zài dāncì fāsòng qián jiǎnchá zuìxīn yuán shùjù hé bàogào de shèzhì. Fúwùqì méiyǒu bǎnběn bǎohù, bìngfā zhǔjī biānjí réng kěnéng gǎibiàn mùbiāo huò fùgài cǐ zhí. Diūshī huífù de jiéguǒ bù quèdìng, jué bú huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    PluginSettingsApprove("Approve saving this displayed value once","批准单次保存此显示值","Pīzhǔn dāncì bǎocún cǐ xiǎnshì zhí"),
    PluginSettingsSaved("Host acknowledged the setting save. Readback and runtime adoption are separate.","主机已确认保存设置。回读与运行时采用是独立结果。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn bǎocún shèzhì. Huídú yǔ yùnxíng shí cǎiyòng shì dúlì jiéguǒ."),
    PluginSettingsObservation("Receipts retain the key/type and outcome, never setting values or hashes. Read current configuration opens a separate plugin review; reading settings then requires its own review.","回执保留键、类型和结果，绝不保留设置值或其哈希。读取当前配置会打开单独的插件检查，随后读取设置还需另行检查。","Huízhí bǎoliú jiàn, lèixíng hé jiéguǒ, jué bù bǎoliú shèzhì zhí huò qí hāxī. Dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì huì dǎkāi dāndú de chājiàn jiǎnchá, suíhòu dúqǔ shèzhì hái xū lìngxíng jiǎnchá."),
    ReviewSharedImages("Review shared images","检查共享图片","Jiǎnchá gòngxiǎng túpiàn"),
    InvalidImageShare("Share up to three images using temporary content-URI access. This share cannot be imported.","请通过临时内容 URI 访问权限共享最多三张图片。无法导入此次共享。","Qǐng tōngguò línshí nèiróng URI fǎngwèn quánxiàn gòngxiǎng zuì duō sān zhāng túpiàn. Wúfǎ dǎorù cǐ cì gòngxiǎng."),
    SharedImageInfo("These images replace the image selection in the current draft. Shared text is appended. Sending remains a separate action.","这些图片将替换当前草稿中的图片选择。共享文字会追加到草稿中。发送仍需单独操作。","Zhèxiē túpiàn jiāng tìhuàn dāngqián cǎogǎo zhōng de túpiàn xuǎnzé. Gòngxiǎng wénzì huì zhuījiā dào cǎogǎo zhōng. Fāsòng réng xū dāndú cāozuò."),
    SharedCaption("Shared text","共享文字","Gòngxiǎng wénzì"),
    WaitForImageTarget("Finish the current operation before importing these images.","请先完成当前操作，再导入这些图片。","Qǐng xiān wánchéng dāngqián cāozuò, zài dǎorù zhèxiē túpiàn."),
    UseSharedImages("Use images in this draft","在此草稿中使用图片","Zài cǐ cǎogǎo zhōng shǐyòng túpiàn"),
    ChooseImages("Choose images","选择图片","Xuǎnzé túpiàn"),
    ImageMessage("Image message","图片消息","Túpiàn xiāoxi"),
    RemoveImage("Remove image","移除图片","Yíchú túpiàn"),
    LoadingImages("Preparing private image previews…","正在准备私有图片预览…","Zhèngzài zhǔnbèi sīyǒu túpiàn yùlǎn…"),
    ImageContextChanged("The connection or conversation changed. Choose the images again for the current draft.","连接或对话已更改。请为当前草稿重新选择图片。","Liánjiē huò duìhuà yǐ gēnggǎi. Qǐng wèi dāngqián cǎogǎo chóngxīn xuǎnzé túpiàn."),
    ImageInputLimit("Choose at most three images.","最多选择三张图片。","Zuì duō xuǎnzé sān zhāng túpiàn."),
    ImageImportFailed("Images could not be prepared. Choose up to three raster images under 8 MB each, and check that access is still available.","无法准备图片。请选择最多三张、每张小于 8 MB 的位图，并检查是否仍有访问权限。","Wúfǎ zhǔnbèi túpiàn. Qǐng xuǎnzé zuì duō sān zhāng, měi zhāng xiǎo yú 8 MB de wèitú, bìng jiǎnchá shìfǒu réng yǒu fǎngwèn quánxiàn."),
    ImagePickerUnavailable("No compatible photo or document picker is available on this device.","本机上没有兼容的照片或文档选择器。","Běnjī shàng méiyǒu jiānróng de zhàopiàn huò wéndàng xuǎnzéqì."),
    ImageInputInfo("Choose up to three images, each under 8 MB. The app keeps resized JPEG copies without source metadata. Review the previews; Send submits them to Hermes. Your selected server/model must support images. Image drafts are cleared when you change connection/conversation or restart the app.","最多选择三张图片，每张小于 8 MB。应用会保存不含原始元数据的缩放 JPEG 副本。请检查预览，点击发送后才提交给 Hermes。所选服务器和模型必须支持图片。切换连接、对话或重启应用会清除图片草稿。","Zuì duō xuǎnzé sān zhāng túpiàn, měi zhāng xiǎo yú 8 MB. Yìngyòng huì bǎocún bù hán yuánshǐ yuán shùjù de suōfàng JPEG fùběn. Qǐng jiǎnchá yùlǎn, diǎnjī fāsòng hòu cái tíjiāo gěi Hermes. Suǒ xuǎn fúwùqì hé móxíng bìxū zhīchí túpiàn. Qiēhuàn liánjiē, duìhuà huò chóngqǐ yìngyòng huì qīngchú túpiàn cǎogǎo."),
    EnlargeImage("Enlarge image","放大图片","Fàngdà túpiàn"),
    ImageCacheMissing("The cached image is missing or unreadable.","缓存图片丢失或无法读取。","Huǎncún túpiàn diūshī huò wúfǎ dúqǔ."),
    ImageOpenFailed("No browser could open this image.","没有浏览器可以打开此图片。","Méiyǒu liúlǎnqì kěyǐ dǎkāi cǐ túpiàn."),
    ImagePreview("Image preview","图片预览","Túpiàn yùlǎn"),
    ImageUnavailable("This image is unavailable on this device. Host files and unsupported image formats have no supported mobile download route.","此图片在本机上不可用。主机文件和不支持的图片格式没有可用的移动端下载接口。","Cǐ túpiàn zài běnjī shàng bù kěyòng. Zhǔjī wénjiàn hé bù zhīchí de túpiàn géshì méiyǒu kěyòng de yídòngduān xiàzài jiēkǒu."),
    RemoteImage("Remote image","远程图片","Yuǎnchéng túpiàn"),
    RemoteImageInfo("Opening this image contacts its host in your browser. The app does not attach your Hermes bearer token.","打开此图片会在浏览器中访问图片主机。应用不会附加 Hermes 访问令牌。","Dǎkāi cǐ túpiàn huì zài liúlǎnqì zhōng fǎngwèn túpiàn zhǔjī. Yìngyòng bú huì fùjiā Hermes fǎngwèn lìngpái."),
    OpenImageBrowser("Open image in browser","在浏览器中打开图片","Zài liúlǎnqì zhōng dǎkāi túpiàn"),
    AccountingHistoryInfo("Recent accounting for this conversation, up to 100 runs or local turns. These records survive server history refresh. A local turn ID does not establish a native run identity.","此对话最近的用量记录，最多显示 100 个运行或本地请求。这些记录在刷新服务器历史后仍保留。本地请求标识不代表原生运行身份。","Cǐ duìhuà zuìjìn de yòngliàng jìlù, zuì duō xiǎnshì yì bǎi gè yùnxíng huò běndì qǐngqiú. Zhèxiē jìlù zài shuāxīn fúwùqì lìshǐ hòu réng bǎoliú. Běndì qǐngqiú biāozhì bù dàibiǎo yuánshēng yùnxíng shēnfèn."),
    RuntimeUsage("Runtime and usage","运行模型与用量","Yùnxíng móxíng yǔ yòngliàng"),
    RuntimeUsageInfo("Hermes supplied these values. Counters may cover the session; missing values are unknown. These values do not establish your provider invoice.","这些值由 Hermes 提供。计数可能涵盖整个会话，缺失值表示未知。这些值不代表提供商账单。","Zhèxiē zhí yóu Hermes tígōng. Jìshù kěnéng hángài zhěnggè huìhuà, quēshī zhí biǎoshì wèizhī. Zhèxiē zhí bù dàibiǎo tígōngshāng zhàngdān."),
    ServedRuntime("Server-reported runtime","服务器报告的运行模型","Fúwùqì bàogào de yùnxíng móxíng"),
    RecentActivityInfo("Recent server activity, up to 200 events. Matching call IDs are grouped within the same run and execution generation. Events without IDs remain separate. Only public activity fields are shown.","最近的服务器活动，最多显示 200 个事件。同一运行和执行代次中匹配的调用标识会分组，无标识的事件保持独立。仅显示公开活动字段。","Zuìjìn de fúwùqì huódòng, zuì duō xiǎnshì èr bǎi gè shìjiàn. Tóng yī yùnxíng hé zhíxíng dàicì zhōng pǐpèi de diàoyòng biāozhì huì fēnzǔ, wú biāozhì de shìjiàn bǎochí dúlì. Jǐn xiǎnshì gōngkāi huódòng zìduàn."),
    InputTokens("Input tokens","输入令牌","Shūrù lìngpái"),
    OutputTokens("Output tokens","输出令牌","Shūchū lìngpái"),
    TotalTokens("Total tokens","总令牌","Zǒng lìngpái"),
    CacheReadTokens("Cache-read tokens","缓存读取令牌","Huǎncún dúqǔ lìngpái"),
    CacheWriteTokens("Cache-write tokens","缓存写入令牌","Huǎncún xiěrù lìngpái"),
    ReasoningTokens("Reasoning token count","推理令牌计数","Tuīlǐ lìngpái jìshù"),
    RouteSource("Runtime route source","运行路由来源","Yùnxíng lùyóu láiyuán"),
    Subagent("Subagent activity","子代理活动","Zǐ dàilǐ huódòng"),
    ActivityIdentity("Activity call ID","活动调用标识","Huódòng diàoyòng biāozhì"),
    AgentIdentity("Subagent ID","子代理标识","Zǐ dàilǐ biāozhì"),
    ChildSession("Child session ID","子会话标识","Zǐ huìhuà biāozhì"),
    DelegationIdentity("Delegation ID","委派标识","Wěipài biāozhì"),
    ParentIdentity("Parent ID","父级标识","Fùjí biāozhì"),
    AgentGoal("Delegated goal","委派目标","Wěipài mùbiāo"),
    AgentSummary("Server summary","服务器摘要","Fúwùqì zhāiyào"),
    AgentOutput("Public output excerpt","公开输出节选","Gōngkāi shūchū jiéxuǎn"),
    ReportedCost("Server-reported cost (USD)","服务器报告的费用（美元）","Fúwùqì bàogào de fèiyòng (měiyuán)"),
    DurationSeconds("Duration (seconds)","耗时（秒）","Hàoshí (miǎo)"),
    FilesRead("Files read","读取的文件","Dúqǔ de wénjiàn"),
    FilesWritten("Files written","写入的文件","Xiěrù de wénjiàn"),
    ApiCalls("API calls","API 调用次数","API diàoyòng cìshù"),
    ToolCount("Tool count","工具计数","Gōngjù jìshù"),
    AgentDepth("Delegation depth","委派深度","Wěipài shēndù"),
    TaskIndex("Task index","任务序号","Rènwù xùhào"),
    TaskCount("Task count","任务计数","Rènwù jìshù"),
    ServerValue("Server value","服务器值","Fúwùqì zhí"),
    LocalNetworkInfo("Android 17 requires permission to reach a Hermes server on your LAN or private VPN. Public internet connections do not need this permission. After granting it, connect or check the run status again.","Android 17 需要权限才能访问局域网或专用 VPN 上的 Hermes 服务器。公共互联网连接不需要此权限。授权后，请重新连接或检查运行状态。","Android 17 xūyào quánxiàn cái néng fǎngwèn júyùwǎng huò zhuānyòng VPN shàng de Hermes fúwùqì. Gōnggòng hùliánwǎng liánjiē bù xūyào cǐ quánxiàn. Shòuquán hòu, qǐng chóngxīn liánjiē huò jiǎnchá yùnxíng zhuàngtài."),
    LocalNetworkAllow("Allow local network access","允许本地网络访问","Yǔnxǔ běndì wǎngluò fǎngwèn"),
