    ScheduleHelp("Hermes schedule, for example: 0 9 * * *. The server validates it and uses its configured timezone. Leave replacement blank to preserve all existing schedule fields.","Hermes 计划，例如：0 9 * * *。服务器验证并使用其配置的时区。替换计划留空可保留现有字段。","Hermes jìhuà, lìrú: 0 9 * * *. Fúwùqì yànzhèng bìng shǐyòng qí shíqū."),
