    JobChangeWarning("Resume or run may execute this job on your server. Deleting also cancels any in-flight job run. A lost acknowledgement will require review before further changes.","恢复或运行可能在服务器上执行此作业。删除也会取消正在运行的作业。确认丢失时需先审核结果。","Huīfù huò yùnxíng kěnéng zài fúwùqì shàng zhíxíng cǐ zuòyè."),
