    McpArguments("Command arguments","命令参数","Mìnglìng cānshù"),
    McpArgumentsHelp("One argument per line; keep spaces inside an argument without adding shell quotes. Up to 64 arguments, 2048 characters each.","每行一个参数；参数内的空格无需添加 shell 引号。最多 64 个参数，每个最多 2048 字符。","Měi háng yí ge cānshù; cānshù nèi de kònggé wúxū tiānjiā shell yǐnhào. Zuìduō liùshísì ge cānshù, měi ge zuìduō èrqiān líng sìshíbā zìfú."),
    McpEnvName("Environment variable name","环境变量名称","Huánjìng biànliàng míngchēng"),
    McpEnvValue("Environment variable value","环境变量值","Huánjìng biànliàng zhí"),
    McpAddEnvironment("Add environment variable","添加环境变量","Tiānjiā huánjìng biànliàng"),
    McpAuthNone("No HTTP authentication","无 HTTP 认证","Wú HTTP rènzhèng"),
    McpAuthHeader("Bearer header authentication","Bearer 请求头认证","Bearer qǐngqiútóu rènzhèng"),
    McpAuthOAuth("OAuth (authorize separately)","OAuth（需单独授权）","OAuth (xū dāndú shòuquán)"),
    McpToken("MCP bearer credential","MCP Bearer 凭据","MCP Bearer píngjù"),
    McpHostFields("These addresses, executables and environment variables belong to the Hermes host. Supplied credentials are provisioned there when you confirm.","这些地址、程序和环境变量属于 Hermes 主机。确认后会在那里配置提供的凭据。","Zhèxiē dìzhǐ, chéngxù hé huánjìng biànliàng shǔyú Hermes zhǔjī. Quèrèn hòu huì zài nàlǐ pèizhì tígōng de píngjù."),
    McpQueryKeys("URL query keys (values hidden)","地址查询键（值已隐藏）","Dìzhǐ cháxún jiàn (zhí yǐ yǐncáng)"),
    McpShowArguments("Show command arguments","显示命令参数","Xiǎnshì mìnglìng cānshù"),
    McpHideArguments("Hide command arguments","隐藏命令参数","Yǐncáng mìnglìng cānshù"),
    McpCreateEffect("Save this MCP configuration and supplied credentials on the selected Hermes profile. New configurations are enabled by default and can load in new sessions. Test the connection and authorize OAuth separately.","将此 MCP 配置和提供的凭据保存到选定的 Hermes 配置。新设置默认启用，可在新会话中加载。连接测试和 OAuth 授权需单独进行。","Jiāng cǐ MCP pèizhì hé tígōng de píngjù bǎocún dào xuǎndìng de Hermes pèizhì. Xīn shèzhì mòrèn qǐyòng, kě zài xīn huìhuà zhōng jiāzài. Liánjiē cèshì hé OAuth shòuquán xū dāndú jìnxíng."),
    McpCreated("MCP configuration accepted and visible. Test the connection to verify credentials and tools.","MCP 配置已接受并可见。请测试连接以验证凭据和工具。","MCP pèizhì yǐ jiēshòu bìng kějiàn. Qǐng cèshì liánjiē yǐ yànzhèng píngjù hé gōngjù."),
    McpBadName("Use a server name of 1–256 characters without slashes or control characters.","请输入 1–256 字符的名称，不含斜杠或控制字符。","Qǐng shūrù yī dào èrbǎi wǔshíliù zìfú de míngchēng, bù hán xiégàng huò kòngzhì zìfú."),
    McpBadUrl("Use an HTTP(S) MCP URL without embedded username/password or a fragment.","请使用 HTTP(S) MCP 地址，不含用户名、密码或片段。","Qǐng shǐyòng HTTP(S) MCP dìzhǐ, bù hán yònghùmíng, mìmǎ huò piànduàn."),
    McpBadCommand("Enter an executable on the Hermes host, up to 512 characters.","请输入 Hermes 主机上的可执行程序，最多 512 字符。","Qǐng shūrù Hermes zhǔjī shàng de kě zhíxíng chéngxù, zuìduō wǔbǎi yīshíèr zìfú."),
    McpBadArguments("Use up to 64 arguments, each at most 2048 characters without control characters.","最多 64 个参数，每个最多 2048 字符，不含控制字符。","Zuìduō liùshísì ge cānshù, měi ge zuìduō èrqiān líng sìshíbā zìfú, bù hán kòngzhì zìfú."),
    McpBadEnvironment("Use up to 32 unique variable names (letters, digits, underscore), with values up to 8192 characters and no NUL.","最多 32 个唯一变量名（字母、数字、下划线），值最多 8192 字符，不含 NUL。","Zuìduō sānshíèr ge wéiyī biànliàng míng (zìmǔ, shùzì, xiàhuàxiàn), zhí zuìduō bāqiān yībǎi jiǔshíèr zìfú, bù hán NUL."),
    McpBadAuthentication("HTTP authentication belongs to URL servers; environment values and arguments belong to stdio servers.","HTTP 认证用于网址服务器；环境值和参数用于 stdio 服务器。","HTTP rènzhèng yòngyú wǎngzhǐ fúwùqì; huánjìng zhí hé cānshù yòngyú stdio fúwùqì."),
    McpBadToken("Enter a valid bearer credential without control characters, up to 16384 characters.","请输入有效的 Bearer 凭据，不含控制字符，最多 16384 字符。","Qǐng shūrù yǒuxiào de Bearer píngjù, bù hán kòngzhì zìfú, zuìduō yīwàn liùqiān sānbǎi bāshísì zìfú."),
    McpShowQuery("Show query values","显示查询值","Xiǎnshì cháxún zhí"),
    McpHideQuery("Hide query values","隐藏查询值","Yǐncáng cháxún zhí"),
    McpCatalog("MCP catalog","MCP 目录","MCP mùlù"),
    McpCatalogInstall("Install catalog entry","安装目录项目","Ānzhuāng mùlù xiàngmù"),
    McpCatalogInstalled("Already installed; use the server controls to manage it.","已安装；请使用服务器控制进行管理。","Yǐ ānzhuāng; qǐng shǐyòng fúwùqì kòngzhì jìnxíng guǎnlǐ."),
    McpCatalogHostSetup("This transport or background installation with environment inputs needs host-side setup. The current API cannot reliably forward every supplied value to its background command.","此传输或带环境输入的后台安装需要在主机设置。当前 API 无法可靠地将所有值传给后台命令。","Cǐ chuánshū huò dài huánjìng shūrù de hòutái ānzhuāng xūyào zài zhǔjī shèzhì. Dāngqián API wúfǎ kěkào de jiāng suǒyǒu zhí chuán gěi hòutái mìnglìng."),
    McpCatalogEffect("Review the source, executable, arguments and bootstrap commands. Confirming can install and execute code on the Hermes host and save supplied values there. A failed reply can follow partial changes. Values stay masked and are not kept in the phone receipt.","请核查来源、程序、参数和构建命令。确认可能在 Hermes 主机安装和执行代码并保存提供的值。回复失败前可能已部分更改。值保持隐藏，不保存在手机记录中。","Qǐng héchá láiyuán, chéngxù, cānshù hé gòujiàn mìnglìng. Quèrèn kěnéng zài Hermes zhǔjī ānzhuāng hé zhíxíng dàimǎ bìng bǎocún tígōng de zhí. Huífù shībài qián kěnéng yǐ bùfèn gēnggǎi. Zhí bǎochí yǐncáng, bù bǎocún zài shǒujī jìlù zhōng."),
    McpCatalogBackground("This starts a background clone/build with the host's enabled default. An acknowledgement is not installation completion. Read the configuration and test the server separately; do not repeat an uncertain install.","这会按主机默认启用状态开始后台克隆和构建。收到确认不代表安装完成。请单独读取配置并测试服务器，不要重复不确定的安装。","Zhè huì àn zhǔjī mòrèn qǐyòng zhuàngtài kāishǐ hòutái kèlóng hé gòujiàn. Shōudào quèrèn bù dàibiǎo ānzhuāng wánchéng. Qǐng dāndú dúqǔ pèizhì bìng cèshì fúwùqì, bú yào chóngfù bù quèdìng de ānzhuāng."),
    McpCatalogAccepted("Installation request accepted. Read the current configuration and test the server to inspect its state.","安装请求已接受。请读取当前配置并测试服务器以检查状态。","Ānzhuāng qǐngqiú yǐ jiēshòu. Qǐng dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì bìng cèshì fúwùqì yǐ jiǎnchá zhuàngtài."),
    McpOAuthStart("Authorize MCP OAuth","授权 MCP OAuth","Shòuquán MCP OAuth"),
    McpOAuthEffect("Start authorization for this MCP on the selected Hermes profile? The host manages discovery, callback, PKCE and credentials. Starting does not open a browser or prove the connection works.","为选定 Hermes 配置中的此 MCP 开始授权？主机管理发现、回调、PKCE 和凭据。开始不会打开浏览器，也不代表连接可用。","Wèi xuǎndìng Hermes pèizhì zhōng de cǐ MCP kāishǐ shòuquán? Zhǔjī guǎnlǐ fāxiàn, huídiào, PKCE hé píngjù. Kāishǐ bú huì dǎkāi liúlǎnqì, yě bù dàibiǎo liánjiē kěyòng."),
    McpOAuthReported("Host-reported authorization state","主机报告的授权状态","Zhǔjī bàogào de shòuquán zhuàngtài"),
    McpOAuthStarting("Authorization starting","授权正在开始","Shòuquán zhèngzài kāishǐ"),
    McpOAuthRequired("Browser authorization required","需要浏览器授权","Xūyào liúlǎnqì shòuquán"),
    McpOAuthApproved("Host reports approval","主机报告已批准","Zhǔjī bàogào yǐ pīzhǔn"),
    McpOAuthError("Host reports an authorization error; inspect the host for details.","主机报告授权错误；请在主机查看详情。","Zhǔjī bàogào shòuquán cuòwù; qǐng zài zhǔjī chákàn xiángqíng."),
    McpOAuthExpired("Flow expired or unavailable","流程已过期或不可用","Liúchéng yǐ guòqī huò bù kěyòng"),
    McpOAuthRead("Read authorization state","读取授权状态","Dúqǔ shòuquán zhuàngtài"),
    McpOAuthOpen("Open provider authorization","打开提供方授权","Dǎkāi tígōngfāng shòuquán"),
    McpOAuthBrowser("Open this host-supplied authorization destination in your browser? Query values stay hidden here. No app bearer credential is attached. Verify the provider in the browser before authorizing.","在浏览器中打开主机提供的授权地址？此处隐藏查询值，不附带应用 Bearer 凭据。授权前请在浏览器核实提供方。","Zài liúlǎnqì zhōng dǎkāi zhǔjī tígōng de shòuquán dìzhǐ? Cǐchù yǐncáng cháxún zhí, bù fùdài yìngyòng Bearer píngjù. Shòuquán qián qǐng zài liúlǎnqì héshí tígōngfāng."),
    McpOAuthLifecycle("Refresh explicitly after browser authorization. Reported approval/error may reopen for a retry under the same flow. Approval does not prove the live gateway has reconnected. URLs and raw errors are not saved in receipts.","浏览器授权后请手动刷新。同一流程的批准或错误可能重新开始重试。批准不代表实时网关已重连。地址和原始错误不保存在记录中。","Liúlǎnqì shòuquán hòu qǐng shǒudòng shuāxīn. Tóngyī liúchéng de pīzhǔn huò cuòwù kěnéng chóngxīn kāishǐ chóngshì. Pīzhǔn bù dàibiǎo shíshí wǎngguān yǐ chónglián. Dìzhǐ hé yuánshǐ cuòwù bù bǎocún zài jìlù zhōng."),
    McpOAuthCancel("Cancel authorization flow","取消授权流程","Qǔxiāo shòuquán liúchéng"),
    McpOAuthCancelEffect("Ask the host to cancel this exact flow? This does not revoke credentials already obtained, and a reported approved/error state may remain after cancellation.","请求主机取消此确切流程？这不会撤销已获得的凭据，取消后可能仍报告批准或错误状态。","Qǐngqiú zhǔjī qǔxiāo cǐ quèqiè liúchéng? Zhè bú huì chèxiāo yǐ huòdé de píngjù, qǔxiāo hòu kěnéng réng bàogào pīzhǔn huò cuòwù zhuàngtài."),
    McpOAuthCancelled("Host acknowledged the cancellation request. Obtained credentials were not revoked.","主机已确认取消请求。已获得的凭据未撤销。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn qǔxiāo qǐngqiú. Yǐ huòdé de píngjù wèi chèxiāo."),
    HostCron("Advanced schedules","高级计划","Gāojí jìhuà"),
    HostCronBoundary("Read schedules from this explicit dashboard profile. These records are separate from the selected inference API's job cache. Schedule state is not proof of a successful execution.","从此明确选定的仪表板配置读取计划。这些记录与推理 API 的任务缓存分开。计划状态不代表执行成功。","Cóng cǐ míngquè xuǎndìng de yíbiǎobǎn pèizhì dúqǔ jìhuà. Zhèxiē jìlù yǔ tuīlǐ API de rènwù huǎncún fēnkāi. Jìhuà zhuàngtài bù dàibiǎo zhíxíng chénggōng."),
    HostCronScheduleState("Schedule state","计划状态","Jìhuà zhuàngtài"),
    HostCronLastStatus("Last host-reported run status","主机报告的上次运行状态","Zhǔjī bàogào de shàngcì yùnxíng zhuàngtài"),
    HostCronRunError("The host records a run or delivery error. Inspect host history for details; raw error text is not displayed here.","主机记录了运行或交付错误。请在主机历史中查看详情；此处不显示原始错误。","Zhǔjī jìlù le yùnxíng huò jiāofù cuòwù. Qǐng zài zhǔjī lìshǐ zhōng chákàn xiángqíng; cǐchù bù xiǎnshì yuánshǐ cuòwù."),
    HostCronUnsupportedId("This record has no supported addressable job ID.","此记录没有受支持的可寻址任务 ID。","Cǐ jìlù méiyǒu shòu zhīchí de kě xúnzhǐ rènwù ID."),
    HostCronModel("Model","模型","Móxíng"), HostCronProvider("Provider","提供方","Tígōngfāng"),
    HostCronScript("Script within profile scripts","配置脚本目录中的脚本","Pèizhì jiǎoběn mùlù zhōng de jiǎoběn"),
    HostCronWorkdir("Host working directory","主机工作目录","Zhǔjī gōngzuò mùlù"),
    HostCronTimezone("Schedule timezone","计划时区","Jìhuà shíqū"),
    HostCronPauseReason("Pause reason","暂停原因","Zàntíng yuányīn"),
    HostCronDelivery("Result delivery","结果交付","Jiéguǒ jiāofù"),
    HostCronNoAgent("Script-only execution","仅脚本执行","Jǐn jiǎoběn zhíxíng"),
    HostCronCatchUp("Catch up missed schedules","补跑错过的计划","Bǔ pǎo cuòguò de jìhuà"),
    HostCronGrace("Catch-up window (minutes)","补跑窗口（分钟）","Bǔ pǎo chuāngkǒu (fēnzhōng)"),
    HostCronSkills("Scheduled skills","计划使用的技能","Jìhuà shǐyòng de jìnéng"),
    HostCronContext("Context from jobs","任务上下文来源","Rènwù shàngxiàwén láiyuán"),
    HostCronToolsets("Enabled toolsets","启用的工具集","Qǐyòng de gōngjùjí"),
    HostCronRepeat("Repeat limit","重复次数上限","Chóngfù cìshù shàngxiàn"),
    HostCronRepeatCompleted("Recorded completed repeats","记录的已完成重复次数","Jìlù de yǐ wánchéng chóngfù cìshù"),
    HostCronUnlimited("Unlimited repeats","不限重复次数","Bù xiàn chóngfù cìshù"),
    ManagementTooLarge("The management response exceeds the mobile size limit. Inspect this resource on the host dashboard.","管理回复超出手机大小限制。请在主机仪表板查看此资源。","Guǎnlǐ huífù chāochū shǒujī dàxiǎo xiànzhì. Qǐng zài zhǔjī yíbiǎobǎn chákàn cǐ zīyuán."),
    HostCronCreate("Create paused schedule","创建已暂停的计划","Chuàngjiàn yǐ zàntíng de jìhuà"),
    HostCronCreateHelp("Name and schedule are required. Supply a prompt, skill or script. This creates a paused record on the selected Hermes host profile.","名称和计划必填。请提供提示词、技能或脚本。这会在选定的 Hermes 主机配置中创建暂停记录。","Míngchēng hé jìhuà bì tián. Qǐng tígōng tíshìcí, jìnéng huò jiǎoběn. Zhè huì zài xuǎndìng de Hermes zhǔjī pèizhì zhōng chuàngjiàn zàntíng jìlù."),
    HostCronScheduleHelp("Hermes interprets cron expressions, intervals and one-off times. Inspect its saved interpretation before activation. One-off schedules run at most once.","Hermes 解释 cron 表达式、间隔和一次性时间。激活前请核查保存的解释。一次性计划最多运行一次。","Hermes jiěshì cron biǎodáshì, jiàngé hé yí cì xìng shíjiān. Jīhuó qián qǐng héchá bǎocún de jiěshì. Yí cì xìng jìhuà zuìduō yùnxíng yí cì."),
    HostCronCreateEffect("Create this schedule paused. Inspect the saved schedule, scripts and runtime on the host before activation. Configuration may be saved before a later failure; an uncertain reply is never automatically repeated.","创建此暂停计划。激活前请在主机核查保存的计划、脚本和运行配置。后续失败前可能已保存配置；不确定回复不会自动重复。","Chuàngjiàn cǐ zàntíng jìhuà. Jīhuó qián qǐng zài zhǔjī héchá bǎocún de jìhuà, jiǎoběn hé yùnxíng pèizhì. Hòuxù shībài qián kěnéng yǐ bǎocún pèizhì; bù quèdìng huífù bú huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    HostCronCreateUnsupported("This server does not declare the required paused-creation fields. Update Hermes or use its host dashboard.","此服务器未声明所需的暂停创建字段。请更新 Hermes 或使用主机仪表板。","Cǐ fúwùqì wèi shēngmíng suǒ xū de zàntíng chuàngjiàn zìduàn. Qǐng gēngxīn Hermes huò shǐyòng zhǔjī yíbiǎobǎn."),
    HostCronCreateInvalid("Check the name, schedule and payload. Use up to 5000 prompt characters, 1–1000000 repeats or unlimited, 64 names per list, and a relative script path without parent segments. Script-only mode needs a script.","请检查名称、计划和内容。提示词最多 5000 字符，重复次数 1–1000000 或不限，每个列表最多 64 个名称，脚本使用不含父目录的相对路径。仅脚本模式需要脚本。","Qǐng jiǎnchá míngchēng, jìhuà hé nèiróng. Tíshìcí zuìduō wǔqiān zìfú, chóngfù cìshù yī dào yìbǎi wàn huò bù xiàn, měi ge lièbiǎo zuìduō liùshísì ge míngchēng, jiǎoběn shǐyòng bù hán fù mùlù de xiāngduì lùjìng. Jǐn jiǎoběn móshì xūyào jiǎoběn."),
    HostCronCreatedPaused("The host accepted a paused schedule. Inspect its saved interpretation before activating it.","主机已接受暂停计划。激活前请核查保存的解释。","Zhǔjī yǐ jiēshòu zàntíng jìhuà. Jīhuó qián qǐng héchá bǎocún de jiěshì."),
    HostCronAdvanced("Runtime and automation options","运行和自动化选项","Yùnxíng hé zìdònghuà xuǎnxiàng"),
    HostCronLocal("Save results on the Hermes host","将结果保存到 Hermes 主机","Jiāng jiéguǒ bǎocún dào Hermes zhǔjī"),
    HostCronDeliveryUnavailable("No home destination is configured for this platform on the selected profile.","选定配置尚未为此平台设置默认目标。","Xuǎndìng pèizhì shàng wèi wèi cǐ píngtái shèzhì mòrèn mùbiāo."),
    HostCronDeliveryEffect("Uses this profile's configured home destination when the schedule runs.","计划运行时使用此配置中设定的默认目标。","Jìhuà yùnxíng shí shǐyòng cǐ pèizhì zhōng shèdìng de mòrèn mùbiāo."),
    HostCronScriptHelp("Relative file path inside the selected profile's scripts directory. Script-only mode delivers its output without an agent turn.","选定配置的 scripts 目录内的相对文件路径。仅脚本模式交付脚本输出，不进行智能体回合。","Xuǎndìng pèizhì de scripts mùlù nèi de xiāngduì wénjiàn lùjìng. Jǐn jiǎoběn móshì jiāofù jiǎoběn shūchū, bù jìnxíng zhìnéngtǐ huíhé."),
    HostCronScriptContext("Script output is included in the agent context.","脚本输出会包含在智能体上下文中。","Jiǎoběn shūchū huì bāohán zài zhìnéngtǐ shàngxiàwén zhōng."),
    HostCronIdsHelp("One server identifier per line; duplicate names are merged. Hermes validates availability when it runs the job.","每行一个服务器标识符；重复名称会合并。Hermes 在运行任务时验证可用性。","Měi háng yí ge fúwùqì biāozhìfú; chóngfù míngchēng huì hébìng. Hermes zài yùnxíng rènwù shí yànzhèng kěyòngxìng."),
    HostCronProviderUrl("Provider base URL on the host","主机上的提供方基础地址","Zhǔjī shàng de tígōngfāng jīchǔ dìzhǐ"),
    HostCronProviderUrlEffect("This changes where Hermes sends provider requests and may use credentials stored on the host.","这会更改 Hermes 发送提供方请求的位置，并可能使用主机保存的凭据。","Zhè huì gēnggǎi Hermes fāsòng tígōngfāng qǐngqiú de wèizhì, bìng kěnéng shǐyòng zhǔjī bǎocún de píngjù."),
    HostCronRestrictTools("Set a job-specific toolset allowlist","设置任务专用工具集允许列表","Shèzhì rènwù zhuānyòng gōngjùjí yǔnxǔ lièbiǎo"),
    HostCronNoTools("Empty toolset allowlist (configured)","空工具集允许列表（已配置）","Kōng gōngjùjí yǔnxǔ lièbiǎo (yǐ pèizhì)"),
    HostCronInheritTools("Inherit the profile's tool settings","继承配置的工具设置","Jìchéng pèizhì de gōngjù shèzhì"),
    HostCronWorkdirHelp("Directory on the Hermes host. Hermes resolves and validates it before storing the job.","Hermes 主机上的目录。Hermes 在保存任务前解析并验证它。","Hermes zhǔjī shàng de mùlù. Hermes zài bǎocún rènwù qián jiěxī bìng yànzhèng tā."),
    HostCronTimezoneHelp("Optional IANA zone, such as UTC or Europe/London. Blank inherits the profile zone; the host validates the name.","可选 IANA 时区，例如 UTC 或 Europe/London。留空继承配置时区；主机验证名称。","Kě xuǎn IANA shíqū, lìrú UTC huò Europe/London. Liú kōng jìchéng pèizhì shíqū; zhǔjī yànzhèng míngchēng."),
    HostCronGraceHelp("Cron schedules only: 0–1440 minutes; 0 skips missed occurrences. Blank uses the host default.","仅用于 cron 计划：0–1440 分钟；0 跳过错过的运行。留空使用主机默认值。","Jǐn yòngyú cron jìhuà: líng dào yīqiān sìbǎi sìshí fēnzhōng; líng tiàoguò cuòguò de yùnxíng. Liú kōng shǐyòng zhǔjī mòrèn zhí."),
    HostCronInherit("Inherit host default","继承主机默认值","Jìchéng zhǔjī mòrèn zhí"),
    HostCronSelfContext("Use this job's previous output","使用此任务的上次输出","Shǐyòng cǐ rènwù de shàngcì shūchū"),
    HostCronCreatedAt("Created on the host","在主机创建时间","Zài zhǔjī chuàngjiàn shíjiān"),
    ManagementRequestedAt("Requested at (UTC)","请求时间（UTC）","Qǐngqiú shíjiān (UTC)"),
    SkillEssential("Hermes requires this essential skill and ignores disable requests.","Hermes 需要此必要技能，并会忽略禁用请求。","Hermes xūyào cǐ bìyào jìnéng, bìng huì hūlüè jìnyòng qǐngqiú."),
    HostSkills("Installed skill controls","已安装技能控制","Yǐ ānzhuāng jìnéng kòngzhì"),
    SkillBoundary("Reads and changes apply only to this management profile. Skill text is displayed as text; opening it does not run its instructions.","读取和更改仅适用于此管理配置。技能文本仅供阅读，打开不会运行其中的指令。","Dúqǔ hé gēnggǎi jǐn shìyòng yú cǐ guǎnlǐ pèizhì. Jìnéng wénběn jǐn gōng yuèdú, dǎkāi bú huì yùnxíng qízhōng de zhǐlìng."),
    SkillContent("Read SKILL.md","阅读 SKILL.md","Yuèdú SKILL.md"),
    SkillToggle("Change skill availability","更改技能可用性","Gēnggǎi jìnéng kěyòngxìng"),
    SkillEnable("Enable skill","启用技能","Qǐyòng jìnéng"),
    SkillDisable("Disable skill","禁用技能","Jìnyòng jìnéng"),
    SkillLockControl("Change curator edit lock","更改整理器编辑锁","Gēnggǎi zhěnglǐqì biānjí suǒ"),
    SkillLock("Lock curator edits","锁定整理器编辑","Suǒdìng zhěnglǐqì biānjí"),
    SkillUnlock("Allow curator edits","允许整理器编辑","Yǔnxǔ zhěnglǐqì biānjí"),
    SkillLocked("Curator edit lock: locked","整理器编辑锁：已锁定","Zhěnglǐqì biānjí suǒ: yǐ suǒdìng"),
    SkillUnlocked("Curator edit lock: unlocked","整理器编辑锁：未锁定","Zhěnglǐqì biānjí suǒ: wèi suǒdìng"),
    SkillLockUnknown("Curator edit lock: unknown","整理器编辑锁：未知","Zhěnglǐqì biānjí suǒ: wèizhī"),
    SkillUnsupported("The host did not report a typed state for this control. Refresh or use the Hermes dashboard.","主机未报告此控件的明确状态。请刷新或使用 Hermes 控制台。","Zhǔjī wèi bàogào cǐ kòngjiàn de míngquè zhuàngtài. Qǐng shuāxīn huò shǐyòng Hermes kòngzhìtái."),
    SkillToggleEffect("Changes profile skill availability for future prompt loading. It does not uninstall files, revoke tool access or stop existing work.","更改此配置后续提示加载的技能可用性。不会卸载文件、撤销工具权限或停止现有工作。","Gēnggǎi cǐ pèizhì hòuxù tíshì jiāzài de jìnéng kěyòngxìng. Bú huì xièzài wénjiàn, chèxiāo gōngjù quánxiàn huò tíngzhǐ xiànyǒu gōngzuò."),
    SkillLockEffect("Sets the host curator/background-review edit lock. Your own edits remain allowed. This is not a general file permission, skill disable or tool-access restriction.","设置主机整理器和后台审阅的编辑锁。您自己的编辑仍被允许。这不是通用文件权限，不会禁用技能或限制工具访问。","Shèzhì zhǔjī zhěnglǐqì hé hòutái shěnyuè de biānjí suǒ. Nín zìjǐ de biānjí réng bèi yǔnxǔ. Zhè bú shì tōngyòng wénjiàn quánxiàn, bú huì jìnyòng jìnéng huò xiànzhì gōngjù fǎngwèn."),
    SkillChanged("Skill configuration acknowledged and observed. Existing work may continue.","技能配置已确认并读取验证。现有工作可能继续。","Jìnéng pèizhì yǐ quèrèn bìng dúqǔ yànzhèng. Xiànyǒu gōngzuò kěnéng jìxù."),
    GatewayAutomation("Gateway schedules","网关计划","Wǎngguān jìhuà"),
    GatewayLoad("Read gateway schedules","读取网关计划","Dúqǔ wǎngguān jìhuà"),
    GatewayConnectionEffect("Opens the dashboard gateway connection for this profile. Connecting may initialize configured MCP host processes. Reads include paused schedules; they do not submit an agent turn or change a schedule.","为此配置打开控制台网关连接。连接可能初始化已配置的 MCP 主机进程。读取包括已暂停的计划；不会提交智能体回合或更改计划。","Wèi cǐ pèizhì dǎkāi kòngzhìtái wǎngguān liánjiē. Liánjiē kěnéng chūshǐhuà yǐ pèizhì de MCP zhǔjī jìnchéng. Dúqǔ bāokuò yǐ zàntíng de jìhuà; bú huì tíjiāo zhìnéngtǐ huíhé huò gēnggǎi jìhuà."),
    GatewayScopeUnsupported("The gateway did not prove this explicit profile scope or returned an unsupported contract. Use the Hermes dashboard.","网关未证明此明确配置范围，或返回了不支持的协议。请使用 Hermes 控制台。","Wǎngguān wèi zhèngmíng cǐ míngquè pèizhì fànwéi, huò fǎnhuí le bù zhīchí de xiéyì. Qǐng shǐyòng Hermes kòngzhìtái."),
    GatewaySchedulerReported("Host reports the scheduler gateway is running. This does not prove a job ran.","主机报告调度网关正在运行。这不能证明任务已运行。","Zhǔjī bàogào diàodù wǎngguān zhèngzài yùnxíng. Zhè bù néng zhèngmíng rènwù yǐ yùnxíng."),
    GatewaySchedulerUnavailable("Host reports no running scheduler gateway. Saved schedules may not fire.","主机报告没有运行中的调度网关。已保存的计划可能不会触发。","Zhǔjī bàogào méiyǒu yùnxíng zhōng de diàodù wǎngguān. Yǐ bǎocún de jìhuà kěnéng bú huì chùfā."),
    GatewaySchedulerUnknown("Scheduler gateway readiness was not established.","尚未确定调度网关是否就绪。","Shàngwèi quèdìng diàodù wǎngguān shìfǒu jiùxù."),
    GatewayPromptPreview("Prompt preview reported by the gateway","网关报告的提示预览","Wǎngguān bàogào de tíshì yùlǎn"),
    GatewayCronPause("Pause gateway schedule","暂停网关计划","Zàntíng wǎngguān jìhuà"),
    GatewayCronResume("Resume gateway schedule","恢复网关计划","Huīfù wǎngguān jìhuà"),
    GatewayCronDelete("Remove gateway schedule and outputs","移除网关计划及输出","Yíchú wǎngguān jìhuà jí shūchū"),
    GatewaySelectorCollision("Another job name matches this ID. Rename that job on the host before using these controls.","另一个任务名称与此 ID 相同。请先在主机上重命名该任务，再使用这些控件。","Lìng yí gè rènwù míngchēng yǔ cǐ ID xiāngtóng. Qǐng xiān zài zhǔjī shàng chóngmìngmíng gāi rènwù, zài shǐyòng zhèxiē kòngjiàn."),
    GatewayControlStateUnknown("Pause/resume is unavailable without a known enabled or paused state. Refresh or use the host dashboard.","没有明确的启用或暂停状态时，无法暂停或恢复。请刷新或使用主机控制台。","Méiyǒu míngquè de qǐyòng huò zàntíng zhuàngtài shí, wúfǎ zàntíng huò huīfù. Qǐng shuāxīn huò shǐyòng zhǔjī kòngzhìtái."),
    GatewayCronAccepted("Host acknowledged the schedule request. Read configuration separately to inspect its state.","主机已确认计划请求。请另行读取配置以检查状态。","Zhǔjī yǐ quèrèn jìhuà qǐngqiú. Qǐng lìngxíng dúqǔ pèizhì yǐ jiǎnchá zhuàngtài."),
    GatewayCronChanged("Schedule change acknowledged and observed. Execution outcome is separate.","计划更改已确认并读取验证。执行结果另行确定。","Jìhuà gēnggǎi yǐ quèrèn bìng dúqǔ yànzhèng. Zhíxíng jiéguǒ lìngxíng quèdìng."),
    GatewayReasoning("Configured reasoning effort","已配置的推理强度","Yǐ pèizhì de tuīlǐ qiángdù"),
    GatewayMonitorScript("Host monitor script","主机监控脚本","Zhǔjī jiānkòng jiǎoběn"),
    GatewayMonitorUrl("Host monitor URL","主机监控网址","Zhǔjī jiānkòng wǎngzhǐ"),
    GatewayInterpreter("Host script interpreter","主机脚本解释器","Zhǔjī jiǎoběn jiěshìqì"),
    GatewayAttach("Attach to a host session (reported)","附加到主机会话（主机报告）","Fùjiā dào zhǔjī huìhuà (zhǔjī bàogào)"),
    GatewayPinned("Pinned runtime (reported)","固定运行配置（主机报告）","Gùdìng yùnxíng pèizhì (zhǔjī bàogào)"),
    GatewayToolsetsUnreported("The gateway omitted the toolset allowlist. Omission does not distinguish inherited settings from an empty allowlist; inspect Advanced schedules for full configuration.","网关未报告工具集允许列表。省略字段无法区分继承设置与空允许列表；请在高级计划中检查完整配置。","Wǎngguān wèi bàogào gōngjùjí yǔnxǔ lièbiǎo. Shěnglüè zìduàn wúfǎ qūfēn jìchéng shèzhì yǔ kōng yǔnxǔ lièbiǎo; qǐng zài gāojí jìhuà zhōng jiǎnchá wánzhěng pèizhì."),
    GatewayPauseEffect("Pauses future scheduling. A current run may continue; this does not request its cancellation.","暂停后续调度。当前运行可能继续；这不会请求取消当前运行。","Zàntíng hòuxù diàodù. Dāngqián yùnxíng kěnéng jìxù; zhè bú huì qǐngqiú qǔxiāo dāngqián yùnxíng."),
    GatewayResumeEffect("Activates the saved host job, including its script, provider, tools and delivery. An overdue recurring slot can fire under host catch-up policy. This does not prove readiness or successful execution.","激活主机保存的任务，包括脚本、提供方、工具及投递。过期的重复时间点可能按主机补跑策略触发。这不能证明已就绪或执行成功。","Jīhuó zhǔjī bǎocún de rènwù, bāokuò jiǎoběn, tígōngfāng, gōngjù jí tóudì. Guòqī de chóngfù shíjiān diǎn kěnéng àn zhǔjī bǔpǎo cèlüè chùfā. Zhè bù néng zhèngmíng yǐ jiùxù huò zhíxíng chénggōng."),
    GatewayDeleteEffect("Deletes the saved schedule, its stored output directory and notepad, and requests cooperative cancellation of its current run. Deleted outputs cannot be restored here. Acknowledgement does not prove the run has stopped.","删除已保存的计划、输出目录和记事本，并请求协作式取消当前运行。无法在此恢复已删除的输出。确认不代表运行已停止。","Shānchú yǐ bǎocún de jìhuà, shūchū mùlù hé jìshìběn, bìng qǐngqiú xiézuò shì qǔxiāo dāngqián yùnxíng. Wúfǎ zài cǐ huīfù yǐ shānchú de shūchū. Quèrèn bù dàibiǎo yùnxíng yǐ tíngzhǐ."),
    GatewayMutationConnection("The gateway connection may initialize configured MCP processes. This confirms one requested schedule action; it is never retried automatically.","网关连接可能初始化已配置的 MCP 进程。此操作仅确认一次计划更改请求；不会自动重试。","Wǎngguān liánjiē kěnéng chūshǐhuà yǐ pèizhì de MCP jìnchéng. Cǐ cāozuò jǐn quèrèn yí cì jìhuà gēnggǎi qǐngqiú; bú huì zìdòng chóngshì."),
    GatewayMutationRace("Hermes resolves this ID first, then a matching name if the ID is gone. The app checks current configuration and known collisions, but the host has no revision check preventing concurrent external edits.","Hermes 先按此 ID 查找；若 ID 不存在，则按匹配名称查找。应用会检查当前配置和已知冲突，但主机没有可阻止外部并发编辑的版本检查。","Hermes xiān àn cǐ ID cházhǎo; ruò ID bù cúnzài, zé àn pǐpèi míngchēng cházhǎo. Yìngyòng huì jiǎnchá dāngqián pèizhì hé yǐzhī chōngtū, dàn zhǔjī méiyǒu kě zǔzhǐ wàibù bìngfā biānjí de bǎnběn jiǎnchá."),
    GatewayReceiptEffect("Read current configuration for an observation. This receipt is not a run-completion or cancellation-completion report.","读取当前配置以观察状态。此回执不是运行完成或取消完成的报告。","Dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì yǐ guānchá zhuàngtài. Cǐ huízhí bú shì yùnxíng wánchéng huò qǔxiāo wánchéng de bàogào."),
    PluginConnectionEffect("Opens the dashboard gateway connection for this profile. Connecting may initialize configured MCP host processes.", "为此配置打开控制台网关连接。连接可能初始化已配置的 MCP 主机进程。", "Wèi cǐ pèizhì dǎkāi kòngzhìtái wǎngguān liánjiē. Liánjiē kěnéng chūshǐhuà yǐ pèizhì de MCP zhǔjī jìnchéng."),
    PluginUpdate("Review plugin update", "审核插件更新", "shěn hé chā jiàn gēng xīn"),
    PluginUpdateUnsupported("Update needs a verified user/git directory, no known target collision, and a reported catalog pin for catalog installs. Custom commit-pinned installs require an explicit host reinstall.", "更新需要已验证的用户／Git 目录、无已知目标冲突，以及目录安装报告的固定版本。自定义提交固定安装需要在主机明确重新安装。", "gēng xīn xū yào yǐ yàn zhèng de yòng hù／Git mù lù、wú yǐ zhī mù biāo chōng tū hé bào gào de gù dìng bǎn běn。"),
    PluginUpdateEffect("Updates host plugin code and can change dependencies in the shared host environment, activate features and rename a catalog install. Catalog updates can back up tracked local edits and carry untracked files; Git/subdirectory updates can re-clone or stage local changes. The app first sends both grant flags false. Hermes can auto-accept caution for catalog pins it treats as reviewed, and host configuration can disable scanning. These flags do not bypass dependency-admission or provenance restrictions. Live, deferred and restart reports remain separate.", "更新主机插件代码，可能更改共享主机环境的依赖、激活功能和重命名目录安装。目录更新可备份已跟踪的本地编辑并保留未跟踪文件；Git／子目录更新可重新克隆或暂存本地更改。应用首次发送的两个授权标志均为否。Hermes 可为视为已审核的目录版本自动接受警告，且主机配置可禁用扫描。这些标志不会绕过依赖准入或来源限制。即时、延后和重启报告仍然独立。", "gēng xīn zhǔ jī chā jiàn dài mǎ，kě néng gēng gǎi yī lài、jī huó gōng néng hé chóng mìng míng ān zhuāng。yìng yòng shǒu cì fā sòng de liǎng gè shòu quán biāo zhì jūn wéi fǒu。Hermes kě wèi yǐ shěn hé bǎn běn zì dòng jiē shòu jǐng gào，zhǔ jī yě kě jìn yòng sǎo miáo。"),
    PluginUpdateLimit("The app rechecks profile mapping, inventory and the reported catalog pin before one request. Hermes resolves the source and applies its current scan policy again. This update RPC has no expected revision or proposal ID; concurrent catalog/source changes can alter the update or findings after review. No inspected-commit guard is sent. A ten-minute reply wait or cancellation does not stop host work. Lost replies are uncertain and never automatically repeated.", "应用会在一次请求前重新检查配置映射、清单和报告的目录版本。Hermes 会再次解析来源并应用其当前扫描策略。此更新 RPC 没有预期版本或提案标识；并发目录／来源更改可在审核后改变更新或发现。不会发送已检查提交保护。十分钟回复等待或取消不会停止主机工作。丢失回复是不确定结果，绝不自动重复。", "yìng yòng huì zài yī cì qǐng qiú qián chóng xīn jiǎn chá pèi zhì、qīng dān hé bǎn běn。bìng fā gēng gǎi kě zài shěn hé hòu gǎi biàn gēng xīn。diū shī huí fù jué bù zì dòng chóng fù。"),
    PluginUpdateCapabilities("Host requests capability approval", "主机请求权限批准", "zhǔ jī qǐng qiú quán xiàn pī zhǔn"),
    PluginUpdateScan("Host scan blocked publication", "主机扫描阻止发布", "zhǔ jī sǎo miáo zǔ zhǐ fā bù"),
    PluginUpdateProposalPin("Host-reported catalog proposal pin", "主机报告的目录提案版本", "zhǔ jī bào gào de mù lù tí àn bǎn běn"),
    PluginUpdateReportedPin("Host-reported result pin", "主机报告的结果版本", "zhǔ jī bào gào de jié guǒ bǎn běn"),
    PluginUpdateHiddenDetails("Sensitive declared reference hidden", "已隐藏敏感声明引用", "yǐ yǐn cáng mǐn gǎn shēng míng yǐn yòng"),
    PluginUpdateShowDetails("Show declared details (may include private references)", "显示声明详情（可能包含私密引用）", "xiǎn shì shēng míng xiáng qíng（kě néng bāo hán sī mì yǐn yòng）"),
    PluginUpdateHideDetails("Hide declared details", "隐藏声明详情", "yǐn cáng shēng míng xiáng qíng"),
    PluginUpdateNoPublication("The host refused plugin publication. Cloning, scanning or backups may already have occurred. A further attempt needs a new review; it is not sent automatically.", "主机已拒绝插件发布。克隆、扫描或备份可能已经发生。进一步尝试需要新的审核，不会自动发送。", "zhǔ jī yǐ jù jué chā jiàn fā bù。kè lóng、sǎo miáo huò bèi fèn kě néng yǐ jīng fā shēng。jìn yī bù cháng shì xū yào xīn de shěn hé。"),
    PluginUpdateReviewDecision("Review another update attempt", "审核另一次更新尝试", "shěn hé lìng yī cì gēng xīn cháng shì"),
    PluginUpdateDangerous("Dangerous scan verdicts cannot be overridden.", "危险扫描结论不能绕过。", "wēi xiǎn sǎo miáo jié lùn bù néng rào guò。"),
    PluginUpdateCatalogScanLimit("Catalog scanning follows the host's reviewed-pin policy; this update RPC does not forward a catalog caution override. Inspect this response on the host.", "目录扫描遵循主机的已审核版本策略；此更新 RPC 不会转发目录警告覆盖。请在主机检查此回复。", "mù lù sǎo miáo zūn xún zhǔ jī de yǐ shěn hé bǎn běn cè lüè。cǐ RPC bú huì zhuǎn fā mù lù jǐng gào fù gài。qǐng zài zhǔ jī jiǎn chá。"),
    PluginUpdateDecisionUnavailable("This response is incomplete, changed or expired. Refresh and request a new update review, or inspect it on the host.", "此回复不完整、已更改或已过期。请刷新并请求新的更新审核，或在主机检查。", "cǐ huí fù bù wán zhěng、yǐ gēng gǎi huò yǐ guò qī。qǐng shuā xīn bìng qǐng qiú xīn de shěn hé。"),
    PluginUpdateCapabilityGrant("Approves capability widening for the host's next resolved catalog update, including dependency, OAuth and desktop additions shown here. The server does not bind this flag to the displayed proposal pin or delta; concurrent catalog changes can widen the next proposal differently.", "批准主机下一次解析的目录更新扩大权限，包括此处显示的依赖、OAuth 和桌面新增项。服务器不会将此标志绑定到显示的提案版本或差异；并发目录更改可能以不同方式扩大下一提案。", "pī zhǔn zhǔ jī xià yī cì mù lù gēng xīn kuò dà quán xiàn。fú wù qì bú huì jiāng cǐ biāo zhì bǎng dìng dào xiǎn shì de tí àn。"),
    PluginUpdateCautionGrant("Overrides a caution verdict for the host's next resolved Git/subdirectory update after reviewing these findings. The next scan may differ if the source changes. A dangerous verdict still blocks publication.", "审核这些发现后，为主机下一次解析的 Git／子目录更新覆盖警告结论。如果来源更改，下次扫描可能不同。危险结论仍会阻止发布。", "shěn hé zhè xiē fā xiàn hòu，wèi zhǔ jī xià yī cì gēng xīn fù gài jǐng gào jié lùn。wēi xiǎn jié lùn réng huì zǔ zhǐ fā bù。"),
    PluginUpdateApproveNext("I reviewed the supplied details and authorize these flags for one further host update with the stated concurrency limits.", "我已审核提供的详情，并授权在上述并发限制下为另一次主机更新使用这些标志。", "wǒ yǐ shěn hé tí gōng de xiáng qíng，bìng shòu quán zài shàng shù xiàn zhì xià wèi lìng yī cì gēng xīn shǐ yòng zhè xiē biāo zhì。"),
    PluginUpdateMoved("The host reported a different catalog pin from the reviewed inventory. Inspect this change on the host; the request was not repeated.", "主机报告的目录版本与审核清单不同。请在主机检查此更改；请求未重复。", "zhǔ jī bào gào de mù lù bǎn běn yǔ shěn hé qīng dān bù tóng。qǐng zài zhǔ jī jiǎn chá；qǐng qiú wèi chóng fù。"),
    PluginUpdateResult("Host-reported plugin update result", "主机报告的插件更新结果", "zhǔ jī bào gào de chā jiàn gēng xīn jié guǒ"),
    PluginUpdateGitReported("Git update acknowledged. Its reply provides no revision, so inventory cannot independently verify which commit was updated.", "Git 更新已确认。回复没有版本，因此清单无法独立验证更新了哪个提交。", "Git gēng xīn yǐ què rèn。huí fù méi yǒu bǎn běn，yīn cǐ qīng dān wú fǎ dú lì yàn zhèng tí jiāo。"),
    PluginUpdateUnchanged("Host reports no change", "主机报告没有更改", "zhǔ jī bào gào méi yǒu gēng gǎi"),
    PluginUpdateObservation("Configuration observation is separate from byte identity, live activation, execution completion and which actor caused the change. A catalog pin can be a tag object rather than its checked-out commit.", "配置观察与字节身份、即时激活、执行完成和引起更改的操作者不同。目录版本可以是标签对象，而非检出的提交。", "pèi zhì guān chá yǔ zì jié shēn fèn、jí shí jī huó hé zhí xíng wán chéng bù tóng。mù lù bǎn běn kě yǐ shì biāo qiān duì xiàng。"),
    PluginRemove("Review plugin removal", "审核移除插件", "shěn hé yí chú chā jiàn"),
    PluginInstallDirectory("Installed directory identifier", "安装目录标识", "ān zhuāng mù lù biāo zhì"),
    PluginRemoveUnsupported("Removal needs a user/git install with an exact directory under this verified profile's plugin root and no known target collision. Refresh management and plugin inventory, or inspect it on the host.", "移除需要用户或 Git 安装、已验证配置插件根目录下的确切目录，且没有已知目标冲突。请刷新管理和插件清单，或在主机检查。", "yí chú xū yào yòng hù huò Git ān zhuāng、yǐ yàn zhèng pèi zhì chā jiàn gēn mù lù xià de què qiè mù lù，qiě méi yǒu yǐ zhī mù biāo chōng tū。"),
    PluginRemoveEffect("Removes this installed directory, including local edits and any desktop half inside it, plus install metadata. Hermes clears related allow/deny entries, saved platform toolsets and local plugin grant records; it may reset the selected memory provider. A directory symlink removes only that link. Separate desktop copies and provider credentials may remain. Running handlers and existing work can continue until restart.", "移除此安装目录，包括本地编辑、其中的桌面部分及安装元数据。Hermes 会清除相关启用／停用记录、已保存的平台工具集和本地插件授权记录，并可能重置所选记忆提供方。目录符号链接仅删除链接本身。单独的桌面副本和提供方凭据可能保留。运行中的处理程序和现有工作可持续至重启。", "yí chú cǐ ān zhuāng mù lù，bāo kuò běn dì biān jí、qí zhōng de zhuō miàn bù fèn jí ān zhuāng yuán shù jù。Hermes huì qīng chú xiāng guān jì lù、gōng jù jí hé běn dì chā jiàn shòu quán，bìng kě néng chóng zhì jì yì tí gōng fāng。"),
    PluginRemoveLimit("The app rechecks profile mapping and inventory before one removal. Host edits can still race; no directory revision compare-and-set exists. Locked Windows files can remain pending deletion after the plugin stops appearing in inventory. A reply or inventory absence does not prove file erasure, provider revocation or stopped execution. Cancellation does not stop host cleanup. Lost replies are uncertain and never automatically repeated.", "应用会在一次移除前重新检查配置映射和清单。主机编辑仍可能冲突；目录没有版本比较后设置。插件不再出现在清单后，锁定的 Windows 文件仍可能等待删除。回复或清单缺失不能证明文件已擦除、提供方授权已撤销或执行已停止。取消不会停止主机清理。丢失回复是不确定结果，绝不自动重复。", "yìng yòng huì zài yī cì yí chú qián chóng xīn jiǎn chá pèi zhì yìng shè hé qīng dān。qǔ xiāo bú huì tíng zhǐ zhǔ jī qīng lǐ。diū shī huí fù shì bù què dìng jié guǒ，jué bù zì dòng chóng fù。"),
    PluginRemoveReported("Host acknowledged removal; inspect reported configuration separately from files and running work.", "主机已确认移除；请将报告配置与文件和运行中的工作分开检查。", "zhǔ jī yǐ què rèn yí chú；qǐng jiāng bào gào pèi zhì yǔ wén jiàn hé yùn xíng zhōng de gōng zuò fēn kāi jiǎn chá。"),
    PluginRemoveNotReported("The selected install is no longer reported. No removal was sent. Inspect host files separately.", "不再报告所选安装。未发送移除请求。请单独检查主机文件。", "bù zài bào gào suǒ xuǎn ān zhuāng。wèi fā sòng yí chú qǐng qiú。qǐng dān dú jiǎn chá zhǔ jī wén jiàn。"),
    PluginMemoryProviderCleared("Host reports memory-provider selection reset", "主机报告已重置记忆提供方选择", "zhǔ jī bào gào yǐ chóng zhì jì yì tí gōng fāng xuǎn zé"),
    PluginRemoveObservation("Verification means this user install is no longer reported. A bundled or package fallback may still appear under the same key. It does not prove bytes were erased, grants revoked at the provider, or execution stopped.", "验证表示不再报告此用户安装。同一键下仍可能出现内置或软件包回退。它不能证明字节已擦除、提供方授权已撤销或执行已停止。", "yàn zhèng biǎo shì bù zài bào gào cǐ yòng hù ān zhuāng。tóng yī jiàn xià réng kě néng chū xiàn huí tuì。tā bù néng zhèng míng zì jié yǐ cā chú、shòu quán yǐ chè xiāo huò zhí xíng yǐ tíng zhǐ。"),
    PluginEnable("Review plugin enable", "审核启用插件", "shěn hé qǐ yòng chā jiàn"),
    PluginDisable("Review plugin disable", "审核停用插件", "shěn hé tíng yòng chā jiàn"),
    PluginToggleUnsupported("The reported state or canonical key cannot be safely addressed here. Refresh and inspect it on the host.", "无法在此安全指定报告状态或规范键。请刷新并在主机检查。", "wú fǎ zài cǐ ān quán zhǐ dìng bào gào zhuàng tài huò guī fàn jiàn。qǐng shuā xīn bìng zài zhǔ jī jiǎn chá。"),
    PluginEnableEffect("Enabling changes this profile's plugin selection and can change the host dependency environment shared with other profiles, load host code, wire handlers and add its toolset to saved platform selections. Live features, new-session features and restart requirements are separate host reports.", "启用会更改此配置的插件选择，可能更改与其他配置共享的主机依赖环境、加载主机代码、连接处理程序并向已保存的平台选择添加工具集。即时功能、新会话功能和重启要求是独立的主机报告。", "qǐ yòng huì gēng gǎi cǐ pèi zhì de chā jiàn xuǎn zé，kě néng zhǔn bèi yī lài huán jìng、jiā zǎi zhǔ jī dài mǎ、lián jiē chǔ lǐ chéng xù bìng tiān jiā gōng jù jí。"),
    PluginDisableEffect("Disabling changes configuration, can change the shared host dependency environment, and removes its toolset from saved platform selections. Running gateway handlers remain loaded until restart; existing work may continue. This does not stop a plugin, revoke its credentials or remove its files.", "停用会更改配置，可能更改共享主机依赖环境，并从已保存的平台选择移除工具集。运行中的网关处理程序在重启前仍保持加载；现有工作可能继续。这不会停止插件、撤销凭据或删除文件。", "tíng yòng huì gēng gǎi pèi zhì bìng yí chú gōng jù jí。yùn xíng zhōng de wǎng guān chǔ lǐ chéng xù zài chóng qǐ qián réng bǎo chí jiā zǎi；xiàn yǒu gōng zuò kě néng jì xù。"),
    PluginToggleLimit("The app checks fresh inventory before one change and reads configuration afterward. Concurrent host edits can still race; there is no plugin revision compare-and-set. Waiting or cancellation does not stop host work. Lost replies are retained as uncertain and never automatically repeated.", "应用会在一次更改前检查最新清单，随后读取配置。并发主机编辑仍可能冲突；插件没有版本比较后设置。等待或取消不会停止主机工作。丢失回复会保留为不确定，绝不自动重复。", "yìng yòng huì zài yī cì gēng gǎi qián jiǎn chá zuì xīn qīng dān，suí hòu dú qǔ pèi zhì。diū shī huí fù huì bǎo liú wéi bù què dìng，jué bù zì dòng chóng fù。"),
    PluginToggleReported("Host-reported plugin change", "主机报告的插件更改", "zhǔ jī bào gào de chā jiàn gēng gǎi"),
    PluginToggleDetailsUnavailable("The host acknowledged the plugin change; optional activation details are unavailable.", "主机已确认插件更改；可选激活详情不可用。", "zhǔ jī yǐ què rèn chā jiàn gēng gǎi；kě xuǎn jī huó xiáng qíng bù kě yòng。"),
    PluginToggleObservation("Configuration observation does not prove live runtime state, completed execution or which actor caused it.", "配置观察不能证明实时运行状态、执行完成或由哪个操作者引起。", "pèi zhì guān chá bù néng zhèng míng shí shí yùn xíng zhuàng tài、zhí xíng wán chéng huò yóu nǎ gè cāo zuò zhě yǐn qǐ。"),
    PluginInstall("Review agent plugin installation","审核智能体插件安装","Shěnhé zhìnéngtǐ chājiàn ānzhuāng"),
    PluginInstallEnable("Enable through this installation request","通过此次安装请求启用","Tōngguò cǐ cì ānzhuāng qǐngqiú qǐyòng"),
    PluginInstallUnsupported("Installation needs an inspected agent component, HTTPS/SSH source and supported commit. Desktop UI components require the host desktop app.","安装需要检查过的智能体组件、HTTPS/SSH 源及受支持的提交。桌面界面组件需要主机桌面应用。","Ānzhuāng xūyào jiǎnchá guò de zhìnéngtǐ zǔjiàn, HTTPS/SSH yuán jí shòu zhīchí de tíjiāo. Zhuōmiàn jièmiàn zǔjiàn xūyào zhǔjī zhuōmiàn yìngyòng."),
    PluginApprovedCommit("Approved commit","批准的提交","Pīzhǔn de tíjiāo"),
    PluginEnableRequested("Enable requested by this installation","此次安装请求启用","Cǐ cì ānzhuāng qǐngqiú qǐyòng"),
    PluginEnableNotRequested("Enable was not requested; host configuration can still select installed code.","未请求启用；主机配置仍可能选择已安装代码。","Wèi qǐngqiú qǐyòng; zhǔjī pèizhì réng kěnéng xuǎnzé yǐ ānzhuāng dàimǎ."),
    PluginInstallEffect("Installs agent plugin files on the selected host/profile without force replacement. Plugin code uses host resources available to Hermes. Its desktop UI does not run in Android. Inspection detects components, not code safety.","在所选主机和配置安装智能体插件文件，不强制替换。插件代码使用 Hermes 可访问的主机资源。其桌面界面不在 Android 中运行。检查识别组件，不代表代码安全。","Zài suǒ xuǎn zhǔjī hé pèizhì ānzhuāng zhìnéngtǐ chājiàn wénjiàn, bù qiángzhì tìhuàn. Chājiàn dàimǎ shǐyòng Hermes kě fǎngwèn de zhǔjī zīyuán. Qí zhuōmiàn jièmiàn bù zài Android zhōng yùnxíng. Jiǎnchá shíbié zǔjiàn, bù dàibiǎo dàimǎ ānquán."),
    PluginInstallEnableEffect("Enabling also authorizes Hermes to prepare the plugin's Python dependencies and activate it. Reported live features, features deferred to a new session and restart requirements are separate.","启用也授权 Hermes 准备插件的 Python 依赖并激活插件。报告的即时功能、新会话生效功能和重启要求分别处理。","Qǐyòng yě shòuquán Hermes zhǔnbèi chājiàn de Python yīlài bìng jīhuó chājiàn. Bàogào de jíshí gōngnéng, xīn huìhuà shēngxiào gōngnéng hé chóngqǐ yāoqiú fēnbié chǔlǐ."),
    PluginInstallGuardEffect("Hermes checks the inspected commit before publication. Catalog source/path metadata can change after preflight. Waiting is bounded to ten minutes; cancellation or a lost reply does not stop host work. An uncertain request is never repeated automatically.","Hermes 在发布前检查已检查的提交。预检后目录源或路径元数据仍可能变化。等待最长十分钟；取消或丢失回复不会停止主机任务。不确定的请求绝不自动重复。","Hermes zài fābù qián jiǎnchá yǐ jiǎnchá de tíjiāo. Yùjiǎn hòu mùlù yuán huò lùjìng yuán shùjù réng kěnéng biànhuà. Děngdài zuì cháng shí fēnzhōng; qǔxiāo huò diūshī huífù bú huì tíngzhǐ zhǔjī rènwù. Bù quèdìng de qǐngqiú jué bù zìdòng chóngfù."),
    PluginInstallReported("Host reports plugin installation; activation and current configuration are separate observations.","主机报告插件已安装；激活与当前配置需分别观察。","Zhǔjī bàogào chājiàn yǐ ānzhuāng; jīhuó yǔ dāngqián pèizhì xū fēnbié guānchá."),
    PluginInstallSourceChanged("Hermes refused publication because the source moved. Inspect and review it again.","源已变化，Hermes 拒绝发布。请重新检查并审核。","Yuán yǐ biànhuà, Hermes jùjué fābù. Qǐng chóngxīn jiǎnchá bìng shěnhé."),
    PluginInstallDetailsUnavailable("Installation acknowledgement was retained; optional activation details were unavailable.","已保留安装确认；可选激活详情不可用。","Yǐ bǎoliú ānzhuāng quèrèn; kěxuǎn jīhuó xiángqíng bù kěyòng."),
    PluginRestartRequired("Host reports restart required","主机报告需要重启","Zhǔjī bàogào xūyào chóngqǐ"),
    PluginGatewayReloaded("Host reports gateway reload","主机报告网关已重新加载","Zhǔjī bàogào wǎngguān yǐ chóngxīn jiāzài"),
    PluginPythonDependencyCount("Reported Python dependency count","报告的 Python 依赖数量","Bàogào de Python yīlài shùliàng"),
    PluginMissingEnv("Host environment keys needed","需要的主机环境变量名称","Xūyào de zhǔjī huánjìng biànliàng míngchēng"),
    PluginActivatedNow("Host reports active now","主机报告即时激活","Zhǔjī bàogào jíshí jīhuó"),
    PluginDeferred("Deferred until a new session","新会话生效","Xīn huìhuà shēngxiào"),
    PluginReportedLive("Host reports available in open chats","主机报告在现有聊天可用","Zhǔjī bàogào zài xiànyǒu liáotiān kěyòng"),
    PluginActivationUnavailable("Activation details were not reported.","未报告激活详情。","Wèi bàogào jīhuó xiángqíng."),
    PluginHostDetails("Inspect host setup/logs for missing dependencies or server errors.","请检查主机设置或日志，了解缺少的依赖或服务器错误。","Qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī shèzhì huò rìzhì, liǎojiě quēshǎo de yīlài huò fúwùqì cuòwù."),
    PluginReportedYes("Yes","是","Shì"),
    PluginReportedNo("No","否","Fǒu"),

    PluginCatalog("Plugin catalog and sources","插件目录与源","Chājiàn mùlù yǔ yuán"),
    PluginFeatured("Featured for this host","此主机的精选插件","Cǐ zhǔjī de jīngxuǎn chājiàn"),
    PluginCatalogName("Catalog plugin name","目录插件名称","Mùlù chājiàn míngchēng"),
    PluginLookup("Find catalog entry","查找目录条目","Cházhǎo mùlù tiáomù"),
    PluginRepository("Repository identifier","仓库标识","Cāngkù biāozhì"),
    PluginInspect("Inspect plugin source","检查插件源","Jiǎnchá chājiàn yuán"),
    PluginSourceInvalid("Use an HTTPS URL without embedded credentials, an owner/repository path, or a git@ SSH identifier.","请使用无内嵌凭据的 HTTPS 地址、所有者/仓库路径或 git@ SSH 标识。","Qǐng shǐyòng wú nèiqiàn píngjù de HTTPS dìzhǐ, suǒyǒuzhě/cāngkù lùjìng huò git@ SSH biāozhì."),
    PluginCatalogUnknown("This catalog name is unknown or withdrawn.","此目录名称未知或已撤回。","Cǐ mùlù míngchēng wèizhī huò yǐ chèhuí."),
    PluginCatalogInvalidName("The host refused this catalog-name format.","主机拒绝此目录名称格式。","Zhǔjī jùjué cǐ mùlù míngchēng géshì."),
    PluginCatalogUnavailable("The host could not read a plugin catalog.","主机无法读取插件目录。","Zhǔjī wúfǎ dúqǔ chājiàn mùlù."),
    PluginCatalogBoundary("Reads the host's featured selection or looks up one catalog name. The host may use its cached or bundled catalog, fetch pinned manifests and check local application availability. Reported application availability describes this host.","读取主机精选列表或查找单个目录名称。主机可能使用缓存或内置目录、获取固定版本清单并检查本地应用可用性。报告的应用可用性描述此主机。","Dúqǔ zhǔjī jīngxuǎn lièbiǎo huò cházhǎo dān gè mùlù míngchēng. Zhǔjī kěnéng shǐyòng huǎncún huò nèizhì mùlù, huòqǔ gùdìng bǎnběn qīngdān bìng jiǎnchá běndì yìngyòng kěyòngxìng. Bàogào de yìngyòng kěyòngxìng miáoshù cǐ zhǔjī."),
    PluginInspectionEffect("The host may clone this source to inspect its plugin components and commit. A successful inspection may be reused for ten minutes. It installs nothing. Cancelling this wait does not stop a host clone; an explicit later inspection may join that work.","主机可能克隆此源以检查插件组件和提交。成功检查可能复用十分钟。不会安装内容。取消等待不会停止主机克隆；以后明确发起的检查可能加入该任务。","Zhǔjī kěnéng kèlóng cǐ yuán yǐ jiǎnchá chājiàn zǔjiàn hé tíjiāo. Chénggōng jiǎnchá kěnéng fùyòng shí fēnzhōng. Bú huì ānzhuāng nèiróng. Qǔxiāo děngdài bú huì tíngzhǐ zhǔjī kèlóng; yǐhòu míngquè fāqǐ de jiǎnchá kěnéng jiārù gāi rènwù."),
    PluginInspectionRejected("The host could not inspect this source. Inspect its logs for details.","主机无法检查此源。请查看主机日志了解详情。","Zhǔjī wúfǎ jiǎnchá cǐ yuán. Qǐng chákàn zhǔjī rìzhì liǎojiě xiángqíng."),
    PluginInspectionPin("Host-inspected commit","主机检查的提交","Zhǔjī jiǎnchá de tíjiāo"),
    PluginAgentComponent("Agent plugin component reported","报告了智能体插件组件","Bàogào le zhìnéngtǐ chājiàn zǔjiàn"),
    PluginNoAgentComponent("No agent plugin component reported","未报告智能体插件组件","Wèi bàogào zhìnéngtǐ chājiàn zǔjiàn"),
    PluginDesktopComponent("Desktop UI component reported; it runs in the host desktop app.","报告了桌面界面组件；它在主机桌面应用中运行。","Bàogào le zhuōmiàn jièmiàn zǔjiàn; tā zài zhǔjī zhuōmiàn yìngyòng zhōng yùnxíng."),
    PluginNoDesktopComponent("No desktop UI component reported","未报告桌面界面组件","Wèi bàogào zhuōmiàn jièmiàn zǔjiàn"),
    PluginSourceInsecure("The host reports an insecure source scheme.","主机报告源协议不安全。","Zhǔjī bàogào yuán xiéyì bù ānquán."),
    PluginDetails("Plugin details","插件详情","Chājiàn xiángqíng"),
    HostPlugins("Host plugins","主机插件","Zhǔjī chājiàn"),
    PluginRead("Read host plugins","读取主机插件","Dúqǔ zhǔjī chājiàn"),
    PluginInventoryBoundary("Reported plugin configuration for the requested profile. Runtime status and available updates are host reports; this read does not install, enable or update plugins.","所请求配置的插件报告。运行状态和可用更新由主机报告；此读取不会安装、启用或更新插件。","Suǒ qǐngqiú pèizhì de chājiàn bàogào. Yùnxíng zhuàngtài hé kěyòng gēngxīn yóu zhǔjī bàogào; cǐ dúqǔ bú huì ānzhuāng, qǐyòng huò gēngxīn chājiàn."),
    PluginProfileUnsupported("Select an explicit gateway profile. This alias cannot be verified safely.","请选择明确的网关配置。无法安全验证此别名。","Qǐng xuǎnzé míngquè de wǎngguān pèizhì. Wúfǎ ānquán yànzhèng cǐ biémíng."),
    PluginInventoryInvalid("Plugin metadata is unsupported or inconsistent. No plugin change was sent.","插件元数据不受支持或不一致。未发送插件更改。","Chājiàn yuán shùjù bù shòu zhīchí huò bù yīzhì. Wèi fāsòng chājiàn gēnggǎi."),
    PluginUserCount("User plugins","用户插件","Yònghù chājiàn"),
    PluginBundledCount("Bundled plugins","内置插件","Nèizhì chājiàn"),
    PluginServers("Plugin server reports","插件服务器报告","Chājiàn fúwùqì bàogào"),
    PluginTools("Reported tools","报告的工具","Bàogào de gōngjù"),
    PluginUpdateReported("Host reports an available update","主机报告有可用更新","Zhǔjī bàogào yǒu kěyòng gēngxīn"),
    PluginNoUpdateReported("Host reports no available update","主机报告无可用更新","Zhǔjī bàogào wú kěyòng gēngxīn"),
    SkillHubInstalledManagement("Manage Hub installations","管理技能中心安装","Guǎnlǐ jìnéng zhōngxīn ānzhuāng"),
    SkillHubInstalledUnavailable("Installed Hub metadata is unavailable or inconsistent. Refresh or inspect the host before changing files.","已安装技能中心元数据不可用或不一致。更改文件前请刷新或检查主机。","Yǐ ānzhuāng jìnéng zhōngxīn yuán shùjù bù kěyòng huò bù yīzhì. Gēnggǎi wénjiàn qián qǐng shuāxīn huò jiǎnchá zhǔjī."),
    SkillHubRemove("Remove Hub skill","移除技能中心技能","Yíchú jìnéng zhōngxīn jìnéng"),
    SkillHubUpdateAll("Update all Hub skills in this profile","更新此配置的全部技能中心技能","Gēngxīn cǐ pèizhì de quánbù jìnéng zhōngxīn jìnéng"),
    SkillHubRemoveEffect("Starts host removal of this Hub skill by installed name. It deletes the skill directory, including local edits, and its Hub lock entry. Removal is irreversible here; existing agent work may continue.","按安装名称启动主机移除。将删除技能目录（包括本地修改）及技能中心锁记录。此处无法撤销；现有智能体任务可能继续。","Àn ānzhuāng míngchēng qǐdòng zhǔjī yíchú. Jiāng shānchú jìnéng mùlù (bāokuò běndì xiūgǎi) jí jìnéng zhōngxīn suǒ jìlù. Cǐchù wúfǎ chèxiāo; xiànyǒu zhìnéngtǐ rènwù kěnéng jìxù."),
    SkillHubUpdateAllEffect("Starts updates for every Hub skill in this profile, including skills added before the process reads its inventory. The host keeps detected local edits and otherwise replaces skill directories when updates are available. The phone does not review each new version.","更新此配置的所有技能中心技能，包括进程读取清单前新添加的技能。主机保留检测到的本地修改，否则在有更新时替换技能目录。手机不会审核每个新版本。","Gēngxīn cǐ pèizhì de suǒyǒu jìnéng zhōngxīn jìnéng, bāokuò jìnchéng dúqǔ qīngdān qián xīn tiānjiā de jìnéng. Zhǔjī bǎoliú jiǎncè dào de běndì xiūgǎi, fǒuzé zài yǒu gēngxīn shí tìhuàn jìnéng mùlù. Shǒujī bú huì shěnhé měi gè xīn bǎnběn."),
    SkillHubUpdatePolicy("Hermes uses its force-update scan policy: caution or review-needed findings may be overridden. Dangerous community/trusted bundles remain blocked. Inspect host logs for individual outcomes.","Hermes 使用强制更新扫描策略：警告或需要审核的结果可能被覆盖。危险的社区或受信任来源技能包仍被阻止。请检查主机日志了解各项结果。","Hermes shǐyòng qiángzhì gēngxīn sǎomiáo cèlüè: jǐnggào huò xūyào shěnhé de jiéguǒ kěnéng bèi fùgài. Wēixiǎn de shèqū huò shòu xìnrèn láiyuán jìnéng bāo réng bèi zǔzhǐ. Qǐng jiǎnchá zhǔjī rìzhì liǎojiě gè xiàng jiéguǒ."),
    SkillHubMaintenanceRace("The host accepts no revision guard. Current metadata cannot pin files against concurrent edits. Acceptance reports process startup only; cancelling this wait does not stop host work.","主机不支持版本保护。当前元数据无法防止并发文件修改。接受仅表示进程启动；取消等待不会停止主机任务。","Zhǔjī bù zhīchí bǎnběn bǎohù. Dāngqián yuán shùjù wúfǎ fángzhǐ bìngfā wénjiàn xiūgǎi. Jiēshòu jǐn biǎoshì jìnchéng qǐdòng; qǔxiāo děngdài bú huì tíngzhǐ zhǔjī rènwù."),
    SkillHubMaintenanceAccepted("Host accepted skill maintenance startup. Removal/update outcomes are unverified; inspect installed skills or host logs separately.","主机已接受技能维护启动。移除或更新结果未经验证；请另行检查已安装技能或主机日志。","Zhǔjī yǐ jiēshòu jìnéng wéihù qǐdòng. Yíchú huò gēngxīn jiéguǒ wèi jīng yànzhèng; qǐng lìngxíng jiǎnchá yǐ ānzhuāng jìnéng huò zhǔjī rìzhì."),
    SkillHubInstall("Review skill installation","审核技能安装","Shěnhé jìnéng ānzhuāng"),
    SkillHubInstallUnavailable("Installation requires preview content, a qualified Hub identifier and an allowed host scan. Bundled skill restoration requires host setup.","安装需要预览内容、完整的技能中心标识和主机扫描许可。内置技能恢复需要在主机设置。","Ānzhuāng xūyào yùlǎn nèiróng, wánzhěng de jìnéng zhōngxīn biāozhì hé zhǔjī sǎomiáo xǔkě. Nèizhì jìnéng huīfù xūyào zài zhǔjī shèzhì."),
    SkillHubInstallEffect("Starts the host installer for this profile. It downloads and scans again, then writes skill files if allowed. Optional scanner findings remain advisory. Acceptance only reports process startup; cancellation of waiting does not stop the installer.","启动此配置的主机安装程序。程序再次下载和扫描，获准后写入技能文件。可选扫描结果仍为建议。接受仅表示进程启动；取消等待不会停止安装程序。","Qǐdòng cǐ pèizhì de zhǔjī ānzhuāng chéngxù. Chéngxù zàicì xiàzài hé sǎomiáo, huòzhǔn hòu xiěrù jìnéng wénjiàn. Kěxuǎn sǎomiáo jiéguǒ réng wéi jiànyì. Jiēshòu jǐn biǎoshì jìnchéng qǐdòng; qǔxiāo děngdài bú huì tíngzhǐ ānzhuāng chéngxù."),
    SkillHubMutableSource("Source content and host files can change after review. Hermes accepts no content pin or revision guard here. Fresh preview, scan and duplicate checks detect observed changes; they cannot guarantee identical installed bytes.","审核后源内容和主机文件仍可能变化。此接口不支持内容固定或版本保护。重新预览、扫描和重复检查可发现已观察到的变化，但不能保证安装字节完全相同。","Shěnhé hòu yuán nèiróng hé zhǔjī wénjiàn réng kěnéng biànhuà. Cǐ jiēkǒu bù zhīchí nèiróng gùdìng huò bǎnběn bǎohù. Chóngxīn yùlǎn, sǎomiáo hé chóngfù jiǎnchá kě fāxiàn yǐ guānchá dào de biànhuà, dàn bù néng bǎozhèng ānzhuāng zìjié wánquán xiāngtóng."),
    SkillHubInstallAccepted("Host accepted installer startup. Installation completion is unverified; inspect current installed skills or the host logs separately.","主机已接受安装程序启动。安装完成情况未经验证；请另行查看当前已安装技能或主机日志。","Zhǔjī yǐ jiēshòu ānzhuāng chéngxù qǐdòng. Ānzhuāng wánchéng qíngkuàng wèi jīng yànzhèng; qǐng lìngxíng chákàn dāngqián yǐ ānzhuāng jìnéng huò zhǔjī rìzhì."),
    SkillHub("Skill Hub","技能中心","Jìnéng zhōngxīn"),
    SkillHubOfficial("Official catalog","官方目录","Guānfāng mùlù"),
